text: ["All morph costs cost {2} more. (This doesn't affect the cost to cast creature spells face down.)", "Ancient Ooze's power and toughness are each equal to the total mana value of other creatures you control.", 'Any number of target players each discard a number of cards equal to the highest mana value among permanents you control.', 'Any number of target players each gain life equal to the highest mana value among permanents you control.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, exile X creature cards from your graveyard.\\nTarget creature gets -X/-X until end of turn.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a creature.\\nDraw two cards.', "At the beginning of each player's upkeep, Sulfuric Vortex deals 2 damage to that player.\\nIf a player would gain life, that player gains no life instead.", "At the beginning of each player's upkeep, that player sacrifices a non-Zombie creature.\\nAt the beginning of the end step, if no creatures are on the battlefield, sacrifice Call to the Grave.", "At the beginning of your upkeep, Form of the Dragon deals 5 damage to any target.\\nAt the beginning of each end step, your life total becomes 5.\\nCreatures without flying can't attack you.", 'Beast spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.\\n{1}{G}: Regenerate target Beast.', "Bladewing's Thrall has flying as long as you control a Dragon.\\nWhen a Dragon enters the battlefield, you may return Bladewing's Thrall from your graveyard to the battlefield.", "Carbonize deals 3 damage to any target. If it's a creature, it can't be regenerated this turn, and if it would die this turn, exile it instead.", "Carrion Feeder can't block.\\nSacrifice a creature: Put a +1/+1 counter on Carrion Feeder.", 'Choose one —\\n• You gain 6 life.\\n• Prevent the next 6 damage that would be dealt to target creature this turn.', 'Claws of Wirewood deals 3 damage to each creature with flying and each player.\\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Cleric spells you cast cost {W}{B} less to cast. This effect reduces only the amount of colored mana you pay. (For example, if you cast a Cleric spell with mana cost {1}{W}, it costs {1} to cast.)', "Counter target activated or triggered ability. (Mana abilities can't be targeted.)", 'Counter target spell if its mana value is less than or equal to the highest mana value among permanents you control.', 'Counter target spell unless its controller pays {2}.\\nStorm (When you cast this spell, copy it for each spell cast before it this turn. You may choose new targets for the copies.)', 'Create X 4/4 white Angel creature tokens with flying.\\nCycling {2}{W} ({2}{W}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)\\nWhen you cycle Decree of Justice, you may pay {X}. If you do, create X 1/1 white Soldier creature tokens.', 'Create a 4/4 green Beast creature token.\\nStorm (When you cast this spell, copy it for each spell cast before it this turn.)', 'Creature spells you cast that share a creature type with Mistform Warchief cost {1} less to cast.\\n{T}: Mistform Warchief becomes the creature type of your choice until end of turn.', 'Creature spells you cast with mana value 6 or greater cost {2} less to cast.', "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\\nFlying\\nWhen Ageless Sentinels blocks, it becomes a Bird Giant, and it loses defender. (It's no longer a Wall. This effect lasts indefinitely.)", "Destroy all creatures. They can't be regenerated. Draw a card for each creature destroyed this way.\\nCycling {3}{B}{B} ({3}{B}{B}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)\\nWhen you cycle Decree of Pain, all creatures get -2/-2 until end of turn.", 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment.\\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Dragon spells you cast cost {2} less to cast.', 'Draw cards equal to the highest mana value among permanents you control.', "Enchant creature\\nAt the beginning of the end step of enchanted creature's controller, that player sacrifices that creature.", "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature doesn't untap during its controller's untap step.\\nWhen enchanted creature is dealt damage, destroy it.", "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+0 and has fear. (It can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)\\nWhen a creature with mana value 6 or greater enters the battlefield, you may return Dragon Shadow from your graveyard to the battlefield attached to that creature.", 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+1 and has trample.\\nWhen a creature with mana value 6 or greater enters the battlefield, you may return Dragon Fangs from your graveyard to the battlefield attached to that creature.', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+2 and has vigilance.\\nWhen a creature with mana value 6 or greater enters the battlefield, you may return Dragon Scales from your graveyard to the battlefield attached to that creature.', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 for each other creature on the battlefield that shares a creature type with it.', "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +3/+3 as long as it's a Zombie. Otherwise, it gets -3/-3.", 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature has flying.\\nCycling {1}{U} ({1}{U}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)\\nWhen a creature with mana value 6 or greater enters the battlefield, you may return Dragon Wings from your graveyard to the battlefield attached to that creature.', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature has haste.\\n{R}: Enchanted creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn.\\nWhen a creature with mana value 6 or greater enters the battlefield, you may return Dragon Breath from your graveyard to the battlefield attached to that creature.', "Enchant creature\\nWhen enchanted creature is turned face up, destroy it. It can't be regenerated.", 'Enchant creature\\nWhenever enchanted creature attacks, it deals 2 damage to any target.', 'Enchant creature\\nWhenever enchanted creature deals combat damage to a player, you may search your library for a basic land card, put that card onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'Enchant creature\\nWhenever enchanted creature deals damage, Guilty Conscience deals that much damage to that creature.', "Enchant creature\\n{U}: Untap enchanted creature.\\n{U}: Enchanted creature gains flying until end of turn.\\n{U}: Enchanted creature gains shroud until end of turn. (It can't be the target of spells or abilities.)\\n{1}: Enchanted creature gets +1/-1 or -1/+1 until end of turn.", 'Enchant nonbasic land\\nWhen enchanted land becomes tapped, destroy it.', 'Exile all artifacts, creatures, and lands from the battlefield, all cards from all graveyards, and all cards from all hands.\\nCycling {5}{R}{R} ({5}{R}{R}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)\\nWhen you cycle Decree of Annihilation, destroy all lands.', "Exile all permanents. For as long as any of those cards remain exiled, at the beginning of each player's upkeep, that player returns one of the exiled cards they own to the battlefield.", 'Exile target enchantment.\\nCycling {3} ({3}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'First strike, protection from red', 'Flying, protection from Dragons', 'Flying, protection from green', 'Flying, trample\\nDouble strike (This creature deals both first-strike and regular combat damage.)\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Dragon Tyrant unless you pay {R}{R}{R}{R}.\\n{R}: Dragon Tyrant gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\nIslandcycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Search your library for an Island card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.)', 'Flying\\nMorph {3}{W} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)\\nWhen Aven Liberator is turned face up, target creature you control gains protection from the color of your choice until end of turn.', 'Flying\\nPrevent all damage that would be dealt to Dawn Elemental.', 'Flying\\nWhen Bladewing the Risen enters the battlefield, you may return target Dragon permanent card from your graveyard to the battlefield.\\n{B}{R}: Dragon creatures get +1/+1 until end of turn.', "Flying\\nWhen Death's-Head Buzzard dies, all creatures get -1/-1 until end of turn.", 'Flying\\nWhenever Dragon Mage deals combat damage to a player, each player discards their hand, then draws seven cards.', "Flying\\nWhenever Mercurial Kite deals combat damage to a creature, tap that creature. That creature doesn't untap during its controller's next untap step.", "Flying\\nWhenever Xantid Swarm attacks, defending player can't cast spells this turn.", 'Flying\\nWhenever a creature dealt damage by Soul Collector this turn dies, return that card to the battlefield under your control.\\nMorph {B}{B}{B} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)', 'Flying\\nWhenever a permanent is turned face up, put a +1/+1 counter on Aven Farseer.', 'Flying\\n{3}{U}: Tap all creatures with toughness 2 or less.\\n{3}{U}: All other creatures lose flying until end of turn.', 'Flying\\n{3}{W}{W}: Return Eternal Dragon from your graveyard to your hand. Activate only during your upkeep.\\nPlainscycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Search your library for a Plains card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.)', 'Forestcycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Search your library for a Forest card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.)', 'Forests you control are 1/1 green Elf creatures that are still lands.\\n{1}{G}, Sacrifice an Elf: Target creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn.', 'Goblin Brigand attacks each combat if able.', 'Goblin War Strike deals damage to target player or planeswalker equal to the number of Goblins you control.', 'Goblin spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.\\nGoblins you control have haste.', "Haste\\nAt the beginning of each player's upkeep, that player untaps Karona, False God and gains control of it.\\nWhenever Karona attacks, creatures of the creature type of your choice get +3/+3 until end of turn.", 'If damage would be dealt to you, put that many depletion counters on Force Bubble instead.\\nWhen there are four or more depletion counters on Force Bubble, sacrifice it.\\nAt the beginning of each end step, remove all depletion counters from Force Bubble.', 'Morph {0} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)\\nWhen Proteus Machine is turned face up, it becomes the creature type of your choice. (This effect lasts indefinitely.)', 'Morph {1}{U}{U} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)\\nWhen Riptide Survivor is turned face up, discard two cards, then draw three cards.', 'Morph {2}{G}{G} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)\\nWhen Woodcloaker is turned face up, target creature gains trample until end of turn.', "Morph {3}{W}{W} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)\\nWhen Karona's Zealot is turned face up, all damage that would be dealt to it this turn is dealt to target creature instead.", 'Morph {5}{G}{G} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)\\nWhen Root Elemental is turned face up, you may put a creature card from your hand onto the battlefield.', 'Morph {U} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)', 'Morph {W} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)\\nWhen Frontline Strategist is turned face up, prevent all combat damage non-Soldier creatures would deal this turn.', 'Morph—Discard a Zombie card. (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)', 'Morph—Pay 5 life. (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)', "Morph—Return a Bird you control to its owner's hand. (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)", 'Morph—Sacrifice two Mountains. (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)\\nWhen Skirk Volcanist is turned face up, it deals 3 damage divided as you choose among one, two, or three target creatures.', 'Pay 3 life: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.', "Players can't cycle cards.", "Players don't lose unspent mana as steps and phases end.", 'Put four +1/+1 counters on each creature you control.\\nCycling {4}{G}{G} ({4}{G}{G}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)\\nWhen you cycle Decree of Savagery, you may put four +1/+1 counters on target creature.', "Put target permanent an opponent controls on top of its owner's library. That opponent may put an artifact, creature, enchantment, or land card from their hand onto the battlefield.", 'Rain of Blades deals 1 damage to each attacking creature.', "Return an Elf you control to its owner's hand: Untap target creature. Activate only once each turn.", 'Return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.\\nStorm (When you cast this spell, copy it for each spell cast before it this turn. You may choose new targets for the copies.)', "Return target permanent to its owner's hand.\\nStorm (When you cast this spell, copy it for each spell cast before it this turn. You may choose new targets for the copies.)", 'Reveal the first card you draw each turn. Whenever you reveal a creature card this way, draw a card.', 'Scattershot deals 1 damage to target creature.\\nStorm (When you cast this spell, copy it for each spell cast before it this turn. You may choose new targets for the copies.)', 'Search your library for a Dragon permanent card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.\\nStorm (When you cast this spell, copy it for each spell cast before it this turn.)', 'Search your library for a basic land card, reveal that card, put it into your hand, then shuffle.\\nStorm (When you cast this spell, copy it for each spell cast before it this turn.)', 'Search your library for a card, then shuffle and put that card third from the top.', 'Shuffle your library. Then exile the top card of your library. Until end of turn, you may play that card without paying its mana cost.\\nStorm (When you cast this spell, copy it for each spell cast before it this turn.)', 'Soldier spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.\\nSoldier creatures you control get +1/+2.', 'Spark Spray deals 1 damage to any target.\\nCycling {R} ({R}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Target creature gets +1/+2 until end of turn.\\nStorm (When you cast this spell, copy it for each spell cast before it this turn. You may choose new targets for the copies.)', 'Target creature gets +X/+0 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +X/+X until end of turn, where X is the highest mana value among permanents you control.', 'Target player discards two cards.\\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Target player loses 2 life and you gain 2 life.\\nStorm (When you cast this spell, copy it for each spell cast before it this turn. You may choose new targets for the copies.)', 'Target player loses life equal to the damage already dealt to that player this turn.', 'Target player mills three cards.\\nStorm (When you cast this spell, copy it for each spell cast before it this turn. You may choose new targets for the copies.)', 'Target player sacrifices a permanent.', 'Target player sacrifices an attacking creature.\\nStorm (When you cast this spell, copy it for each spell cast before it this turn. You may choose new targets for the copies.)', 'Torrent of Fire deals damage to any target equal to the highest mana value among permanents you control.', 'Trample\\nMorph {4}{G}{G}{G} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)', "Treetop Scout can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.", 'Until end of turn, lands you control gain "{T}: Add one mana of any color."', 'Vigilance\\nPlainscycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Search your library for a Plains card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.)', 'When Day of the Dragons enters the battlefield, exile all creatures you control. Then create that many 5/5 red Dragon creature tokens with flying.\\nWhen Day of the Dragons leaves the battlefield, sacrifice all Dragons you control. Then return the exiled cards to the battlefield under your control.', 'When Fierce Empath enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a creature card with mana value 6 or greater, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', 'When Parallel Thoughts enters the battlefield, search your library for seven cards, exile them in a face-down pile, and shuffle that pile. Then shuffle your library.\\nIf you would draw a card, you may instead put the top card of the pile you exiled into your hand.', 'When Siege-Gang Commander enters the battlefield, create three 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens.\\n{1}{R}, Sacrifice a Goblin: Siege-Gang Commander deals 2 damage to any target.', 'Whenever Goblin Psychopath attacks or blocks, flip a coin. If you lose the flip, the next time it would deal combat damage this turn, it deals that damage to you instead.', 'Whenever Nefashu attacks, up to five target creatures each get -1/-1 until end of turn.', 'Whenever Raven Guild Master deals combat damage to a player, that player exiles the top ten cards of their library.\\nMorph {2}{U}{U} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)', 'Whenever Vengeful Dead or another Zombie dies, each opponent loses 1 life.', 'Whenever a Cleric creature you control becomes the target of a spell or ability, it gets +0/+2 until end of turn.', 'Whenever a creature dies, tap all untapped creatures that share a creature type with it or untap all tapped creatures that share a creature type with it.', 'Whenever a creature enters the battlefield, destroy it.\\n{0}: Destroy Lethal Vapors. You skip your next turn. Any player may activate this ability.', 'Whenever a permanent is turned face up, Bonethorn Valesk deals 1 damage to any target.', 'Whenever a permanent is turned face up, you may draw a card.', 'Whenever a player casts a spell with mana value 3 or less, Pyrostatic Pillar deals 2 damage to that player.', 'Whenever a player casts a spell, you may put a +1/+1 counter on Forgotten Ancient.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may move any number of +1/+1 counters from Forgotten Ancient onto other creatures.', 'Whenever a spell or ability is put onto the stack, if it has a single target, reselect its target at random. (Select from among all legal targets.)', 'Whenever an opponent casts a spell, counter that spell and put a depletion counter on Decree of Silence. If there are three or more depletion counters on Decree of Silence, sacrifice it.\\nCycling {4}{U}{U} ({4}{U}{U}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)\\nWhen you cycle Decree of Silence, you may counter target spell.', 'Whenever you cast a creature spell with mana value 6 or greater, put three +1/+1 counters on Kurgadon.', "You can't cast this spell if you've played a land this turn.\\nYou can't play lands if you've cast Rock Jockey this turn.", "You gain shroud until end of turn. (You can't be the target of spells or abilities.)\\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)", 'Zombie spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.\\nZombie creatures you control get +2/+1.', '{1}{W}: The next 1 damage that would be dealt to Zealous Inquisitor this turn is dealt to target creature instead.', '{2}{B}{B}: Target creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn. Put a +1/+1 counter on Consumptive Goo.', '{2}{W}, {T}: Put a trap counter on target land you control.\\nSacrifice a land with a trap counter on it: Trap Digger deals 3 damage to target attacking creature without flying.', '{3}, {T}, Sacrifice Ark of Blight: Destroy target land.', '{3}: Search your library for a Sliver card, reveal that card, put it into your hand, then shuffle.\\n{3}: Gain control of target Sliver. (This effect lasts indefinitely.)', '{3}{U}{U}: Turn Mischievous Quanar face down.\\nMorph {1}{U}{U} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)\\nWhen Mischievous Quanar is turned face up, copy target instant or sorcery spell. You may choose new targets for that copy.', '{B}: Regenerate Twisted Abomination.\\nSwampcycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Search your library for a Swamp card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.)', '{R}: Chartooth Cougar gets +1/+0 until end of turn.\\nMountaincycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Search your library for a Mountain card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.)', '{T}: Add {C}{C}. Activate only if you control five or more lands.', '{T}: Add {G}{G}{G}.\\nForestcycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Search your library for a Forest card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.)', '{X}{B}, {T}: Target player reveals X cards from their hand and you choose one of them. That player discards that card. Activate only as a sorcery.']
flavor: ['"Finally, a use for that head of yours."\\n—Braids, dementia summoner', '"Fire, aim, ready!"', '"Hear only the Cabal\'s voice.\\nSee only the Cabal\'s way.\\nSpeak only the Cabal\'s word."\\n—Cabal mantra', '"Hold that thought."\\n—Pemmin, Riptide survivor', '"I only return what rightly belongs to another."', '"If I wanted your opinion, I\'d have told you what it was."\\n—Pemmin, Riptide survivor', '"Limitless power is glorious until you gain limitless understanding."\\n—Ixidor, reality sculptor', '"Looks bad. I don\'t know if he\'ll make it through the night."\\n—Cabal cleric', '"Maybe next time."', '"No good will come of this."', '"Once I was human. Now I am far more."', '"Perhaps extra heads would have served them better."\\n—Foothill guide', '"Rise once more, so you may continue to destroy our enemies."\\n—Karona, false god', '"Sit."', '"The ignorant fear change; the wise use it as a weapon."', '"The light of the Ancestor will scour the taint of darkness from the land."', '"Wait, it\'ll come to me in a minute."', '"We speak the dragons\' language of flame and rage. They speak our language of fury and honor. Together we shall weave a tale of destruction without equal."', '"When the skies are filled with flames, the brave shall step forward to quench them."\\n—Order prophecy', '"When you have drunk your fill, pass the cup to others who thirst."', '"Whoever survives the first blow lives to land the second."', '"You wear that shell as a mask. Now it\'s your coffin."\\n—Cabal cleric', '"You wouldn\'t like me when I\'m angry."', '"You\'ll bend to my will—with or without your precious sanity."', 'After the Skirk Ridge collapsed, the goblins erected a system of ropes and pulleys to hold up what was left.', 'Ancient carvings in the trees of Krosa glow with power once again.', 'At home among the swaying, supple branches of the treetops, some scouts live their entire lives never touching ground.', 'Barbarians weave its spurs into ceremonial charms to proclaim their hardiness in battle.', 'Cabal initiates enter training full of hopes and fears. They graduate with neither.', 'Dragon fire melts any instrument designed to measure it.', "Goblins don't know much about physics, but they know lots about falling and rocks.", 'He lifts the spirits of his people so they may descend in wrath upon their foes.', "He's desperate to hold back the future because he has seen it.", "His enemies' trickery and deceit only fuel his righteous anger.", 'His victories speak for him.', "If it's not one thing, it's another.", "Infested with vermin, ever hungering, dropping from night's sky.", 'It drinks fatigue.', 'It eagerly gobbles up bits of its own rotting flesh as they fall to the swampy ground.', 'It has the strength of seven men. In fact, it used to be seven men.', 'It turns prey into predator.', 'It was midnight on the Daru Plains, yet it seemed the sun was rising.', "It's the only kind of shower goblins will tolerate.", 'Its blood is life. Its body is growth.', 'Its food just got a lot smaller and its stomach a lot bigger.', 'Nature has forgotten its own rules.', "Once again, Kamahl felt the full force of the Mirari's pull, but he had learned much since the last time.", 'Only when the anger passed did Varv realize he had burned down his home, destroyed his weapons, and killed his friend Furt.', "Otaria's last defense against the wave of chaos threatening to engulf it.", 'Silent as fog and relentless as plague, it is wet, creeping death.', "Some days it's better to stay inside.", 'Some say they are the weapons of heroes fallen in battle, eager for one last chance at glory.', 'Stinking of rot, it leaps between gravestones in search of its next meal.', 'Tall as a tree and probably related.', 'The Raven Guild soars on winds of unease.', "The aven came to fear the forest's clawing branches, but the watchers quickly renewed their courage.", 'The best leaders are made by their followers.', 'The destruction he causes is nothing next to the chaos in his mind.', 'The end of evolution.', 'The grounds of the Riptide Project are now populated only by slivers, broken beakers, and the lonely screeching of gulls.', 'The hand of death recognizes its own.', 'The ooze has always been. The ooze will always be.', 'The pain of a lifetime—every scrape, illness, and bruise—condensed into a single moment.', 'The single-mindedness of a zombie, the cunning of an assassin.', 'The symbols are spread throughout Aphetto, marking sites where minions of the Raven Guild and the Cabal can seek refuge.', 'The ties that bind can also strangle.', 'The vapors infiltrate every crevice, poison every lung, and snuff out every life.', 'They poured from the Skirk Ridge like lava, burning and devouring everything in their path.', 'They say the forest has eyes. They never mention its claws.', 'Those who bring nothing to the temple take nothing away.', "Those who don't learn from their deaths are destined to repeat them.", "Those who most feel guilt don't need to, while those who most need to feel guilt never do.\\n—Order proverb", 'When it walks through Krosa, trees step aside, leaves take wing, and the ground shudders.', 'When opened, it erases entire landscapes from minds and maps.', 'When the world is consumed by chaos, the skilled and the foolish are on equal footing.', 'When they land on you, all you can think about is tearing them off.', 'Where the nefashu pass, blood rolls like a silk carpet.', 'With natural laws abandoned, excess thrives.']
artist: ['Adam Rex', 'Alan Pollack', 'Alex Horley-Orlandelli', 'Anthony S. Waters', 'Arnie Swekel', 'Ben Thompson', 'Brian Snõddy', 'Carl Critchlow', 'Christopher Moeller', 'Dany Orizio', 'Daren Bader', 'Darrell Riche', 'Dave Dorman', 'David Martin', 'Edward P. Beard, Jr.', 'Eric Peterson', 'Erica Gassalasca-Jape', 'Glen Angus', 'Greg Hildebrandt', 'Greg Hildebrandt & Tim Hildebrandt', 'Greg Staples', 'Jim Nelson', 'John Avon', 'Justin Sweet', 'Kev Walker', 'Lars Grant-West', 'Luca Zontini', 'Marcelo Vignali', 'Mark Tedin', 'Matt Cavotta', 'Matt Thompson', 'Matthew D. Wilson', 'Michael Sutfin', 'Pete Venters', 'Richard Sardinha', 'Rob Alexander', 'Ron Spencer', 'Scott M. Fischer', 'Thomas M. Baxa', 'Tim Hildebrandt', 'Tony Szczudlo', 'Wayne England', 'rk post']
