rulings: ["[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Alpha Status counts each creature once if that creature shares at least one creature type with the enchanted creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'An activated ability has a “Cost: Effect” format. Look for the colon. A triggered ability starts with “when”, “whenever”, or “at”.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It can target delayed triggered abilities. For example, a card that says “Whenever a player cycles a card, you may exile target creature. If you do, return that creature to the battlefield at the beginning of the end step.” triggers when a player cycles a card and creates a delayed trigger that happens at the beginning of the end step. You can choose to target the “at the beginning of the end step” trigger when it is placed on the stack at end of turn.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Turn-based actions and special actions like the normal card draw, combat damage, or turning a face-down creature face up can’t be targeted.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Damage that is prevented does not count toward the total.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Each player chooses which one of their exiled cards to return during each of their upkeeps.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Remember that the returned creature just came under your control, so it can’t attack until you start a turn with it under your control.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You can’t pick a card that can’t legally be returned to the battlefield. If there are no cards that can be legally returned, then you can’t pick one.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If it targets itself, it gets both -1/-1 and the +1/+1 counter during resolution. Since state-based actions (like being at zero toughness) are not checked until resolution is done, it does not die.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'If the card is not played by end of turn, it remains exiled until end of game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The card is face-up when exiled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': "A copy of a spell can be countered like any other spell, but it must be countered individually. Countering a spell with storm won\'t affect the copies."}, {\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': "Spells cast from zones other than a player\'s hand and spells that were countered are counted by the storm ability."}, {\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': "The copies are put directly onto the stack. They aren\'t cast and won\'t be counted by other spells with storm cast later in the turn."}, {\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': \'The triggered ability that creates the copies can itself be countered by anything that can counter a triggered ability. If it is countered, no copies will be put onto the stack.\'}]', "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If there are fewer than 3 cards in your library, put the card on the bottom of your library.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If there are multiple legal targets, it may still choose the original one.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If there are no other legal targets, it keeps its target.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The ability triggers when a spell or ability is put on the stack, and this target-changing ability itself goes on the stack. This means that the spell or ability keeps its original target until this ability resolves. You determine the new target when this ability resolves, at which time the set of legal targets may have changed.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If you control more than one, each time you take damage you can decide which one replaces the damage, and that one replaces all of the damage. You can’t split the damage between them. You decide each time you take damage. Note that damage from multiple sources that happens at one time (such as combat damage) gives one choice, not one per source.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If you take 6 damage at once, it will replace all 6 damage and put 6 counters on it. Then the second ability will trigger. Any additional damage you take before this ability resolves also results in counters, but once the ability resolves, this card is sacrificed.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The effect does not prevent damage, it replaces it so the damage is neither dealt or prevented.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If you have fewer than 7 cards in your library, exile them all.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You can choose to take the top card from the pile (and not draw) even if there are no cards in the pile. This allows you to skip draws.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You can’t look at the face down cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If you have less than 2 cards in your hand, discard all the cards you have. If you have no cards in hand, you can discard zero and draw 3.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If you have more than one of these cards on the battlefield, only one card is revealed (both of them reveal the same card). Both of them will trigger if this card is a creature and thereby allow you to draw 2 cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If you have more than one of these on the battlefield, the cost reduction is cumulative.'}, {'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'If a spell has hybrid mana symbols in its mana cost, you choose which half you will be paying before determining the total cost. If you choose to pay such a cost with {W} or {B}, Edgewalker can reduce that part of the cost.'}, {'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'You apply cost reduction effects after other cost modifiers, so it can reduce additional costs or alternative costs if they include {W} and/or {B}.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If you life total was above 5 at end of turn, then you lose life to make your total 5. If it was less than 5, you gain life to bring it to 5.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It sets your life total at the beginning of the end step of every player’s turn, not just your own.'}, {'date': '2014-02-01', 'text': 'Unless some effect explicitly says otherwise, a creature that can’t attack you can still attack a planeswalker you control.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It becomes both creature type Giant and creature type Bird.'}, {'date': '2005-08-01', 'text': 'Once it stops being a Wall, it can attack because it also loses Defender.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It only triggers if the land becomes tapped after this Aura is on it. Attaching it to a tapped land will not destroy the land until the next time the land is untapped and then tapped again.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The ability only triggers if this card is face up at the time the creature is put into the graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The ability triggers when it attacks or block and resolves before combat damage is assigned. This gives you a chance to possibly get rid of it before it hurts you.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The creature type is checked for “non-Soldier” at the time the damage would be dealt. If the creature that is dealing the damage is not on the battlefield, use its creature type right before it left the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The first ability applies only while this card is in your hand (or someplace else you can cast it from).'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The second ability applies only while this card is on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This affects both Cycling and Landcycling.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You add up the mana value of all other creatures you control. Remember that tokens and face-down creatures have a cost of zero.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You can use a text-changing effect that changes creature types on this card while is it face down to change Zombie to something else. This will change the type of card you have to discard to turn it face up.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You choose whether to tap or untap during resolution.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You either tap all of them or untap all of them. You can’t tap some and untap others.'}]", "[{'date': '2007-05-01', 'text': 'Creatures with the Reach ability (such as Giant Spider) don’t actually have Flying, so they can’t block this.'}]", "[{'date': '2007-05-01', 'text': 'Triggers when any permanent is turned face up, not just a creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'A noncreature permanent that turns into a creature can attack, and its {T} abilities can be activated, only if its controller has continuously controlled that permanent since the beginning of their most recent turn. It doesn’t matter how long the permanent has been a creature.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': \'Cycling is an activated ability. Effects that interact with activated abilities (such as Stifle or Rings of Brighthearth) will interact with cycling. Effects that interact with spells (such as Remove Soul or Faerie Tauntings) will not.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': "The cycling ability and the triggered ability are separate. If the triggered ability doesn\'t resolve (due to being countered with Stifle, for example, or if all its targets have become illegal), the cycling ability will still resolve and you\'ll draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': \'When you cycle this card, first the cycling ability goes on the stack, then the triggered ability goes on the stack on top of it. The triggered ability will resolve before you draw a card from the cycling ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': "You can cycle this card even if there are no targets for the triggered ability. That\'s because the cycling ability itself has no targets."}]', "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Cycling is an activated ability. Effects that interact with activated abilities (such as Stifle or Rings of Brighthearth) will interact with cycling. Effects that interact with spells (such as Remove Soul or Faerie Tauntings) will not.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'The cycling ability and the triggered ability are separate. If the triggered ability doesn’t resolve (due to being countered with Stifle, for example, or if all its targets have become illegal), the cycling ability will still resolve and you’ll draw a card.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'When you cycle this card, first the cycling ability goes on the stack, then the triggered ability goes on the stack on top of it. The triggered ability will resolve before you draw a card from the cycling ability.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'You can cycle this card even if there are no targets for the triggered ability. That’s because the cycling ability itself has no targets.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Cycling is an activated ability. Effects that interact with activated abilities (such as Stifle or Rings of Brighthearth) will interact with cycling. Effects that interact with spells (such as Remove Soul or Faerie Tauntings) will not.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'The cycling ability and the triggered ability are separate. If the triggered ability doesn’t resolve (due to being countered with Stifle, for example, or if all its targets have become illegal), the cycling ability will still resolve and you’ll draw a card.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'When you cycle this card, first the cycling ability goes on the stack, then the triggered ability goes on the stack on top of it. The triggered ability will resolve before you draw a card from the cycling ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Cycling is an activated ability. Effects that interact with activated abilities (such as Stifle or Rings of Brighthearth) will interact with cycling. Effects that interact with spells (such as Remove Soul or Faerie Tauntings) will not.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-02-01', 'text': 'Forestcycling is a form of cycling. Any ability that triggers on a card being cycled also triggers on Forestcycling this card. Any ability that stops a cycling ability from being activated also stops Forestcycling from being activated.'}, {'date': '2009-02-01', 'text': 'Forestcycling is an activated ability. Effects that interact with activated abilities (such as Stifle or Rings of Brighthearth) will interact with Forestcycling. Effects that interact with spells (such as Remove Soul or Faerie Tauntings) will not.'}, {'date': '2009-02-01', 'text': 'Unlike the normal cycling ability, Forestcycling doesn’t allow you to draw a card. Instead, it lets you search your library for a Forest card. After you find a Forest card in your library, you reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle your library.'}, {'date': '2009-02-01', 'text': 'You can choose to find any card with the Forest land type, including nonbasic lands. You can also choose not to find a card, even if there is a Forest card in your library.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': \'Mountaincycling is a form of cycling. Any ability that triggers on a card being cycled also triggers on Mountaincycling this card. Any ability that stops a cycling ability from being activated also stops Mountaincycling from being activated.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': \'Mountaincycling is an activated ability. Effects that interact with activated abilities (such as Stifle or Rings of Brighthearth) will interact with Mountaincycling. Effects that interact with spells (such as Remove Soul or Faerie Tauntings) will not.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "Unlike the normal cycling ability, Mountaincycling doesn\'t allow you to draw a card. Instead, it lets you search your library for a Mountain card. After you find a Mountain card in your library, you reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle your library."}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': \'You can choose to find any card with the Mountain land type, including nonbasic lands. You can also choose not to find a card, even if there is a Mountain card in your library.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': \'Plainscycling is a form of cycling. Any ability that triggers on a card being cycled also triggers on Plainscycling this card. Any ability that stops a cycling ability from being activated also stops Plainscycling from being activated.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': \'Plainscycling is an activated ability. Effects that interact with activated abilities (such as Stifle or Rings of Brighthearth) will interact with Plainscycling. Effects that interact with spells (such as Remove Soul or Faerie Tauntings) will not.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "Unlike the normal cycling ability, Plainscycling doesn\'t allow you to draw a card. Instead, it lets you search your library for a Plains card. After you find a Plains card in your library, you reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle your library."}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': \'You can choose to find any card with the Plains land type, including nonbasic lands. You can also choose not to find a card, even if there is a Plains card in your library.\'}]', "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Players can keep mana in their pool indefinitely while this is on the battlefield, but once it leaves the battlefield, they have until the end of the current step (or phase) to use the mana before it disappears.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If a player controls no creatures, or each creature they control is a Zombie, that player does nothing when the first ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If there is at least one creature on the battlefield at the beginning of the end step, the last ability won’t trigger. If it does trigger, but a creature enters the battlefield before it resolves, the ability won’t do anything when it resolves. Call to the Grave’s controller won’t sacrifice it.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Call to the Grave will trigger twice during each team’s upkeep, once for each player. Each of the two players will sacrifice a non-Zombie creature when the ability referring to that player resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If a spell with split second is on the stack, you can still respond by turning this creature face up and targeting that spell with the trigger. This is because split second only stops players from casting spells or activating abilities, while turning a creature face up is a special action.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Players can only respond once this spell has been cast and all its costs have been paid. No one can try to destroy the creature you sacrificed to prevent you from casting this spell.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'You must sacrifice exactly one creature to cast this spell; you cannot cast it without sacrificing a creature, and you cannot sacrifice additional creatures.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': "A copy of a spell can be countered like any other spell, but it must be countered individually. Countering a spell with storm won\'t affect the copies."}, {\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': "Spells cast from zones other than a player\'s hand and spells that were countered are counted by the storm ability."}, {\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': "The copies are put directly onto the stack. They aren\'t cast and won\'t be counted by other spells with storm cast later in the turn."}, {\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': \'The triggered ability that creates the copies can itself be countered by anything that can counter a triggered ability. If it is countered, no copies will be put onto the stack.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': \'You may choose new targets for any of the copies. You can choose differently for each copy.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': "A copy of a spell can be countered like any other spell, but it must be countered individually. Countering a spell with storm won\'t affect the copies."}, {\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': "Spells cast from zones other than a player\'s hand and spells that were countered are counted by the storm ability."}, {\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': "The copies are put directly onto the stack. They aren\'t cast and won\'t be counted by other spells with storm cast later in the turn."}, {\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': \'The triggered ability that creates the copies can itself be countered by anything that can counter a triggered ability. If it is countered, no copies will be put onto the stack.\'}]', "[{'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'A copy of a spell can be countered like any other spell, but it must be countered individually. Countering a spell with storm won’t affect the copies.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'Spells cast from zones other than a player’s hand and spells that were countered are counted by the storm ability.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'The copies are put directly onto the stack. They aren’t cast and won’t be counted by other spells with storm cast later in the turn.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'The triggered ability that creates the copies can itself be countered by anything that can counter a triggered ability. If it is countered, no copies will be put onto the stack.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'You may choose new targets for any of the copies. You can choose differently for each copy.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'A copy of a spell can be countered like any other spell, but it must be countered individually. Countering a spell with storm won’t affect the copies.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'Spells cast from zones other than a player’s hand and spells that were countered are counted by the storm ability.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'The copies are put directly onto the stack. They aren’t cast and won’t be counted by other spells with storm cast later in the turn.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'The triggered ability that creates the copies can itself be countered by anything that can counter a triggered ability. If it is countered, no copies will be put onto the stack.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, only the player Xantid Swarm attacked is affected. Other defending players may cast spells.'}, {'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'The defending player may cast spells before Xantid Swarm’s triggered ability resolves.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': \'Swampcycling is a form of cycling. Any ability that triggers on a card being cycled also triggers on Swampcycling this card. Any ability that stops a cycling ability from being activated also stops Swampcycling from being activated.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': \'Swampcycling is an activated ability. Effects that interact with activated abilities (such as Stifle or Rings of Brighthearth) will interact with Swampcycling. Effects that interact with spells (such as Remove Soul or Faerie Tauntings) will not.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': "Unlike the normal cycling ability, Swampcycling doesn\'t allow you to draw a card. Instead, it lets you search your library for a Swamp card. After you find a Swamp card in your library, you reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle your library."}, {\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': \'You can choose to find any card with the Swamp land type, including nonbasic lands. You can also choose not to find a card, even if there is a Swamp card in your library.\'}]', "[{'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'The targeted creature can’t be regenerated and is exiled if it would die no matter why it would die this turn. It doesn’t have to be destroyed because of the damage Carbonize deals to it.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'All of the nontoken creatures you exiled return to the battlefield when Day of the Dragons leaves the battlefield, even if some or all of the Dragon tokens had already left the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Auras attached to the exiled creatures will be put into their owners’ graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled creatures will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled creatures will cease to exist.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If Day of the Dragons leaves the battlefield before its first ability has resolved, its second ability will trigger and you’ll sacrifice any Dragons you already control. Then its first ability will resolve and exile your creatures forever, leaving you with that many Dragon tokens.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Token creatures will count to determine how many Dragon tokens you create, but they won’t be returned to the battlefield when Day of the Dragons leaves the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'The second ability of Bladewing’s Thrall triggers even if a Dragon enters the battlefield under an opponent’s control. The owner of Bladewing’s Thrall, not the controller of that Dragon, will control Bladewing’s Thrall.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "The last ability of Death\'s-Head Buzzard affects only creatures on the battlefield at the time it resolves. Creatures that enter the battlefield later in the turn won\'t get -1/-1."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': \'A mana cost of {X}{X} means that you pay twice X. If you want X to be 3, you pay {8}{W}{W} to cast Decree of Justice.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "The cycling ability and the triggered ability are separate. If the triggered ability doesn\'t resolve (because, for example, it has been countered, or all of its targets have become illegal), the cycling ability will still resolve, and you\'ll draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': \'When you cycle this card, first the cycling ability goes on the stack, then the triggered ability goes on the stack on top of it. The triggered ability will resolve before you draw a card from the cycling ability.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': \'If multiple replacement effects would modify how damage would be dealt, the player being dealt damage (or the controller of the permanent being dealt damage) chooses the order in which to apply those effects.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If the target creature leaves the battlefield or stops being a creature before damage would be dealt, that damage is not redirected. For example, if you choose a 1/1 creature, then Karona\'s Zealot would be dealt 3 damage, all 3 is dealt instead to the 1/1 creature, which then dies. If Karona\'s Zealot would be dealt 3 damage again later in the turn, the 1/1 creature is no longer on the battlefield, so the damage is not redirected."}]', "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Goblin Warchief’s effect reduces only generic mana in the cost of Goblin spells you cast. For example, it doesn’t reduce the cost of Skirk Prospector below {R}.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'An “attacking creature” is one that has been declared as an attacker or put onto the battlefield attacking during a turn’s combat. Unless that creature leaves combat, it continues to be an attacking creature through the end of combat step, even if the player it was attacking has left the game or the planeswalker it was attacking has left combat.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If you cast Wing Shards after combat damage has been dealt, only creatures that survived combat can be sacrificed.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Storm counts spells cast before the spell with storm was cast. Spells cast after the spell with storm was cast but before the storm ability resolves aren’t counted.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'The copies storm creates are created on the stack, so they’re not cast. Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell (such as storm) won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'The storm ability and the copies it creates all resolve before the spell with storm. They resolve even if the spell with storm is countered.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Wing Shards doesn’t target the creature to be sacrificed. The target player chooses the creature as it resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'If a player has fewer than seven cards in their library, that player loses the game after Dragon Mage’s triggered ability resolves. If each player loses the game this way, the game’s a draw.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If a card in a player\'s library has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0."}]', "[{'date': '2020-08-07', 'text': 'If a permanent on the battlefield has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "The cycling ability and the triggered ability are separate. If the triggered ability doesn\'t resolve (because, for example, it has been countered, or all of its targets have become illegal), the cycling ability will still resolve, and you\'ll draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': \'When you cycle this card, first the cycling ability goes on the stack, then the triggered ability goes on the stack on top of it. The triggered ability will resolve before you draw a card from the cycling ability.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "You can sacrifice any Goblin you control to activate Siege-Gang Commander\'s activated ability, including Siege-Gang Commander itself."}]', "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Any ability that triggers whenever a card is cycled will trigger if you activate a forestcycling ability.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Forestcycling is a variant of the cycling ability. Unlike cycling (which allows you to draw a card), forestcycling allows you to search your library for a Forest card. The card you find can be a basic Forest or any land card with the Forest land type.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Forgotten Ancient’s first ability will resolve before the spell that caused it to trigger. Putting a +1/+1 counter on Forgotten Ancient is optional.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Forgotten Ancient’s last ability doesn’t target any creatures. You choose how many +1/+1 counters will be moved (and onto which creatures) as the ability resolves. Notably, once the ability starts resolving and you make these choices, no player may take actions until the ability has finished resolving.'}]"]
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': \'Aasfresser\', \'text\': \'Der Aasfresser kann nicht blocken.\\nOpfere eine Kreatur: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Aasfresser.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Einen penetranten Geruch der Verwesung ausströmend huscht er von Grabstein zu Grabstein auf der Suche nach seiner nächsten Mahlzeit.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166016&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7796a4eb-b782-40af-859d-e24e5bc126cc\', \'multiverseId\': 166016}, \'multiverseid\': 166016}, {\'name\': \'Comedor de carroña\', \'text\': \'El Comedor de carroña no puede bloquear.\\nSacrificar una criatura: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Comedor de carroña.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Apestando a podredumbre, salta entre las lápidas en busca de su siguiente comida.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166589&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ddda7f0d-4421-476d-a733-8aaede6222db\', \'multiverseId\': 166589}, \'multiverseid\': 166589}, {\'name\': \'Bouffeur de charogne\', \'text\': \'Le Bouffeur de charogne ne peut pas bloquer.\\nSacrifiez une créature : Placez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Bouffeur de charogne.\', \'type\': \'Créature : zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Il renifle tombe après tombe, à la recherche des mets les plus délicieux.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166159&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'125788f5-d17c-45bf-9234-cd4e9cb2545e\', \'multiverseId\': 166159}, \'multiverseid\': 166159}, {\'name\': \'Mangiacarogne\', \'text\': \'Il Mangiacarogne non può bloccare.\\nSacrifica una creatura: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Mangiacarogne.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': "Accompagnato dalla puzza di decomposizione, salta da una lapide all\'altra in cerca del suo prossimo pasto.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166302&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03d6a8e3-7ed0-49a0-b2a8-863593744f99\', \'multiverseId\': 166302}, \'multiverseid\': 166302}, {\'name\': \'屍肉喰らい\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e25b4b6-7b00-4395-9021-14ace767bbc4\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Comedor de Podridão\', \'text\': \'Comedor de Podridão não pode bloquear.\\nSacrifique uma criatura: Coloque um marcador +1/+1 sobre Comedor de Podridão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi\', \'flavor\': \'Fedendo a podridão, ele pula entre as lápides procurando sua próxima refeição.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166445&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd420db2-3598-4aff-82c8-976ecec74e87\', \'multiverseId\': 166445}, \'multiverseid\': 166445}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abweichendes Wachstum\', \'text\': \'Bis zum Ende des Zuges erhalten Länder, die du kontrollierst „{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe."\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Die Natur hat ihre eigenen Regeln vergessen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166073&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1582a784-e482-427c-b028-5d928f9bb9d6\', \'multiverseId\': 166073}, \'multiverseid\': 166073}, {\'name\': \'Crecimiento divergente\', \'text\': \'Hasta el final del turno, las tierras que controles ganan "{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color a tu reserva de maná".\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'La naturaleza ha olvidado sus propias reglas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166646&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35e6cfd5-62e1-47de-905c-8a605d1c6552\', \'multiverseId\': 166646}, \'multiverseid\': 166646}, {\'name\': \'Croissance absurde\', \'text\': "Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, les terrains que vous contrôlez gagnent : « {T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix à votre réserve. »", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'La nature a oublié ses propres règles.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166216&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8e79826-071e-40de-ad75-6ad60e369f1c\', \'multiverseId\': 166216}, \'multiverseid\': 166216}, {\'name\': \'Crescita Divergente\', \'text\': \'Fino alla fine del turno, le terre che controlli guadagnano "{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore alla tua riserva".\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'La natura ha dimenticato le proprie leggi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166359&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5401e415-fedb-4e84-be78-b114ff35f772\', \'multiverseId\': 166359}, \'multiverseid\': 166359}, {\'name\': \'多様化する成長\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81795028-1bac-4aa2-9d73-6cb5ecdddfa7\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Crescimento Divergente\', \'text\': \'Até o final do turno, os terrenos que você controla ganham "{T}: Adiciona uma mana de qualquer cor à sua reserva de mana."\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'A natureza esqueceu suas próprias regras.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166502&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60d5470f-bd15-4883-9742-f9770300249f\', \'multiverseId\': 166502}, \'multiverseid\': 166502}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abwürgen\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere eine aktivierte oder ausgelöste Fähigkeit deiner Wahl. (Manafähigkeiten können nicht neutralisiert werden.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Würde mich deine Meinung interessieren, hätte ich sie dir schon gesagt." —Pemmin, Überlebender des Springflutprojekts\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166009&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a361dfcc-76c7-400d-9135-6d61b1ed0d49\', \'multiverseId\': 166009}, \'multiverseid\': 166009}, {\'name\': \'Reprimir\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta la habilidad objetivo activada o disparada. (Las habilidades de maná no pueden ser contrarrestadas.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Si hubiera querido tu opinión, te habría dicho cuál era". Pemmin, sobreviviente del Proyecto Resaca\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166582&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78263c2e-a011-421a-8683-0c6501259fd4\', \'multiverseId\': 166582}, \'multiverseid\': 166582}, {\'name\': \'Asphyxie\', \'text\': \'Contrez la capacité activée ou déclenchée ciblée. (Les capacités de mana ne peuvent pas être contrées.)\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Si je voulais votre opinion, je vous dirais ce qu\'elle devrait être. » —Pemmin, rescapé du projet Jusant", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166152&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3c86a8e-c9d7-47e3-b2b3-64d12eb9a63c\', \'multiverseId\': 166152}, \'multiverseid\': 166152}, {\'name\': \'Reprimere\', \'text\': "Neutralizza un\'abilità attivata o innescata bersaglio (le abilità di mana non possono essere neutralizzate).", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Se avessi voluto la tua opinione, ti avrei detto qual era". —Pemmin, sopravvissuto della Marea\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166295&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c74a0b12-2772-42e3-8608-717ba8c3c5d5\', \'multiverseId\': 166295}, \'multiverseid\': 166295}, {\'name\': \'もみ消し\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15b81be2-8572-4b6c-95de-f7c8f2676ec4\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Asfixiar\', \'text\': \'Anula a habilidade ativada ou desencadeada alvo. (Habilidades de mana não podem ser anuladas.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Se quisesse a tua opinião, eu teria te falado qual seria." —Pemmin, sobrevivente da Rebentação\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166438&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5249114-6969-4dab-bb0f-0c9276282033\', \'multiverseId\': 166438}, \'multiverseid\': 166438}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anschlag der Goblins\', \'text\': \'Anschlag der Goblins fügt einem Spieler deiner Wahl Schadenspunkte in Höhe der Anzahl der Goblins, die du kontrollierst, zu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Feuer frei, Zielen, Bereit"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166053&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13230cd7-7304-4017-a420-c9ffe74bffe6\', \'multiverseId\': 166053}, \'multiverseid\': 166053}, {\'name\': \'Ataque de guerra trasgo\', \'text\': \'El Ataque de guerra trasgo hace una cantidad de daño igual al número de Trasgos que controles al jugador objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Fuego, apunten, preparen".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166626&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b357744f-63fd-4a9a-84d0-3e595280b475\', \'multiverseId\': 166626}, \'multiverseid\': 166626}, {\'name\': \'Frappe guerrière des gobelins\', \'text\': \'La Frappe guerrière des gobelins inflige au joueur ciblé autant de blessures que le nombre de gobelins que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Feu En joue Paré ... Enfin, je crois. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166196&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9433f4bd-fb9c-459e-b757-1677a840ccb9\', \'multiverseId\': 166196}, \'multiverseid\': 166196}, {\'name\': \'Offensiva dei Goblin\', \'text\': "L\'Offensiva dei Goblin infligge un danno pari al numero di Goblin che controlli a un giocatore bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Fuoco, mirate, pronti"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166339&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13b4ffbb-5f68-4ebd-bf28-854e65b4d54e\', \'multiverseId\': 166339}, \'multiverseid\': 166339}, {\'name\': \'ゴブリンの集中攻撃\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6df8ab6-9ee1-4642-85e5-3bcbb98814bc\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Investida Goblin\', \'text\': \'Investida Goblin causa ao jogador alvo uma quantidade de pontos de dano igual ao número de Goblins que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Fogo, apontar, preparar"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166482&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ec05986-a4f7-4953-8d06-067bdbf9a6be\', \'multiverseId\': 166482}, \'multiverseid\': 166482}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aphettonischer Runenleser\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur aufgedeckt wird, kannst du eine Karte ziehen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Unwissenden fürchten den Wechsel, die Weisen verwenden ihn als ihre Waffe."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165985&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87624932-9c39-4653-912c-d7884ebddf33\', \'multiverseId\': 165985}, \'multiverseid\': 165985}, {\'name\': \'Lanzarrunas de Afeto\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura se ponga boca arriba, puedes robar una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero\', \'flavor\': \'"Los ignorantes temen al cambio; los sabios lo usan como arma".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166558&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33bb8d21-5901-46df-9cdd-7787b39ea5d4\', \'multiverseId\': 166558}, \'multiverseid\': 166558}, {\'name\': \'Lanceur de runes aphettien\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature est retournée face visible, vous pouvez piocher une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« L\'ignorant craint le changement, le sage en fait une arme. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166128&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3093c24b-d550-4b68-a5ba-013623520d5f\', \'multiverseId\': 166128}, \'multiverseid\': 166128}, {\'name\': \'Tracciarune di Aphetto\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una creatura viene girata a faccia in su, puoi pescare una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"L\\\'ignorante teme il cambiamento; il saggio lo trasforma in un\\\'arma".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166271&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9001dd92-337b-4818-bb40-74f784878974\', \'multiverseId\': 166271}, \'multiverseid\': 166271}, {\'name\': \'アフェットのルーン術士\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e68944a5-9956-41e7-8111-e33d2847ba61\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Conjurador de Runas de Aphetto\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que a face de uma criatura for voltada para cima, você pode comprar um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Os ignorantes temem a mudança; os sábios usam-na como uma arma."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166414&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bce705d-fb53-4741-9cd5-ebaa463d3850\', \'multiverseId\': 166414}, \'multiverseid\': 166414}]', '[{\'name\': \'Astralstahl\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +1/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nSturm (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch spielst, kopiere ihn einmal für jeden Zauberspruch, der in diesem Zug bereits gespielt wurde. Du kannst andere Ziele für diese Kopien bestimmen.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165959&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89a97631-3ded-4b51-ac83-01d7a3c1ec4c\', \'multiverseId\': 165959}, \'multiverseid\': 165959}, {\'name\': \'Acero astral\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene +1/+2 hasta el final del turno.\\nTormenta (Cuando juegues este hechizo, cópialo por cada hechizo jugado antes que él en este turno. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para las copias.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166532&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e6cfefa-6f3d-423d-9848-d2f4155638fc\', \'multiverseId\': 166532}, \'multiverseid\': 166532}, {\'name\': \'Acier astral\', \'text\': "La créature ciblée gagne +1/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nDéluge (Quand vous jouez ce sort, copiez-le pour chaque sort joué avant lui ce tour-ci. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour chaque copie.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166102&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'931d5f42-31b3-44b8-bf2d-8f3d15ba9031\', \'multiverseId\': 166102}, \'multiverseid\': 166102}, {\'name\': \'Acciaio Astrale\', \'text\': \'La creatura bersaglio prende +1/+2 fino alla fine del turno.\\nTempesta (quando giochi questa magia, copiala una volta per ogni magia giocata prima di questa durante questo turno. Puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per le copie).\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166245&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e3dd168-05aa-4a18-b5ce-4ccf95a970dd\', \'multiverseId\': 166245}, \'multiverseid\': 166245}, {\'name\': \'鋼の霊体\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0110563f-a707-4690-95bb-47d2d614fd38\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Aço Astral\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe +1/+2 até o final do turno.\\nRajada (Quando você jogar esta mágica, faça uma cópia dela para cada mágica jogada antes dela neste turno. Você pode escolher novos alvos para as cópias.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166388&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c73d5e0e-bc8e-4765-9970-6724416d0a1e\', \'multiverseId\': 166388}, \'multiverseid\': 166388}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auseinanderbrechen\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl.\\nUmwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte aus deiner Hand ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Daraus wird nichts Gutes."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166070&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78400d71-87b3-4a54-8a31-9c2077d2227e\', \'multiverseId\': 166070}, \'multiverseid\': 166070}, {\'name\': \'Desbaratar\', \'text\': \'Destruye el artefacto o encantamiento objetivo.\\nCiclo {2}. {2}, descartar esta carta de tu mano: Roba una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Nada bueno resultará de esto".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166643&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e815e9cc-5c09-4ab4-896c-a15a47db9e42\', \'multiverseId\': 166643}, \'multiverseid\': 166643}, {\'name\': \'Déchirure\', \'text\': "Détruisez l\'artefact ciblé ou l\'enchantement ciblé.\\nRecyclage {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte de votre main : Piochez une carte.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Cela ne me dit rien qui vaille. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166213&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bffdf0fc-0372-4fc1-8882-184a4e1d2a97\', \'multiverseId\': 166213}, \'multiverseid\': 166213}, {\'name\': \'Fare a Pezzi\', \'text\': \'Distruggi un artefatto o un incantesimo bersaglio.\\nCiclo {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta dalla tua mano: Pesca una carta).\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Questo non porterà niente di buono".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166356&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4ed82e2-2cc8-4871-ad38-6e8aa41edc31\', \'multiverseId\': 166356}, \'multiverseid\': 166356}, {\'name\': \'破断\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48e47416-29a7-4f4c-a85b-97766f64551e\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Esmigalhar\', \'text\': \'Destrói o artefato alvo ou o encantamento alvo.\\nReciclar {2} ({2}, Descarte este card de sua mão: Compre um card.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Isto não trará nada de bom."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166499&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d518fbd1-6e0d-4a25-993d-ddad13c14755\', \'multiverseId\': 166499}, \'multiverseid\': 166499}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausströmen\', \'text\': \'Manavorräte werden am Ende von Phasen oder Zügen nicht mehr geleert. (Dieser Effekt verhindert Manabrand.)\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Erneut fühlte Kamahl die starke Anziehungskraft des Mirari, aber er hatte seit dem letzten Mal viel dazugelernt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166088&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2ca7bf4-30be-4d2c-9c40-f614b7a05c67\', \'multiverseId\': 166088}, \'multiverseid\': 166088}, {\'name\': \'Manar\', \'text\': \'Las reservas de maná no se vacían al final de fases o turnos. (Este efecto evita la quemadura de maná.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Nuevamente, Kamahl sintió la fuerza completa de la atracción del Mirari, pero había aprendido mucho desde la última vez.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166661&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55892f94-86e0-45b0-9bd2-5fddf6739d27\', \'multiverseId\': 166661}, \'multiverseid\': 166661}, {\'name\': \'Montée\', \'text\': \'Les réserves de mana ne se vident pas à la fin des phases ou des tours. (Cet effet empêche les brûlures de mana.)\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "Une fois encore, Kamahl ressentit la force de l\'appel du Mirari, mais il savait maintenant à quoi s\'en tenir.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166231&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8a22da8-2ea5-404c-9a1e-0300669a6975\', \'multiverseId\': 166231}, \'multiverseid\': 166231}, {\'name\': \'Innalzare\', \'text\': \'Le riserve di mana non si svuotano alla fine delle fasi o dei turni (questo effetto evita il danno da eccesso di mana).\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': "Nuovamente, Kamahl percepì la forza del richiamo del Mirari. Ma aveva imparato molto dall\'ultima volta.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166374&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1b41088-dfb4-4942-a06a-7d3005aee7df\', \'multiverseId\': 166374}, \'multiverseid\': 166374}, {\'name\': \'湧出\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d7972cc-5be0-40d8-bbb8-a826d6bf7e18\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Preenchimento\', \'text\': \'As reservas de mana não são esvaziadas no final de fases ou turnos. (Este efeito impede a queimadura de mana.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'Novamente, Kamahl sentiu toda a força do puxão do Mirari, mas tinha aprendido muito desde a última vez.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166517&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb769bb2-1580-42e5-aee0-6d2d68cf85b4\', \'multiverseId\': 166517}, \'multiverseid\': 166517}]', '[{\'name\': \'Avior-Befreier\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nMorph {3}{W} (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur spielen. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Morph-Kosten auf.)\\nWenn der Avior-Befreier aufgedeckt wird, erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, bis zum Ende des Zuges Schutz vor einer Farbe, die du bestimmst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165961&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a17202bc-285c-49dd-9faa-596f45b4ef23\', \'multiverseId\': 165961}, \'multiverseid\': 165961}, {\'name\': \'Libertador aven\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nMetamorfosis {3}{W}. (Puedes jugar esta carta boca abajo como una criatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Ponla boca arriba en cualquier momento pagando su coste de metamorfosis.)\\nCuando el Libertador aven se ponga boca arriba, la criatura objetivo que controles gana protección contra el color de tu elección hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado ave\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166534&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbc6e4df-2610-495d-a0be-8bbc5d7bd2a1\', \'multiverseId\': 166534}, \'multiverseid\': 166534}, {\'name\': \'Libérateur avemain\', \'text\': "Vol\\nMue {3}{W} (Vous pouvez jouer cette carte face cachée comme une créature 2/2 pour {3}. Retournez-la quand vous le désirez pour son coût de mue.)\\nQuand le Libérateur avemain est retourné face visible, la créature ciblée que vous contrôlez acquiert la protection contre la couleur de votre choix jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166104&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0449793-7408-4b71-bef9-e8dec92183ee\', \'multiverseId\': 166104}, \'multiverseid\': 166104}, {\'name\': \'Liberatore Aviano\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nMetamorfosi {3}{W} (puoi giocare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di metamorfosi.)\\nQuando il Liberatore Aviano viene girato a faccia in su, la creatura bersaglio che controlli guadagna protezione da un colore a tua scelta fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Uccello\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166247&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e45e86d4-2a95-4ba0-b26a-94a0bb301d89\', \'multiverseId\': 166247}, \'multiverseid\': 166247}, {\'name\': \'エイヴンの解放者\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'983ae9a5-a0a9-4748-9805-268458acb0bf\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Libertador Aviano\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nMetamorfose {3}{W} (Você pode baixar este card com a face voltada para baixo como uma criatura 2/2 por {3}. Volte sua face para cima a qualquer momento pagando seu custo de metamorfose.)\\nQuando a face de Libertador Aviano for voltada para cima, a criatura alvo ganha proteção contra a cor de sua escolha até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado Pássaro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166390&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16b39b09-d359-4202-be88-5135f3959af2\', \'multiverseId\': 166390}, \'multiverseid\': 166390}]', '[{\'name\': \'Avior-Weitblicker\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur aufgedeckt wird, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Avior-Weitblicker.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Das falsche Spiel seiner Gegner treibt ihn nur noch stärker an.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165960&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'723b825f-57cc-43fd-ae9b-4e2f9343f5cc\', \'multiverseId\': 165960}, \'multiverseid\': 165960}, {\'name\': \'Gran vidente aven\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que una criatura se ponga boca arriba, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Gran vidente aven.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado ave\', \'flavor\': \'Las artimañas y engaños de sus enemigos sólo alimentan su enojo justificado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166533&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de72e34a-bbf6-4469-a362-578444ec1c87\', \'multiverseId\': 166533}, \'multiverseid\': 166533}, {\'name\': \'Clairvoyant avemain\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature est retournée face visible, placez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Clairvoyant avemain.", \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau et soldat\', \'flavor\': "Les ruses et les tromperies de ses adversaires ne font qu\'alimenter sa juste rage.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166103&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5256a070-ccb5-4298-9443-5a57bf09580d\', \'multiverseId\': 166103}, \'multiverseid\': 166103}, {\'name\': \'Lungoveggente Aviano\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura viene girata a faccia in su, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Lungoveggente Aviano.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Uccello\', \'flavor\': \'I trucchi e gli inganni dei nemici servono solo ad alimentare la sua giusta ira.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166246&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce8fa711-8b79-4b4e-b909-233525cf9be7\', \'multiverseId\': 166246}, \'multiverseid\': 166246}, {\'name\': \'エイヴンの遠見\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'929d8106-bdd1-4493-90df-3ac41ba80401\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Previdente Aviano\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que a face de uma criatura for voltada para cima, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Previdente Aviano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado Pássaro\', \'flavor\': \'As trapaças e falácias de seus inimigos apenas abastecem sua fúria justificada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166389&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'533f46fe-e5ae-4a32-b550-1dddb8435c8a\', \'multiverseId\': 166389}, \'multiverseid\': 166389}]', '[{\'name\': \'Baumwipfelspäher\', \'text\': \'Der Baumwipfelspäher kann nur von fliegenden Kreaturen geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf\', \'flavor\': \'Sie sind in den schwingenden, biegsamen Ästen der Baumwipfel zu Hause, und manche Späher berühren ihr ganzes Leben lang nicht den Erdboden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166087&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87553570-ebc2-4207-a6d4-190eba0f0e7b\', \'multiverseId\': 166087}, \'multiverseid\': 166087}, {\'name\': \'Explorador de las copas\', \'text\': \'El Explorador de las copas no puede ser bloqueado excepto por criaturas que tengan la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'En su hogar, entre las ramas oscilantes y flexibles de las copas de los árboles, algunos exploradores pasan la vida entera sin tocar nunca el suelo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166660&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c17a86c7-d1d9-4ad5-a17e-520ab65eafc1\', \'multiverseId\': 166660}, \'multiverseid\': 166660}, {\'name\': \'Éclaireur arboricole\', \'text\': "L\'Éclaireur arboricole ne peut être bloqué que par des créatures avec le vol.", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe\', \'flavor\': "Dans leur élément parmi les branches souples et mouvantes des cimes, certains éclaireurs n\'ont jamais touché le sol de leur vie.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166230&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78521c64-4bf4-4830-8fb3-4ad249a05524\', \'multiverseId\': 166230}, \'multiverseid\': 166230}, {\'name\': \'Scout Arboricolo\', \'text\': \'Lo Scout Arboricolo non può essere bloccato tranne che da creature con volare.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'Pienamente a proprio agio tra i rami oscillanti e flessibili delle cime degli alberi, alcuni scout vivono intere esistenze senza mai mettere piede a terra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166373&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ff11bdd-560b-415a-8187-08a3392fba83\', \'multiverseId\': 166373}, \'multiverseid\': 166373}, {\'name\': \'樹上の斥候\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5213819a-df17-4c51-bb0a-9fd7b1ec5c6f\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Batedor das Copas\', \'text\': \'Batedor das Copas só pode ser bloqueado por criaturas com a habilidade de voar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'Em casa entre os oscilantes e flexíveis galhos das copas das árvores, alguns batedores vivem toda sua vida sem encostar no chão.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166516&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e061354a-7f09-4647-8c47-9013874f590b\', \'multiverseId\': 166516}, \'multiverseid\': 166516}]', '[{\'name\': \'Begierde des Verstands\', \'text\': \'Mische deine Bibliothek. Entferne dann die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ganz aus dem Spiel. Bis zum Ende des Zuges kannst du sie spielen, als ob sie auf deiner Hand wäre, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. (Falls ein X in ihren Manakosten ist, ist X dann 0.)\\nSturm (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch spielst, kopiere ihn einmal für jeden Zauberspruch, der in diesem Zug bereits gespielt wurde.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165998&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08407bf1-7abc-4b3b-be1d-8033214bb492\', \'multiverseId\': 165998}, \'multiverseid\': 165998}, {\'name\': \'Anhelo de la mente\', \'text\': \'Baraja tu biblioteca. Luego remueve del juego la carta de la parte superior de tu biblioteca. Hasta el final del turno, puedes jugarla como si estuviera en tu mano sin pagar su coste de maná. (Si tiene X en su coste de maná, X es 0.)\\nTormenta (Cuando juegues este hechizo, cópialo por cada hechizo jugado antes que él en este turno.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166571&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e71b3cf8-41bd-40dd-92b9-b1188c03cc18\', \'multiverseId\': 166571}, \'multiverseid\': 166571}, {\'name\': \'À mon seul désir\', \'text\': "Mélangez votre bibliothèque. Retirez ensuite de la partie la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, vous pouvez la jouer comme si elle était dans votre main sans payer son coût de mana. (S\'il y a X dans son coût de mana, X vaut 0.)\\nDéluge (Quand vous jouez ce sort, copiez-le pour chaque sort joué avant lui ce tour-ci.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166141&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c526497a-f477-471a-809e-17d72600c074\', \'multiverseId\': 166141}, \'multiverseid\': 166141}, {\'name\': \'Desiderio della Mente\', \'text\': "Rimescola il tuo grimorio. Poi rimuovi dal gioco la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Fino alla fine del turno, puoi giocarla come se fosse nella tua mano senza pagare il suo costo di mana (se c\'è X nel suo costo di mana, X è 0).\\nTempesta (quando giochi questa magia, copiala una volta per ogni magia giocata prima di questa durante questo turno).", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166284&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11cf2900-158b-409e-affc-919313ac964c\', \'multiverseId\': 166284}, \'multiverseid\': 166284}, {\'name\': \'精神の願望\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbd096e5-8866-472a-a203-7b38449eab50\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Desejo da Mente\', \'text\': \'Embaralhe seu grimório. Depois, remova de jogo o card do topo de seu grimório. Até o final do turno, você pode jogá-lo como se ele estivesse em sua mão sem pagar seu custo de mana. (Se ele tiver X em seu custo de mana, X é igual a 0.)\\nRajada (Quando você jogar esta mágica, faça uma cópia dela para cada mágica jogada antes dela neste turno.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166427&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f510aa31-4136-466b-bdaa-5eb73a9464c1\', \'multiverseId\': 166427}, \'multiverseid\': 166427}]', "[{'name': 'Belagerungstrupp-Kommandant', 'text': 'Wenn der Belagerungstrupp-Kommandant ins Spiel kommt, bringe drei 1/1 rote Goblin-Spielsteine ins Spiel.\\n{1}{R}, opfere einen Goblin: Der Belagerungstrupp-Kommandant fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Goblin', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166060&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '92c2d489-9349-48f7-b382-f1c1d0c07634', 'multiverseId': 166060}, 'multiverseid': 166060}, {'name': 'Comandante de sitiadores', 'text': 'Cuando el Comandante de sitiadores entre en juego, pon en juego tres fichas de criatura Trasgo roja 1/1.\\n{1}{R}, sacrificar un Trasgo: El Comandante de sitiadores hace 2 puntos de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo.', 'type': 'Criatura — Trasgo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166633&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '425479e4-57d1-4b0a-8c39-0d8f12982472', 'multiverseId': 166633}, 'multiverseid': 166633}, {'name': 'Commandant des assiégeants', 'text': 'Quand le Commandant des assiégeants arrive en jeu, mettez en jeu trois jetons de créature 1/1 rouge Gobelin.\\n{1}{R}, sacrifiez un gobelin : Le Commandant des assiégeants inflige 2 blessures à une cible, créature ou joueur.', 'type': 'Créature : gobelin', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166203&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4d09c3d2-eeb4-4ea9-97bf-5decfdf8d57f', 'multiverseId': 166203}, 'multiverseid': 166203}, {'name': 'Capo della Squadra di Assedio', 'text': 'Quando il Capo della Squadra di Assedio entra in gioco, metti in gioco 3 pedine creatura Goblin 1/1 rosse.\\n{1}{R}, Sacrifica un Goblin: Il Capo della Squadra di Assedio infligge 2 danni a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.', 'type': 'Creatura — Goblin', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166346&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '88ae62d2-4640-472d-ad78-b3ecc9f441ee', 'multiverseId': 166346}, 'multiverseid': 166346}, {'name': '包囲攻撃の司令官', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e19c0152-1200-4357-9464-4f5e58b9e0c3'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Comandante do Grupo de Cerco', 'text': 'Quando Comandante do Grupo de Cerco entrar em jogo, coloque em jogo três fichas de criatura vermelha 1/1 do tipo Goblin.\\n{1}{R}, Sacrifique um Goblin: Comandante do Grupo de Cerco causa 2 pontos de dano à criatura alvo ou ao jogador alvo.', 'type': 'Criatura — Goblin', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166489&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5f218a61-ad77-4a97-b041-e050a6812072', 'multiverseId': 166489}, 'multiverseid': 166489}]", '[{\'name\': \'Belohnung der Gläubigen\', \'text\': \'Eine beliebige Anzahl an Spielern deiner Wahl erhält so viele Lebenspunkte dazu, wie die höchsten umgewandelten Manakosten unter den bleibenden Karten, die du kontrollierst, betragen.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn du getrunken hast, reiche den Kelch weiter an andere, denen ebenfalls dürstet."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165979&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d474778f-90ac-448a-b633-5cca09ced7b7\', \'multiverseId\': 165979}, \'multiverseid\': 165979}, {\'name\': \'Recompensar a los fieles\', \'text\': \'Cada uno de cualquier número de jugadores objetivo gana una cantidad de vida igual al coste de maná convertido más alto que haya entre los permanentes que controles.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Cuando hayas bebido hasta saciarte, pásales la copa a otros que tengan sed".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166552&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b7df522-9070-4a74-8327-666485e3e4dd\', \'multiverseId\': 166552}, \'multiverseid\': 166552}, {\'name\': \'Récompense des fidèles\', \'text\': \'Un nombre quelconque de joueurs ciblés gagnent chacun un nombre de points de vie égal au coût converti de mana le plus élevé parmi les permanents que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Quand vous aurez bu votre soûl, tendez la coupe à ceux qui ont soif. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166122&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40f3839d-7a12-4913-98d9-5d3ac9584060\', \'multiverseId\': 166122}, \'multiverseid\': 166122}, {\'name\': \'La Ricompensa dei Fedeli\', \'text\': \'Un qualsiasi numero di giocatori bersaglio guadagnano ciascuno un ammontare di punti vita pari al più alto costo di mana convertito tra i permanenti che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando hai bevuto la tua parte, passa la coppa ad altri assetati".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166265&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a9fc6c6-7b75-4d37-ba91-d1e9132abc5a\', \'multiverseId\': 166265}, \'multiverseid\': 166265}, {\'name\': \'信仰の報償\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc29c982-c264-4bfc-be23-588fbab2d175\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Recompensar os Fiéis\', \'text\': \'Cada um de um número qualquer de jogadores alvo ganha uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual ao maior custo de mana convertido dentre as permanentes que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Ao beber tua parte, passa o cálice aos outros que têm sede."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166408&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88604b3f-04f7-4122-b858-20343b1666b6\', \'multiverseId\': 166408}, \'multiverseid\': 166408}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beschleunigte Mutation\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +X/+X bis zum Ende des Zuges, wobei X gleich den höchsten umgewandelten Manakosten unter den bleibenden Karten, die du kontrollierst, ist.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Sein Fressen wurde gerade deutlich kleiner und sein Magen deutlich größer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166066&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de710915-ebdf-43f3-9cbd-2dbc055b757b\', \'multiverseId\': 166066}, \'multiverseid\': 166066}, {\'name\': \'Mutación acelerada\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene +X/+X hasta el final del turno, donde X es el coste de maná convertido más alto que haya entre los permanentes que controles.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Su comida acaba de volverse más pequeña; y su estómago, mucho más grande.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166639&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e702650c-291d-42c3-b9e7-6e1cd8316263\', \'multiverseId\': 166639}, \'multiverseid\': 166639}, {\'name\': \'Mutation accélérée\', \'text\': "La créature ciblée gagne +X/+X jusqu\'à la fin du tour, où X est le coût converti de mana le plus élevé parmi les permanents que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'Sa nourriture se fit plus rare, mais son estomac se fit plus gros.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166209&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4329451-7010-43bb-8ef5-c1b938ae2552\', \'multiverseId\': 166209}, \'multiverseid\': 166209}, {\'name\': \'Mutazione Accelerata\', \'text\': \'La creatura bersaglio prende +X/+X fino alla fine del turno, dove X è pari al più alto costo di mana convertito tra i permanenti che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Il suo cibo è diventato molto più piccolo e il suo stomaco molto più grande.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166352&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'439acafa-56ef-44e0-bc42-7c89d4c7ea80\', \'multiverseId\': 166352}, \'multiverseid\': 166352}, {\'name\': \'促成の突然変異\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4eb9bb3b-0018-47c2-aae5-ae81184305f8\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Mutação Acelerada\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe +X/+X até o final do turno, sendo X igual ao maior custo de mana convertido dentre as permanentes que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Sua comida acabou de diminuir bastante e seu estômago de crescer muito.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166495&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e5a7cdf-ab05-4272-a764-8a14db3b5ac5\', \'multiverseId\': 166495}, \'multiverseid\': 166495}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bladewing der Auferstandene\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn Bladewing der Auferstandene ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Drachenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurückbringen.\\n{B}{R}: Alle Drachen erhalten +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache, Legende\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166093&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2de1026a-c890-4dc8-97c4-37f677a122b3\', \'multiverseId\': 166093}, \'multiverseid\': 166093}, {\'name\': \'Alacortante el Resucitado\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando Alacortante el Resucitado entre en juego, puedes regresar al juego la carta objetivo de Dragón de tu cementerio.\\n{B}{R}: Todos los Dragones obtienen +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón legendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166666&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'742a5035-b29a-43a8-855c-3b24d1a17e2a\', \'multiverseId\': 166666}, \'multiverseid\': 166666}, {\'name\': \'Ailelame le Ressuscité\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand Ailelame le Ressuscité arrive en jeu, vous pouvez renvoyer en jeu une carte de dragon ciblée depuis votre cimetière.\\n{B}{R} : Tous les dragons gagnent +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon et légende\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166236&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8f7be13-be6c-4d55-b61f-0ce58112456e\', \'multiverseId\': 166236}, \'multiverseid\': 166236}, {\'name\': \'Alaspada il Risorto\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando Alaspada il Risorto entra in gioco, puoi rimettere in gioco una carta Drago bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\\n{B}{R}: Tutti i Draghi prendono +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Leggenda Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166379&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ceafe81d-a01a-443b-89c8-382ef13be8f5\', \'multiverseId\': 166379}, \'multiverseid\': 166379}, {\'name\': \'帰ってきた刃の翼\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b105edc4-df81-4d56-9d2d-c7d8783b07bf\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Asas Laminadas, o Ressurgido\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Asas Laminadas, o Ressurgido entrar em jogo, você pode devolver o card de Dragão alvo de seu cemitério para o jogo.\\n{B}{R}: Todos os Dragões recebem +1/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão Lenda\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166522&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3cf5301-210a-4273-bf34-4e59f0caada7\', \'multiverseId\': 166522}, \'multiverseid\': 166522}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bladewings Knecht\', \'text\': \'Bladewings Knecht hat Flugfähigkeit, solange du einen Drachen kontrollierst.\\nWenn ein Drachen ins Spiel kommt, kannst du einen Bladewings Knecht aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurückbringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166012&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b401a52-c321-437f-8b30-4bce4d070539\', \'multiverseId\': 166012}, \'multiverseid\': 166012}, {\'name\': \'Esclavo de Alacortante\', \'text\': \'El Esclavo de Alacortante tiene la habilidad de volar mientras controles un Dragón.\\nCuando un Dragón entre en juego, puedes regresar el Esclavo de Alacortante de tu cementerio al juego.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166585&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5aa7d7d-1557-417b-bde4-c61df9a32983\', \'multiverseId\': 166585}, \'multiverseid\': 166585}, {\'name\': "Serviteur d\'Ailelame", \'text\': "Le Serviteur d\'Ailelame a le vol tant que vous contrôlez un dragon.\\nQuand un dragon arrive en jeu, vous pouvez renvoyer en jeu le Serviteur d\'Ailelame depuis votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature : zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166155&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a660e5a5-94f7-4bc7-a5ee-f5d4985b5453\', \'multiverseId\': 166155}, \'multiverseid\': 166155}, {\'name\': \'Schiavo di Alaspada\', \'text\': \'Lo Schiavo di Alaspada ha volare fintanto che tu controlli almeno un Drago.\\nQuando un Drago entra in gioco, puoi rimettere in gioco lo Schiavo di Alaspada dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166298&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c38cb419-8847-4847-9737-ef314971ce79\', \'multiverseId\': 166298}, \'multiverseid\': 166298}, {\'name\': \'刃の翼の虜\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'743e5853-7972-47e2-b289-5ada42056670\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Escravo do Asas Laminadas\', \'text\': \'Escravo do Asas Laminadas tem a habilidade de voar desde que você controle um Dragão.\\nQuando um Dragão entrar em jogo, você pode devolver Escravo do Asas Laminadas de seu cemitério para o jogo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166441&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7841fdd1-79f7-48cd-8500-11d2f2df1422\', \'multiverseId\': 166441}, \'multiverseid\': 166441}]', "[{'name': 'Blase der Macht', 'text': 'Falls dir Schaden zugefügt würde, lege stattdessen ebenso viele Entleerungsmarken auf die Blase der Macht.\\nWenn vier oder mehr Entleerungsmarken auf der Blase der Macht liegen, opfere sie.\\nEntferne am Ende des Zuges alle Entleerungsmarken von der Blase der Macht.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165971&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '64686dd3-7cca-46d1-88ce-8d35c79bfafa', 'multiverseId': 165971}, 'multiverseid': 165971}, {'name': 'Burbuja de fuerza', 'text': 'Si se te fuera a hacer daño, en su lugar, pon ese mismo número de contadores de agotamiento sobre la Burbuja de fuerza.\\nCuando haya cuatro o más contadores de agotamiento sobre la Burbuja de fuerza, sacrifícala.\\nAl final del turno, remueve todos los contadores de agotamiento de la Burbuja de fuerza.', 'type': 'Encantamiento', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166544&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '04e4c11b-79c2-4960-9276-7975c988da7c', 'multiverseId': 166544}, 'multiverseid': 166544}, {'name': 'Bulle de force', 'text': 'Si des blessures devaient vous être infligées, placez autant de marqueurs « sec » sur la Bulle de force à la place.\\nQuand il y a au moins quatre marqueurs « sec » sur la Bulle de force, sacrifiez-la.\\nÀ la fin du tour, retirez tous les marqueurs « sec » de la Bulle de force.', 'type': 'Enchantement', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166114&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '79e45337-8fd9-496e-a1f7-14847dec3702', 'multiverseId': 166114}, 'multiverseid': 166114}, {'name': 'Bolla di Forza', 'text': 'Se ti dovessero essere inflitti dei danni, metti invece sulla Bolla di Forza un numero di segnalini svuotamento pari al loro ammontare.\\nQuando ci sono almeno quattro segnalini svuotamento sulla Bolla di Forza, sacrificala.\\nAlla fine del turno, rimuovi tutti i segnalini svuotamento presenti sulla Bolla di Forza.', 'type': 'Incantesimo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166257&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8265585d-eef2-4672-8ebe-119e6cd17dbf', 'multiverseId': 166257}, 'multiverseid': 166257}, {'name': '力場の泡', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '709e1162-378e-4afb-804d-4de5c30e09d9'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Bolha de Força', 'text': 'Se dano fosse causado a você, ao invés disso coloque aquela quantidade de marcadores de depleção em Bolha de Força.\\nQuando houver quatro ou mais marcadores de depleção em Bolha de Força, sacrifique-a.\\nNo final do turno, remova todos os marcadores de depleção de Bolha de Força.', 'type': 'Encantamento', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166400&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '12205179-9b96-474c-8f88-72e7d2c194f2', 'multiverseId': 166400}, 'multiverseid': 166400}]", "[{'name': 'Daru-Kriegshäuptling', 'text': 'Soldatenzauber, die du spielst, kosten beim Ausspielen {1} weniger.\\nSoldaten, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+2.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Soldat', 'flavor': 'Seine Siege sprechen für ihn.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165963&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f214c07d-b27b-4ab9-b9a7-11d2f8d31693', 'multiverseId': 165963}, 'multiverseid': 165963}, {'name': 'Jefe de guerra de Daru', 'text': 'Te cuesta {1} menos jugar los hechizos de Soldado.\\nLos Soldados que controles obtienen +1/+2.', 'type': 'Criatura — Soldado', 'flavor': 'Sus victorias hablan por él.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166536&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '20f55d14-0a2d-48be-86fa-c9d061836506', 'multiverseId': 166536}, 'multiverseid': 166536}, {'name': 'Chef de guerre daru', 'text': 'Les sorts de soldats coûtent {1} de moins à jouer.\\nLes soldats que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+2.', 'type': 'Créature : soldat', 'flavor': 'Ses victoires parlent en son nom.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166106&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b5a5201b-ef74-4ef0-9350-7edf0396cf64', 'multiverseId': 166106}, 'multiverseid': 166106}, {'name': 'Condottiero Daru', 'text': 'Le magie soldato che giochi costano {1} in meno per essere giocate.\\nI Soldati che controlli prendono +1/+2.', 'type': 'Creatura — Soldato', 'flavor': 'Le sue vittorie parlano per lui.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166249&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4e77f16a-ea47-4b8a-8eb4-061d5d53049d', 'multiverseId': 166249}, 'multiverseid': 166249}, {'name': 'ダールの戦長', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7a80f84c-42b9-4c30-9a64-98939b6b0751'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Comandante de Guerra de Daru', 'text': 'Suas mágicas de Soldado custam {1} a menos para serem jogadas.\\nOs Soldados que você controla recebem +1/+2.', 'type': 'Criatura — Soldado', 'flavor': 'Suas vitórias falam por ele.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166392&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '32b3918d-544a-47b0-8f61-daed2664d411', 'multiverseId': 166392}, 'multiverseid': 166392}]", '[{\'name\': \'Daru-Spiritualist\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Kleriker, den du kontrollierst, das Ziel eines Zauberspruchs oder einer Fähigkeit wird, erhält er +0/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'Er erweckt die Geister seines Volkes, auf dass sie im Zorn auf deren Gegner herniederprasseln.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165962&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d34c3ca-4a4f-4d10-9276-c198de23e87a\', \'multiverseId\': 165962}, \'multiverseid\': 165962}, {\'name\': \'Espiritualista de Daru\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un Clérigo que controles sea objetivo de un hechizo o habilidad, obtiene +0/+2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo\', \'flavor\': \'Él eleva los espíritus de su gente para que puedan descender con ira sobre sus enemigos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166535&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02c03668-b111-4e79-951e-8a30ad5eef0b\', \'multiverseId\': 166535}, \'multiverseid\': 166535}, {\'name\': \'Spiritualiste daru\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un clerc que vous contrôlez devient la cible d\'un sort ou d\'une capacité, il gagne +0/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : clerc\', \'flavor\': "Il maintient le moral de son peuple pour qu\'il déchaîne sa colère sur ses ennemis.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166105&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0152ac6-c6b9-4f0a-a784-be95e3bebbdd\', \'multiverseId\': 166105}, \'multiverseid\': 166105}, {\'name\': \'Spiritualista Daru\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta un Chierico che controlli diventa il bersaglio di una magia o di un\'abilità, prende +0/+2 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico\', \'flavor\': \'Solleva lo spirito della propria gente per scagliarlo come collera sui nemici.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166248&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cf6ace6-3867-46f9-a831-3c9439b11e04\', \'multiverseId\': 166248}, \'multiverseid\': 166248}, {\'name\': \'ダールの降霊者\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f61b330d-b93d-40cd-bc11-b5c1aa47dfd4\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Espiritualista de Daru\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um Clérigo que você controla tornar-se alvo de uma mágica ou habilidade, ele recebe +0/+2 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo\', \'flavor\': \'Ele eleva os espíritos de seu povo para que eles possam cair com ira sobre seus inimigos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166391&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc92d01d-7213-4db6-ba02-f45ad257f178\', \'multiverseId\': 166391}, \'multiverseid\': 166391}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dekret der Gerechtigkeit\', \'text\': \'Bringe X 4/4 weiße Engel-Spielsteine mit Flugfähigkeit ins Spiel.\\nUmwandlung {2}{W}\\nWenn du das Dekret der Gerechtigkeit umwandelst, kannst du {X} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, bringe X 1/1 weiße Soldaten-Spielsteine ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165965&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7eef978-4161-4297-b6d3-43a229800c17\', \'multiverseId\': 165965}, \'multiverseid\': 165965}, {\'name\': \'Decreto de justicia\', \'text\': \'Pon en juego X fichas de criatura Ángel blanca 4/4 con la habilidad de volar.\\nCiclo {2}{W}.\\nCuando uses la habilidad de ciclo del Decreto de justicia, puedes pagar {X}. Si lo haces, pon en juego X fichas de criatura Soldado blanca 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166538&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5da28aa-6753-447d-b39f-1fc18d7ef13b\', \'multiverseId\': 166538}, \'multiverseid\': 166538}, {\'name\': \'Décret de justice\', \'text\': \'Mettez en jeu X jetons de créature 4/4 blanche Ange avec le vol.\\nRecyclage {2}{W}\\nQuand vous recyclez le Décret de justice, vous pouvez payer {X}. Si vous faites ainsi, mettez en jeu X jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Soldat.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166108&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffc88e4d-995c-4840-8fd7-3947bf741cdc\', \'multiverseId\': 166108}, \'multiverseid\': 166108}, {\'name\': \'Decreto della Giustizia\', \'text\': "Metti in gioco X pedine creatura Angelo 4/4 bianche con volare.\\nCiclo {2}{W}\\nQuando usi l\'abilità ciclo del Decreto della Giustizia, puoi spendere {X}. Se lo fai, metti in gioco X pedine creatura Soldato 1/1 bianche.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166251&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a63b5d59-0e8a-4495-8423-2d7c6f5f3f05\', \'multiverseId\': 166251}, \'multiverseid\': 166251}, {\'name\': \'正義の命令\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1809efb4-6a3c-4569-96d0-3ff492984adb\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Decreto de Justiça\', \'text\': \'Coloque em jogo X fichas de criatura branca 4/4, com a habilidade de voar, do tipo Anjo.\\nReciclar {2}{W}\\nQuando reciclar Decreto de Justiça, você pode pagar {X}. Se o fizer, coloque em jogo X fichas de criatura branca 1/1 do tipo Soldado.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166394&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9ca93c6-7882-47ad-a931-007beda6048d\', \'multiverseId\': 166394}, \'multiverseid\': 166394}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dekret der Vernichtung\', \'text\': \'Entferne alle Artefakte, Kreaturen und Länder sowie alle Karten in Friedhöfen und auf der Hand ganz aus dem Spiel.\\nUmwandlung {5}{R}{R}\\nWenn du das Dekret der Vernichtung umwandelst, zerstöre alle Länder.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166042&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e29964c4-c0dd-499c-95d9-f37234851a2e\', \'multiverseId\': 166042}, \'multiverseid\': 166042}, {\'name\': \'Decreto de aniquilación\', \'text\': \'Remueve del juego todos los artefactos, criaturas, tierras, cementerios y manos.\\nCiclo {5}{R}{R}.\\nCuando uses la habilidad de ciclo del Decreto de aniquilación, destruye todas las tierras.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166615&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ccce1ca-71fb-4679-8e87-8469d78cac02\', \'multiverseId\': 166615}, \'multiverseid\': 166615}, {\'name\': "Décret d\'annihilation", \'text\': "Retirez tous les artefacts, toutes les créatures, tous les terrains, tous les cimetières et toutes les mains de la partie.\\nRecyclage {5}{R}{R}\\nQuand vous recyclez le Décret d\'annihilation, détruisez tous les terrains.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166185&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f9dc0fd-3b95-4a7c-a4a0-7ac7a18093e9\', \'multiverseId\': 166185}, \'multiverseid\': 166185}, {\'name\': "Decreto dell\'Annientamento", \'text\': "Rimuovi dal gioco tutti gli artefatti, le creature, le terre, i cimiteri e le mani.\\nCiclo {5}{R}{R}\\nQuando usi l\'abilità ciclo del Decreto dell\'Annientamento, distruggi tutte le terre.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166328&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'beae1fe6-a73d-4988-a0b7-4ab69fda90c8\', \'multiverseId\': 166328}, \'multiverseid\': 166328}, {\'name\': \'滅殺の命令\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2eac8e37-25a4-4079-9b64-20fe9eac411e\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Decreto de Aniquilação\', \'text\': \'Remove de jogo todos os artefatos, criaturas, terrenos, cemitérios e cards das mãos.\\nReciclar {5}{R}{R}\\nQuando você reciclar Decreto de Aniquilação, destrói todos os terrenos.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166471&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e36cd00-af70-4b00-b4ad-61a53b6a249e\', \'multiverseId\': 166471}, \'multiverseid\': 166471}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dekret der Wildheit\', \'text\': \'Lege vier +1/+1-Marken auf alle Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst.\\nUmwandlung {4}{G}{G}\\nWenn du das Dekret der Wildheit umwandelst, kannst du vier +1/+1-Marken auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl legen.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166072&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d73fa781-9a9b-4001-84ea-bc96d9de9e57\', \'multiverseId\': 166072}, \'multiverseid\': 166072}, {\'name\': \'Decreto de salvajismo\', \'text\': \'Pon cuatro contadores +1/+1 sobre cada criatura que controles.\\nCiclo {4}{G}{G}.\\nCuando uses la habilidad de ciclo del Decreto de salvajismo, puedes poner cuatro contadores +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166645&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb932135-5a5c-4fb6-a768-3f0c2571f26f\', \'multiverseId\': 166645}, \'multiverseid\': 166645}, {\'name\': \'Décret de sauvagerie\', \'text\': \'Mettez quatre marqueurs +1/+1 sur chaque créature que vous contrôlez.\\nRecyclage {4}{G}{G}\\nQuand vous recyclez le Décret de sauvagerie, vous pouvez mettre quatre marqueurs +1/+1 sur la créature ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166215&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c092544b-e52a-46fb-a8fe-a37b61ec7159\', \'multiverseId\': 166215}, \'multiverseid\': 166215}, {\'name\': \'Decreto della Ferocia\', \'text\': "Metti quattro segnalini +1/+1 su ogni creatura che controlli.\\nCiclo {4}{G}{G}\\nQuando usi l\'abilità ciclo del Decreto della Ferocia, puoi mettere quattro segnalini +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166358&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d288f551-dde2-4405-ad72-c47811f05cd7\', \'multiverseId\': 166358}, \'multiverseid\': 166358}, {\'name\': \'凶暴の命令\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d335447-6868-45ea-bf7f-c465c20e0550\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Decreto de Selvageria\', \'text\': \'Coloque quatro marcadores +1/+1 em cada criatura que você controla.\\nReciclar {4}{G}{G}\\nQuando reciclar Decreto de Selvageria, você pode colocar quatro marcadores +1/+1 na criatura alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166501&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11e4bc44-a7e4-4276-9aeb-98c4fcad0ea2\', \'multiverseId\': 166501}, \'multiverseid\': 166501}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dekret des Schmerzes\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre alle Kreaturen. Sie können nicht regeneriert werden. Ziehe für jede Kreatur, die auf diese Art zerstört wurde, eine Karte.\\nUmwandlung {3}{B}{B}\\nWenn du das Dekret des Schmerzes umwandelst, erhalten alle Kreaturen -2/-2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166021&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35b484d0-4513-43ca-bd4d-5dca6261d5d0\', \'multiverseId\': 166021}, \'multiverseid\': 166021}, {\'name\': \'Decreto de dolor\', \'text\': \'Destruye todas las criaturas. No pueden ser regeneradas. Roba una carta por cada criatura destruida de esta manera.\\nCiclo {3}{B}{B}.\\nCuando uses la habilidad de ciclo del Decreto de dolor, todas las criaturas obtienen -2/-2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166594&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4e2ca1c-d1cf-40f8-92f2-0cae0dbed0ff\', \'multiverseId\': 166594}, \'multiverseid\': 166594}, {\'name\': \'Décret de souffrance\', \'text\': "Détruisez toutes les créatures. Elles ne peuvent pas être régénérées. Piochez une carte pour chaque créature détruite de cette manière.\\nRecyclage {3}{B}{B}\\nQuand vous recyclez le Décret de souffrance, toutes les créatures gagnent -2/-2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166164&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5bb87524-b1e0-4da6-bf3f-e5e4e73fd060\', \'multiverseId\': 166164}, \'multiverseid\': 166164}, {\'name\': \'Decreto del Dolore\', \'text\': "Distruggi tutte le creature. Non possono essere rigenerate. Pesca una carta per ogni creatura distrutta in questo modo.\\nCiclo {3}{B}{B}\\nQuando usi l\'abilità ciclo del Decreto del Dolore, tutte le creature prendono -2/-2 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166307&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6216d301-1d36-44e9-b6ad-ff13c32b3f03\', \'multiverseId\': 166307}, \'multiverseid\': 166307}, {\'name\': \'苦痛の命令\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e45809ba-1523-4daf-b084-e5d7d27d50bd\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Decreto de Dor\', \'text\': \'Destrói todas as criaturas. Elas não podem ser regeneradas. Compre um card para cada criatura destruída desta forma.\\nReciclar {3}{B}{B}\\nQuando você reciclar Decreto de Dor, todas as criaturas recebem -2/-2 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166450&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ba26542-610d-4e04-99f1-aef0ef121300\', \'multiverseId\': 166450}, \'multiverseid\': 166450}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dekret des Schweigens\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Gegner einen Zauberspruch spielt, neutralisiere ihn und lege eine Entleerungsmarke auf das Dekret des Schweigens. Falls drei oder mehr Entleerungsmarken auf dem Dekret des Schweigens liegen, opfere sie.\\nUmwandlung {4}{U}{U}\\nWenn du das Dekret des Schweigens umwandelst, kannst du einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl neutralisieren.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165989&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf2d9e6a-47a5-4301-8567-0ae90bf7b2de\', \'multiverseId\': 165989}, \'multiverseid\': 165989}, {\'name\': \'Decreto de silencio\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un oponente juegue un hechizo, contrarresta ese hechizo y pon un contador de agotamiento sobre el Decreto de silencio. Si hay tres o más contadores de agotamiento sobre el Decreto de silencio, sacrifícalo.\\nCiclo {4}{U}{U}.\\nCuando uses la habilidad de ciclo del Decreto de silencio, puedes contrarrestar el hechizo objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166562&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6917bc30-ac1e-4f40-aefe-b6f9afaa8e7b\', \'multiverseId\': 166562}, \'multiverseid\': 166562}, {\'name\': \'Décret de silence\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un adversaire joue un sort, contrez ce sort et placez un marqueur « sec » sur le Décret de silence. Quand il y a au moins trois marqueurs « sec » sur le Décret de silence, sacrifiez-le.\\nRecyclage {4}{U}{U}\\nQuand vous recyclez le Décret de silence, vous pouvez contrer le sort ciblé.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166132&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9ceca68-acea-4b9f-9f01-507e9d9511c9\', \'multiverseId\': 166132}, \'multiverseid\': 166132}, {\'name\': \'Decreto del Silenzio\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta un avversario gioca una magia, neutralizza quella magia e metti un segnalino svuotamento sul Decreto del Silenzio. Se ci sono almeno tre segnalini svuotamento sul Decreto del Silenzio, sacrificalo.\\nCiclo {4}{U}{U}\\nQuando usi l\'abilità ciclo del Decreto del Silenzio, puoi neutralizzare una magia bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166275&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f8efe1b-adf5-4330-849c-063b804921ff\', \'multiverseId\': 166275}, \'multiverseid\': 166275}, {\'name\': \'静寂の命令\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'433d0aaf-1611-4b02-aef7-d6d32f99fbf6\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Decreto de Silêncio\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um oponente jogar uma mágica, anule aquela mágica e coloque um marcador de depleção em Decreto de Silêncio. Se houver três ou mais marcadores de depleção em Decreto de Silêncio, sacrifique-o.\\nReciclar {4}{U}{U}\\nQuando reciclar Decreto do Silêncio, você pode anular a mágica alvo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166418&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07e9a35e-a77c-401b-a51b-bc8cb7d4af60\', \'multiverseId\': 166418}, \'multiverseid\': 166418}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dimensionsbruch\', \'text\': \'Entferne alle bleibenden Karten ganz aus dem Spiel. Solange mindestens eine dieser Karten ganz aus dem Spiel entfernt ist, bringt jeder Spieler zu Beginn seines Versorgungssegments eine der auf diese Weise entfernten Karten, die er besitzt, ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165966&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d51445a-fee2-467f-affb-5718e6474d2b\', \'multiverseId\': 165966}, \'multiverseid\': 165966}, {\'name\': \'Brecha dimensional\', \'text\': \'Remueve del juego todos los permanentes. Mientras cualquiera de esas cartas permanezca removida del juego, al comienzo del mantenimiento de cada jugador, ese jugador regresa al juego una de las cartas removidas que le pertenezca.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166539&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9d1e2ec-299b-44a7-97f1-c65764839d69\', \'multiverseId\': 166539}, \'multiverseid\': 166539}, {\'name\': \'Brèche dimensionnelle\', \'text\': "Retirez tous les permanents de la partie. Tant qu\'une de ces cartes est retirée de la partie, au début de l\'entretien de chaque joueur, ce joueur renvoit en jeu l\'une des cartes retirées dont il est le propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166109&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b16d00d0-b046-4dd1-abd0-98ec4cdc2fcd\', \'multiverseId\': 166109}, \'multiverseid\': 166109}, {\'name\': \'Breccia Dimensionale\', \'text\': "Rimuovi dal gioco tutti i permanenti. Fintanto che almeno una di quelle carte resta rimossa dal gioco, all\'inizio del mantenimento di ogni giocatore, quel giocatore rimette in gioco una delle carte rimosse che possiede.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166252&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcf9703c-a426-409f-849b-0b24c8f4c76a\', \'multiverseId\': 166252}, \'multiverseid\': 166252}, {\'name\': \'次元の突破口\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebfaab05-8b7b-4efe-b1d3-130f570986c4\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Brecha Dimensional\', \'text\': \'Remove de jogo todas as permanentes. Desde que algum daqueles cards permaneça removido de jogo, no início da manutenção de cada jogador, aquele jogador devolve para o jogo um dos seus cards removidos.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166395&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8d5f9e6-f920-4833-9354-9c095b309370\', \'multiverseId\': 166395}, \'multiverseid\': 166395}]', '[{\'name\': \'Donnerwolkenelementar\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{3}{U}: Tappe alle Kreaturen mit Widerstandskraft 2 oder weniger.\\n{3}{U}: Alle anderen Kreaturen verlieren Flugfähigkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': \'An manchen Tagen bleibt man einfach besser drinnen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166011&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ec3162d-403c-406d-a95e-c9dc2f3a3726\', \'multiverseId\': 166011}, \'multiverseid\': 166011}, {\'name\': \'Elemental de nubarrón\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{3}{U}: Gira todas las criaturas con resistencia de 2 o menos.\\n{3}{U}: Todas las demás criaturas pierden la habilidad de volar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'Algunos días es mejor quedarse adentro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166584&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4ec9166-5afa-4f76-9063-9bb5963f05e4\', \'multiverseId\': 166584}, \'multiverseid\': 166584}, {\'name\': "Élémental de nuée d\'orage", \'text\': "Vol\\n{3}{U} : Engagez toutes les créatures dont l\'endurance est de 2 ou moins.\\n{3}{U} : Toutes les autres créatures perdent le vol jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': \'Il y a des jours où il ne vaut mieux pas sortir.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166154&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8dd20d5-d883-4c90-adfc-057291906814\', \'multiverseId\': 166154}, \'multiverseid\': 166154}, {\'name\': \'Elementale del Temporale\', \'text\': \'Volare\\n{3}{U}: TAPpa tutte le creature con costituzione pari o inferiore a 2.\\n{3}{U}: Tutte le altre creature perdono volare fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': \'Certi giorni è meglio restare chiusi in casa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166297&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d56b7983-1a82-435f-b39b-d0e0ad9547aa\', \'multiverseId\': 166297}, \'multiverseid\': 166297}, {\'name\': \'雷雲の精霊\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04471af8-ebc6-468a-94bb-9cf6a8b55ef1\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Elemental da Nuvem Trovejante\', \'text\': \'Voar\\n{3}{U}: Vira todas as criaturas com resistência igual a 2 ou menos.\\n{3}{U}: Todas as outras criaturas perdem a habilidade de voar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'Em alguns dias o melhor é não sair.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166440&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'585ba8a5-cdb8-4b1a-bb68-719a2354006b\', \'multiverseId\': 166440}, \'multiverseid\': 166440}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drachenatem\', \'text\': \'Die verzauberte Kreatur hat Eile.\\n{R}: Die verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nWenn eine Kreatur mit umgewandelten Manakosten von 6 oder höher ins Spiel kommt, kannst du den Drachenatem diese Kreatur verzaubernd aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück bringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreaturenverzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166043&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c85081d-d808-4faa-bdab-5361c941ee40\', \'multiverseId\': 166043}, \'multiverseid\': 166043}, {\'name\': \'Aliento de dragón\', \'text\': \'La criatura encantada tiene la habilidad de prisa.{R}: La criatura encantada obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno.\\nCuando una criatura con un coste de maná convertido de 6 o más entre en juego, puedes regresar el Aliento de dragón de tu cementerio al juego encantando a esa criatura.\', \'type\': \'Encantar criatura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166616&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cf6cd3b-0a82-4715-ab19-d80beb1ce8af\', \'multiverseId\': 166616}, \'multiverseid\': 166616}, {\'name\': \'Souffle du dragon\', \'text\': "La créature enchantée a la célérité.\\n{R} : La créature enchantée gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nQuand une créature ayant un coût converti de mana de 6 ou plus arrive en jeu, vous pouvez renvoyer en jeu le Souffle du dragon depuis votre cimetière pour enchanter cette créature.", \'type\': \'Enchanter : créature\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166186&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb0b3ca2-f951-443a-843e-38c155f6e127\', \'multiverseId\': 166186}, \'multiverseid\': 166186}, {\'name\': \'Alito del Drago\', \'text\': "La creatura incantata ha rapidità.\\n{R}: La creatura incantata prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\\nQuando una creatura con costo di mana convertito pari o superiore a 6 entra in gioco, puoi giocare L\'Alito del Drago dal tuo cimitero per incantare quella creatura.", \'type\': \'Incanta Creatura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166329&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44c5f0de-9dbc-4c66-9ba5-3cede7226b15\', \'multiverseId\': 166329}, \'multiverseid\': 166329}, {\'name\': \'ドラゴンの息\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7d18007-7c49-46f9-943e-665a683c3e80\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Hálito de Dragão\', \'text\': \'A criatura encantada tem ímpeto.\\n{R}: A criatura encantada recebe +1/+0 até o final do turno.\\nQuando uma criatura com custo de mana convertido maior ou igual a 6 entrar em jogo, você pode devolver Hálito de Dragão de seu cemitério para o jogo encantando aquela criatura.\', \'type\': \'Encantar Criatura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166472&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11635f6f-e381-4e05-b9c2-05b52ba407ed\', \'multiverseId\': 166472}, \'multiverseid\': 166472}]', "[{'name': 'Drachenflügel', 'text': 'Die verzauberte Kreatur hat Flugfähigkeit.\\nUmwandlung {1}{U} ({1}{U}, wirf diese Karte aus deiner Hand ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\\nWenn eine Kreatur mit umgewandelten Manakosten von 6 oder höher ins Spiel kommt, kannst du die Drachenflügel diese Kreatur verzaubernd aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück bringen.', 'type': 'Kreaturenverzauberung', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165991&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '46acd70d-2198-49f5-b72c-0269a8da0d10', 'multiverseId': 165991}, 'multiverseid': 165991}, {'name': 'Alas de dragón', 'text': 'La criatura encantada tiene la habilidad de volar.\\nCiclo {1}{U}.({1}{U}, descartar esta carta de tu mano: Roba una carta.)\\nCuando una criatura con un coste de maná convertido de 6 o más entre en juego, puedes regresar las Alas de dragón de tu cementerio al juego encantando a esa criatura.', 'type': 'Encantar criatura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166564&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4b0808cb-6b4e-4fe1-9a45-c48450b7ce93', 'multiverseId': 166564}, 'multiverseid': 166564}, {'name': 'Ailes du dragon', 'text': 'La créature enchantée a le vol.\\nRecyclage {1}{U} ({1}{U}, défaussez-vous de cette carte de votre main : Piochez une carte.)\\nQuand une créature ayant un coût converti de mana de 6 ou plus arrive en jeu, vous pouvez renvoyer en jeu les Ailes du dragon depuis votre cimetière pour enchanter cette créature.', 'type': 'Enchanter : créature', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166134&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b05cf81f-e57d-4970-8983-fcb2a14a48bd', 'multiverseId': 166134}, 'multiverseid': 166134}, {'name': 'Ali del Drago', 'text': 'La creatura incantata ha volare.\\nCiclo {1}{U} ({1}{U}, Scarta questa carta dalla tua mano: Pesca una carta).\\nQuando una creatura con costo di mana convertito pari o superiore a 6 entra in gioco, puoi giocare le Ali del Drago dal tuo cimitero per incantare quella creatura.', 'type': 'Incanta Creatura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166277&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4f378b75-2d43-4223-8d66-79a5d352e3f8', 'multiverseId': 166277}, 'multiverseid': 166277}, {'name': 'ドラゴンの翼', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '58d3aaa4-8ee0-40fa-89af-4a82b3c596d5'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Asas de Dragão', 'text': 'A criatura encantada tem a habilidade de voar.\\nReciclar {1}{U} ({1}{U}, Descarte este card de sua mão: Compre um card.)\\nQuando uma criatura com custo de mana convertido maior ou igual a 6 entrar em jogo, você pode devolver Asas de Dragão de seu cemitério para o jogo encantando aquela criatura.', 'type': 'Encantar Criatura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166420&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cc775d81-3a10-4512-a934-b9ed406a6527', 'multiverseId': 166420}, 'multiverseid': 166420}]", '[{\'name\': \'Drachenjäger\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Schutz vor Drachen\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn die Himmel rot vor Flammen leuchten, werden die Tapferen vortreten, um sie zu löschen." —Prophezeiung des Ordens\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165968&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47d23a5a-0bd1-4807-85e1-4f49f4b39a0b\', \'multiverseId\': 165968}, \'multiverseid\': 165968}, {\'name\': \'Acechadragones\', \'text\': \'Vuela, protección contra Dragones.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado ave\', \'flavor\': \'"Cuando los cielos estén llenos de llamas, el valiente dará un paso adelante para sofocarlas". Profecía de la Orden\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166541&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac4b5485-1f2f-40d9-8596-993776933c52\', \'multiverseId\': 166541}, \'multiverseid\': 166541}, {\'name\': \'Pisteur de dragon\', \'text\': \'Vol, protection contre les dragons\', \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« Lorsque le firmament de flammes s\'emplira, les braves seront là, debout, pour les éteindre. » —Prophétie de l\'Ordre", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166111&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9db79fdb-ad94-4733-8f71-ae59f4b26978\', \'multiverseId\': 166111}, \'multiverseid\': 166111}, {\'name\': \'Cacciadraghi\', \'text\': \'Volare, protezione dai Draghi\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Uccello\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando i cieli rigurgitano fiamme, i coraggiosi devono farsi avanti per domarle". —profezia dell\\\'Ordine\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166254&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58d85003-9a6a-477f-832b-3e8d28594f72\', \'multiverseId\': 166254}, \'multiverseid\': 166254}, {\'name\': \'ドラゴンをつけ狙う者\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'355f447c-eea0-4319-b092-5eeecbb527ae\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Caça-Dragões\', \'text\': \'Voar, proteção contra Dragões\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado Pássaro\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando os céus se enchem com chamas, os bravos devem dar um passo à frente para extingui-las." —Profecia da Ordem\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166397&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'472b6cd3-4295-43ae-becc-84e593910b95\', \'multiverseId\': 166397}, \'multiverseid\': 166397}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drachenmagier\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn der Drachenmagier einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, werfen alle Spieler alle Karten aus ihrer Hand ab und ziehen sieben Karten.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Du wirst dich meinem Willen unterwerfen egal, ob du dabei deinen Verstand verlierst."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166044&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1856d06e-4f3a-4fc5-9921-39b9f76fddfa\', \'multiverseId\': 166044}, \'multiverseid\': 166044}, {\'name\': \'Mago dragón\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que el Mago dragón haga daño de combate a un jugador, cada jugador descarta su mano y roba siete cartas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero dragón\', \'flavor\': \'"Cederás a mi voluntad, con tu valiosa cordura o sin ella".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166617&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a29fa7af-10d8-43eb-9547-3e96edff529b\', \'multiverseId\': 166617}, \'multiverseid\': 166617}, {\'name\': \'Dragon mage\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que le Dragon mage inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, chaque joueur se défausse de sa main et pioche sept cartes.\', \'type\': \'Créature : dragon et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'« Vous vous soumettrez à ma volonté, et advienne que pourra de votre santé mentale. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166187&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7d7f902-540c-4d18-890e-9756fa1f1919\', \'multiverseId\': 166187}, \'multiverseid\': 166187}, {\'name\': \'Dracomago\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta il Dracomago infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, ogni giocatore scarta la propria mano e pesca sette carte.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Drago\', \'flavor\': \'"Ti piegherai al mio volere. Con o senza la tua preziosa sanità mentale".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166330&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b5cf89b-bdc7-437b-9642-00063de75371\', \'multiverseId\': 166330}, \'multiverseid\': 166330}, {\'name\': \'ドラゴン魔道士\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5dfe46c4-cfef-488e-a9ae-64bfbca43c81\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Dragão Mago\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que Dragão Mago causar dano de combate a um jogador, cada jogador descarta sua própria mão e compra sete cards.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Mago Dragão\', \'flavor\': \'"Curvar-te-ei à minha vontade—com ou sem tua preciosa sanidade."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166473&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2942b9f3-f91e-4912-b776-ca5b39e4b2f5\', \'multiverseId\': 166473}, \'multiverseid\': 166473}]', "[{'name': 'Drachenreißzähne', 'text': 'Die verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+1 und verursacht Trampelschaden.\\nWenn eine Kreatur mit umgewandelten Manakosten von 6 oder höher ins Spiel kommt, kannst du die Drachenreißzähne diese Kreatur verzaubernd aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück bringen.', 'type': 'Kreaturenverzauberung', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166074&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9a35dbea-0973-490f-a5ee-871c3579a2f1', 'multiverseId': 166074}, 'multiverseid': 166074}, {'name': 'Colmillos de dragón', 'text': 'La criatura encantada obtiene +1/+1 y tiene la habilidad de arrollar.\\nCuando una criatura con un coste de maná convertido de 6 o más entre en juego, puedes regresar los Colmillos de dragón de tu cementerio al juego encantando a esa criatura.', 'type': 'Encantar criatura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166647&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd806004c-b016-4123-8653-152cf89b9b27', 'multiverseId': 166647}, 'multiverseid': 166647}, {'name': 'Crocs du dragon', 'text': 'La créature enchantée gagne +1/+1 et a le piétinement.\\nQuand une créature ayant un coût converti de mana de 6 ou plus arrive en jeu, vous pouvez renvoyer en jeu les Crocs du dragon depuis votre cimetière pour enchanter cette créature.', 'type': 'Enchanter : créature', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166217&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '013053e1-834c-4dab-8aea-9e4e9401b963', 'multiverseId': 166217}, 'multiverseid': 166217}, {'name': 'Fauci del Drago', 'text': 'La creatura incantata prende +1/+1 e ha travolgere.\\nQuando una creatura con costo di mana convertito pari o superiore a 6 entra in gioco, puoi giocare le Fauci del Drago dal tuo cimitero per incantare quella creatura.', 'type': 'Incanta Creatura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166360&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '23323345-af81-48bc-a258-04d23cfac237', 'multiverseId': 166360}, 'multiverseid': 166360}, {'name': 'ドラゴンの牙', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '936a7d8e-0d69-443b-a0b6-934bac26ad10'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Presas de Dragão', 'text': 'A criatura encantada recebe +1/+1 e tem a habilidade de atropelar.\\nQuando uma criatura com custo de mana convertido maior ou igual a 6 entrar em jogo, você pode devolver Presas de Dragão de seu cemitério para o jogo encantando aquela criatura.', 'type': 'Encantar Criatura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166503&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c48a69b6-d688-497f-9fc6-cda0bcaf4230', 'multiverseId': 166503}, 'multiverseid': 166503}]", '[{\'name\': \'Drachenschatten\', \'text\': \'Die verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+0 und Furcht. (Sie kann nur von schwarzen und/oder Artefaktkreaturen geblockt werden.)\\nWenn eine Kreatur mit umgewandelten Manakosten von 6 oder höher ins Spiel kommt, kannst du den Drachenschatten diese Kreatur verzaubernd aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück bringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreaturenverzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166022&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a81a6dc-b678-4dab-9019-eb55d8110099\', \'multiverseId\': 166022}, \'multiverseid\': 166022}, {\'name\': \'Sombra de dragón\', \'text\': \'La criatura encantada obtiene +1/+0 y tiene la habilidad de inspirar temor. (No puede ser bloqueada excepto por criaturas artefacto y/o criaturas negras.)\\nCuando una criatura con un coste de maná convertido de 6 o más entre en juego, puedes regresar la Sombra de dragón de tu cementerio al juego encantando a esa criatura.\', \'type\': \'Encantar criatura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166595&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44ef3138-bbd1-4103-a9a0-647d75a739a8\', \'multiverseId\': 166595}, \'multiverseid\': 166595}, {\'name\': \'Ombre du dragon\', \'text\': "La créature enchantée gagne +1/+0 et a la peur. (Elle ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par des créatures-artefacts et/ou des créatures noires.)\\nQuand une créature ayant un coût converti de mana de 6 ou plus arrive en jeu, vous pouvez renvoyer en jeu l\'Ombre du dragon depuis votre cimetière pour enchanter cette créature.", \'type\': \'Enchanter : créature\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166165&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'178d42d6-e67e-456b-8ae5-166438bb7e91\', \'multiverseId\': 166165}, \'multiverseid\': 166165}, {\'name\': \'Ombra del Drago\', \'text\': "La creatura incantata prende +1/+0 e ha paura (non può essere bloccato tranne che da creature artefatto e/o da creature nere).\\nQuando una creatura con costo di mana convertito pari o superiore a 6 entra in gioco, puoi giocare l\'Ombra del Drago dal tuo cimitero per incantare quella creatura.", \'type\': \'Incanta Creatura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166308&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d721ed84-e73e-42b3-bca6-1622ba201d6e\', \'multiverseId\': 166308}, \'multiverseid\': 166308}, {\'name\': \'ドラゴンの影\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb8cab82-d846-4d5e-9187-23ee2fa9f411\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Sombra de Dragão\', \'text\': \'A criatura encantada recebe +1/+0 e tem a habilidade de amedrontar. (Ela só pode ser bloqueada por criaturas pretas e/ou criaturas artefato.)\\nQuando uma criatura com custo de mana convertido maior ou igual a 6 entrar em jogo, você pode devolver Sombra de Dragão de seu cemitério para o jogo encantando aquela criatura.\', \'type\': \'Encantar Criatura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166451&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ba4178b-53c0-4710-8e27-f94fa9ed4d28\', \'multiverseId\': 166451}, \'multiverseid\': 166451}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drachenschuppen\', \'text\': \'Die verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+2 und wird beim Angreifen nicht getappt.\\nWenn eine Kreatur mit umgewandelten Manakosten von 6 oder höher ins Spiel kommt, kannst du die Drachenschuppen diese Kreatur verzaubernd aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück bringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreaturenverzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165967&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d54ec5ab-eed9-4ea2-89a9-de357bc753ad\', \'multiverseId\': 165967}, \'multiverseid\': 165967}, {\'name\': \'Escamas de dragón\', \'text\': \'La criatura encantada obtiene +1/+2 y no se gira al atacar.\\nCuando una criatura con un coste de maná convertido de 6 o más entre en juego, puedes regresar las Escamas de dragón de tu cementerio al juego encantando a esa criatura.\', \'type\': \'Encantar criatura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166540&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa31db44-3901-47fd-81a7-a50dee7d23ac\', \'multiverseId\': 166540}, \'multiverseid\': 166540}, {\'name\': \'Écailles du dragon\', \'text\': "La créature enchantée gagne +1/+2, et attaquer avec elle ne la fait pas s\'engager.\\nQuand une créature ayant un coût converti de mana de 6 ou plus arrive en jeu, vous pouvez renvoyer en jeu les Écailles du dragon depuis votre cimetière pour enchanter cette créature.", \'type\': \'Enchanter : créature\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166110&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12a2b96d-3c7c-4195-bbd7-dfc5e1f5958d\', \'multiverseId\': 166110}, \'multiverseid\': 166110}, {\'name\': \'Scaglie del Drago\', \'text\': \'La creatura incantata prende +1/+2 e attacca senza TAPpare.\\nQuando una creatura con costo di mana convertito pari o superiore a 6 entra in gioco, puoi rimettere in gioco le Scaglie del Drago dal tuo cimitero per incantare quella creatura.\', \'type\': \'Incanta Creatura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166253&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f3e58c7-7a94-456a-916e-f9bfcc723808\', \'multiverseId\': 166253}, \'multiverseid\': 166253}, {\'name\': \'ドラゴンの鱗\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc04c2e4-7586-4f82-8615-0ad3514a9ace\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Escamas de Dragão\', \'text\': \'A criatura encantada recebe +1/+2 e não é virada para atacar.\\nQuando uma criatura com custo de mana convertido maior ou igual a 6 entrar em jogo, você pode devolver Escamas de Dragão de seu cemitério para o jogo, encantando aquela criatura.\', \'type\': \'Encantar Criatura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166396&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2871e9e7-08e3-4edd-a78c-b8040f2ba668\', \'multiverseId\': 166396}, \'multiverseid\': 166396}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drachensprecher-Schamane\', \'text\': \'Drachenzauber, die du spielst, kosten beim Ausspielen {2} weniger.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Barbar\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir sprechen die Sprache der Drachen, von Flammen und Zorn. Sie sprechen unsere Sprache, von Wildheit und Ehre. Zusammen werden wir eine Geschichte der Zerstörung erzählen, wie es sie noch nie gegeben hat."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166046&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be814ed6-96c5-4123-8a19-6e6aaa1504f2\', \'multiverseId\': 166046}, \'multiverseid\': 166046}, {\'name\': \'Chamán dragonhablante\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {2} menos jugar los hechizos de Dragón.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bárbaro\', \'flavor\': \'"Hablamos el idioma de flama y de cólera de los dragones. Ellos hablan nuestro idioma de furia y de honor. Juntos tramaremos un relato de destrucción sin igual".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166619&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ba76c09-47ec-4c5e-86e3-9d612d404bb7\', \'multiverseId\': 166619}, \'multiverseid\': 166619}, {\'name\': \'Shamane languedragon\', \'text\': \'Les sorts de dragon que vous jouez coûtent {2} de moins à jouer.\', \'type\': \'Créature : barbare\', \'flavor\': "« Nous parlons le langage de flamme et de rage des dragons. Ils parlent notre langue de fureur et d\'honneur. Ensemble, nous créerons un récit de destruction sans égal. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166189&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'146bca0c-7d61-40a0-96c7-a30f42442c84\', \'multiverseId\': 166189}, \'multiverseid\': 166189}, {\'name\': \'Sciamano Dracofono\', \'text\': \'Le magie Drago che giochi costano {2} in meno per essere giocate.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Barbaro\', \'flavor\': \'"Parliamo il linguaggio dei draghi, di fuoco e ira. Loro parlano il nostro, di furia e onore. Insieme porteremo un\\\'ondata di distruzione senza eguali".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166332&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ac4c473-1d83-47d2-8c5c-5f334b88a8e5\', \'multiverseId\': 166332}, \'multiverseid\': 166332}, {\'name\': \'ドラゴン語りのシャーマン\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'375dfca2-e310-4bb8-9bdd-122f19144234\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Xamã Dracontófilo\', \'text\': \'Suas mágicas de Dragão custam {2} a menos para serem jogadas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Barbarian\', \'flavor\': \'"Nós falamos a língua das chamas e da ira dos dragões. Eles falam nossa língua de honra e fúria. Juntos, teceremos um conto inigualável de destruição."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166475&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'231a8bb1-df8b-4236-a396-254243c84133\', \'multiverseId\': 166475}, \'multiverseid\': 166475}]', "[{'name': 'Drachensturm', 'text': 'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Drachenkarte und bringe sie ins Spiel. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.\\nSturm (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch spielst, kopiere ihn einmal für jeden Zauberspruch, der in diesem Zug bereits gespielt wurde.)', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166047&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ae2249e2-251a-40ba-8e9f-716036c7120b', 'multiverseId': 166047}, 'multiverseid': 166047}, {'name': 'Tormenta de dragones', 'text': 'Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de Dragón y ponla en juego. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.\\nTormenta (Cuando juegues este hechizo, cópialo por cada hechizo jugado antes que él en este turno.)', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166620&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'df6fa23b-0ab4-4a8b-a188-6f480255c62e', 'multiverseId': 166620}, 'multiverseid': 166620}, {'name': 'Orage des dragons', 'text': 'Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de dragon et mettez cette carte en jeu. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.\\nDéluge (Quand vous jouez ce sort, copiez-le pour chaque sort joué avant lui ce tour-ci.)', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166190&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fec42434-e3fe-4020-80d1-2929d9d0f24b', 'multiverseId': 166190}, 'multiverseid': 166190}, {'name': 'Dracotempesta', 'text': 'Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio, scegli una carta Drago e mettila in gioco. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\\nTempesta (quando giochi questa magia, copiala una volta per ogni magia giocata prima di questa durante questo turno).', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166333&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a24319e3-6aab-4b2c-9f52-5085b0e79988', 'multiverseId': 166333}, 'multiverseid': 166333}, {'name': 'ドラゴンの嵐', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8c4fcf28-b06d-4321-aa4e-c583bb172a3f'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Tempestade de Dragões', 'text': 'Procure em seu grimório por um card de Dragão e coloque-o em jogo. Depois, embaralhe seu grimório.\\nRajada (Quando você jogar esta mágica, faça uma cópia dela para cada mágica jogada antes dela neste turno.)', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166476&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c367d2a8-0ee7-4acd-bb9b-2be8395f2e47', 'multiverseId': 166476}, 'multiverseid': 166476}]", '[{\'name\': \'Drahtholzwald-Symbiot\', \'text\': \'Bringe einen Elf, den du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück: Enttappe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Spiele diese Fähigkeit nur einmal pro Zug.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Insekt\', \'flavor\': \'Er trinkt Müdigkeit.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166090&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc48dbfa-4889-4cc1-9906-8c32d0d1263f\', \'multiverseId\': 166090}, \'multiverseid\': 166090}, {\'name\': \'Simbionte de Wirewood\', \'text\': \'Regresar un Elfo que controles a la mano de su propietario: Endereza la criatura objetivo. Juega esta habilidad sólo una vez cada turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Insecto\', \'flavor\': \'Bebe fatiga.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166663&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09fe6303-3d65-4139-a973-3ef1e4333cd5\', \'multiverseId\': 166663}, \'multiverseid\': 166663}, {\'name\': \'Symbiote de Brinbois\', \'text\': "Renvoyez un elfe que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire : Dégagez la créature ciblée. Ne jouez cette capacité qu\'une seule fois par tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : insecte\', \'flavor\': \'Il se repaît de fatigue.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166233&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fef26c4-da7f-4abc-930d-2ede44846823\', \'multiverseId\': 166233}, \'multiverseid\': 166233}, {\'name\': \'Simbionte di Boscocavo\', \'text\': \'Il proprietario riprende in mano un Elfo che tu controlli: STAPpa una creatura bersaglio. Gioca questa abilità solo una volta per turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Insetto\', \'flavor\': \'Beve la fatica.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166376&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8d08b47-5677-4dcf-a571-bbdf1c38e232\', \'multiverseId\': 166376}, \'multiverseid\': 166376}, {\'name\': \'ワイアウッドの共生虫\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24e927ba-e586-4ad3-be18-6d52cb8888c3\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Simbiota de Wirewood\', \'text\': \'Devolva um Elfo que você controla para a mão de seu dono: Desvira a criatura alvo. Use esta habilidade apenas uma vez a cada turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Inseto\', \'flavor\': \'Ele bebe fadiga.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166519&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1523a44d-7231-48b4-80b2-b3f738620ff1\', \'multiverseId\': 166519}, \'multiverseid\': 166519}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drahtholzwald-Wächter\', \'text\': \'Waldumwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte aus deiner Hand ab: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Waldkarte, zeige diese Karte offen vor und nimm sie auf deine Hand. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Mutant\', \'flavor\': \'Baumlang und wahrscheinlich auch mit einem verwandt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166089&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f083929f-b6b4-4a3d-9d0b-56b5dedf5321\', \'multiverseId\': 166089}, \'multiverseid\': 166089}, {\'name\': \'Guardián de Wirewood\', \'text\': \'Ciclo de bosque {2}. ({2}, descartar esta carta de tu mano: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de bosque, muéstrala y ponla en tu mano. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Mutante elfo\', \'flavor\': \'Alto como un árbol y probablemente emparentado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166662&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acd9dd3e-d53e-4977-a4c0-2587dd2b0eac\', \'multiverseId\': 166662}, \'multiverseid\': 166662}, {\'name\': \'Vigile de Brinbois\', \'text\': \'Recyclage de forêt {2} ({2}, Défaussez-vous de cette carte depuis votre main : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de forêt, révélez-la, et ajoutez-la à votre main. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et mutant\', \'flavor\': "Aussi grand qu\'un arbre, et probablement de même souche.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166232&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86541025-588a-4992-8c3a-bd7ad339a4b1\', \'multiverseId\': 166232}, \'multiverseid\': 166232}, {\'name\': \'Guardiano di Boscocavo\', \'text\': \'Cicloforesta {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta dalla tua mano: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio, scegli una carta foresta, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mutante Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'Alto quanto un albero e probabilmente suo parente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166375&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e8fae3b-91a3-42ea-a908-008fbb9e2914\', \'multiverseId\': 166375}, \'multiverseid\': 166375}, {\'name\': \'ワイアウッドの守護者\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2421e3c3-b1cb-4fd2-a7d8-11c361270d9c\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Guardião de Wirewood\', \'text\': \'Reciclar Floresta {2} ({2}, Descarte este card de sua mão: Procure em seu grimório por um card de floresta, revele-o e coloque-o em sua mão. Depois, embaralhe seu grimório.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Mutante\', \'flavor\': \'Alto como uma árvore e, provavelmente, um parente delas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166518&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3538970-6cf9-4de8-a993-016f875930d7\', \'multiverseId\': 166518}, \'multiverseid\': 166518}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dämmerungselementar\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nVerhindere allen Schaden, der dem Dämmerungselementar zugefügt würde.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': \'Es war Mitternacht in den Daru-Ebenen, doch man könnte meinen, die Sonne würde gerade aufgehen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165964&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82c640ab-4721-47c6-8dd3-c6c4b4958abf\', \'multiverseId\': 165964}, \'multiverseid\': 165964}, {\'name\': \'Elemental del alba\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nPrevén todo el daño que se le fuera a hacer al Elemental del alba.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'Era medianoche en la Llanura de Daru y aun así parecía que el sol estaba saliendo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166537&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'423b02b7-4448-44eb-866d-8af44b731452\', \'multiverseId\': 166537}, \'multiverseid\': 166537}, {\'name\': "Élémental de l\'aube", \'text\': "Vol\\nPrévenez toutes les blessures qui devraient être infligées à l\'Élémental de l\'aube.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': "Il était minuit sur les plaines de Daru, mais c\'était comme si le soleil se levait déjà.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166107&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1db688f7-7ae4-4b6a-9e2b-44e7f7339ec6\', \'multiverseId\': 166107}, \'multiverseid\': 166107}, {\'name\': "Elementale dell\'Alba", \'text\': "Volare\\nPrevieni tutto il danno che verrebbe inflitto all\'Elementale dell\'Alba.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': \'Era mezzanotte sulle Piane di Daru, eppure sembrava che il sole stesse per sorgere.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166250&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'231c1722-ada6-4a90-af18-5d2c6a3f6dfb\', \'multiverseId\': 166250}, \'multiverseid\': 166250}, {\'name\': \'曙光の精霊\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6373f9c0-6f9e-4d27-8155-9709040a3f80\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Elemental do Alvorecer\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nPrevine todo o dano que seria causado a Elemental do Alvorecer.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'Era meia-noite na Planície de Daru, embora parecesse que o sol estava nascendo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166393&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e61fb590-f19c-409a-95e2-55b68f2f4d09\', \'multiverseId\': 166393}, \'multiverseid\': 166393}]', '[{\'name\': \'Edler Tempelritter\', \'text\': \'Der Edle Tempelritter wird beim Angreifen nicht getappt\\nEbenenumwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte aus deiner Hand ab: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Ebenenkarte, zeige diese Karte offen vor und nimm sie auf deine Hand. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Kleriker, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165976&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bde2135b-2ad6-4b49-8da6-ed4eb4608ebf\', \'multiverseId\': 165976}, \'multiverseid\': 165976}, {\'name\': \'Templario noble\', \'text\': \'El Templario noble no se gira al atacar.\\nCiclo de llanura {2}. ({2}, descartar esta carta de tu mano: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de llanura, muéstrala y ponla en tu mano. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado clérigo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166549&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09e307bd-a426-4fe6-b018-b4a5bb7b545b\', \'multiverseId\': 166549}, \'multiverseid\': 166549}, {\'name\': \'Noble templier\', \'text\': "Attaquer avec ce Noble templier ne le fait pas s\'engager.\\nRecyclage de plaine {2} ({2}, Défaussez-vous de cette carte depuis votre main : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de plaine, révélez-la, et ajoutez-la à votre main. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.)", \'type\': \'Créature : clerc et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166119&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8add8e2a-4726-4bdc-8618-26c75f3fe917\', \'multiverseId\': 166119}, \'multiverseid\': 166119}, {\'name\': \'Templare Nobile\', \'text\': \'Il Templare Nobile attacca senza TAPpare.\\nCiclopianura {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta dalla tua mano: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio, scegli una carta pianura, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Chierico\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166262&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'473011fa-b7dc-4bdc-9ffe-1fab1038affc\', \'multiverseId\': 166262}, \'multiverseid\': 166262}, {\'name\': \'気高き院僧\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'521f936b-d7ee-4d5f-a74c-7243e713d46b\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Templário Nobre\', \'text\': \'Templário Nobre não é virado para atacar.\\nReciclar Planície {2} ({2}, Descarte este card de sua mão: Procure em seu grimório por um card de planície, revele-o e coloque-o em sua mão. Depois, embaralhe seu grimório.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado Clérigo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166405&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33f85847-3bba-423e-9812-9ca3c55b59fe\', \'multiverseId\': 166405}, \'multiverseid\': 166405}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eingefroren\', \'text\': \'Die verzauberte Kreatur enttappt nicht während des Enttappsegments ihres Beherrschers.\\nWenn der verzauberten Kreatur Schaden zugefügt wird, zerstöre sie.\', \'type\': \'Kreaturenverzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165993&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'397f40c1-8c28-49cf-ab4e-c6f3dd7acbb5\', \'multiverseId\': 165993}, \'multiverseid\': 165993}, {\'name\': \'Congelado en un témpano\', \'text\': \'La criatura encantada no se endereza durante el paso de enderezar de su controlador.\\nCuando la criatura encantada reciba daño, destrúyela.\', \'type\': \'Encantar criatura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166566&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d4c495f-b4e0-4862-8913-5b69a738623e\', \'multiverseId\': 166566}, \'multiverseid\': 166566}, {\'name\': \'Gelé\', \'text\': "La créature enchantée ne se dégage pas pendant l\'étape de dégagement de son contrôleur.\\nQuand des blessures sont infligées à la créature enchantée, détruisez-la.", \'type\': \'Enchanter : créature\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166136&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed0cf2c7-5a20-4254-8594-adaea0b53294\', \'multiverseId\': 166136}, \'multiverseid\': 166136}, {\'name\': \'Congelato\', \'text\': \'La creatura incantata non STAPpa durante lo STAP del proprio controllore.\\nQuando viene inflitto danno alla creatura incantata, distruggila.\', \'type\': \'Incanta Creatura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166279&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84827a01-1cae-43c5-bbc8-1ed0422e815e\', \'multiverseId\': 166279}, \'multiverseid\': 166279}, {\'name\': \'凍結\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f928bb7-3052-4ffd-9aab-45f78584bac3\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Sólido como Gelo\', \'text\': \'A criatura encantada não é desvirada durante a etapa de desvirar de seu controlador.\\nQuando dano for causado à criatura encantada, destrua-a.\', \'type\': \'Encantar Criatura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166422&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05fb3ce2-2a9d-4277-bfad-4e1bbd04ed89\', \'multiverseId\': 166422}, \'multiverseid\': 166422}]', "[{'name': 'Elfischer Abweichling', 'text': '{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {G}{G}{G}.\\nWaldumwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte aus deiner Hand ab: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Waldkarte, zeige diese Karte offen vor und nimm sie auf deine Hand. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.)', 'type': 'Kreatur — Elf, Mutant', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166075&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e56bb73a-e717-4247-b492-8afbba9d7c7d', 'multiverseId': 166075}, 'multiverseid': 166075}, {'name': 'Aberración élfica', 'text': '{T}: Agrega {G}{G}{G} a tu reserva de maná.\\nCiclo de bosque {2}.({2}, descartar esta carta de tu mano: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de bosque, muéstrala y ponla en tu mano. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.)', 'type': 'Criatura — Mutante elfo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166648&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '41839459-cfa3-4bc1-8eab-2f2b7360a695', 'multiverseId': 166648}, 'multiverseid': 166648}, {'name': 'Aberration elfe', 'text': '{T} : Ajoutez {G}{G}{G} à votre réserve.\\nRecyclage de forêt {2} ({2}, Défaussez-vous de cette carte depuis votre main : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de forêt, révélez-la, et ajoutez-la à votre main. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.)', 'type': 'Créature : elfe et mutant', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166218&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5c3765ee-dcef-4320-b660-cd6ce95b41e9', 'multiverseId': 166218}, 'multiverseid': 166218}, {'name': 'Aberrazione Elfica', 'text': '{T}: Aggiungi {G}{G}{G} alla tua riserva di mana.\\nCicloforesta {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta dalla tua mano: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio, scegli una carta foresta, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.)', 'type': 'Creatura — Mutante Elfo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166361&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4bfffb30-cc30-4ba9-8951-6d1b09d7bee0', 'multiverseId': 166361}, 'multiverseid': 166361}, {'name': 'エルフの逸脱者', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '31d438fe-b59f-45c0-afb6-1f2151cf5e6c'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Aberração Élfica', 'text': '{T}: Adiciona {G}{G}{G} à sua reserva de mana.\\nReciclar Floresta {2} ({2}, Descarte este card de sua mão: Procure em seu grimório por um card de floresta, revele-o e coloque-o em sua mão. Depois, embaralhe seu grimório.)', 'type': 'Criatura — Elfo Mutante', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166504&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5849ff54-6f13-447b-a8ff-d56e7699c4cb', 'multiverseId': 166504}, 'multiverseid': 166504}]", '[{\'name\': \'Entlastung\', \'text\': \'Ein Spieler deiner Wahl wirft zwei Karten ab.\\nUmwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte aus deiner Hand ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Kabbalisten-Novizen beginnen ihre Lehre voller Hoffnungen und Ängste. Sie beenden sie ohne beides.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166034&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1476db6f-3649-4e2b-b6f9-7e3f69df3706\', \'multiverseId\': 166034}, \'multiverseid\': 166034}, {\'name\': \'Desahogarse\', \'text\': \'El jugador objetivo descarta dos cartas.\\nCiclo {2}. {2}, descartar esta carta de tu mano: Roba una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Los iniciados de la Cábala comienzan el entrenamiento llenos de esperanzas y de temores. Se gradúan sin ellos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166607&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91d534d8-1cdb-4012-82e4-015a9b7369e2\', \'multiverseId\': 166607}, \'multiverseid\': 166607}, {\'name\': \'Décharge\', \'text\': \'Le joueur ciblé se défausse de deux cartes.\\nRecyclage {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte de votre main : Piochez une carte.)\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Les initiés de la Coterie entament leur formation plein d\'espoirs et de craintes. Ils la finissent sans rien.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166177&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73817678-f6e7-4236-9415-dba17f9e6337\', \'multiverseId\': 166177}, \'multiverseid\': 166177}, {\'name\': \'Alleggerire\', \'text\': \'Il giocatore bersaglio scarta due carte.\\nCiclo {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta dalla tua mano: Pesca una carta).\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Gli iniziati della Cabala cominciano il loro addestramento pieni di speranze e di paure. Lo concludono privi di entrambe.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166320&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50931dea-feb3-4726-a5cc-f49a6bf151b8\', \'multiverseId\': 166320}, \'multiverseid\': 166320}, {\'name\': \'荷降ろし\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f472e95-f845-4726-a788-f0d8cc8b9291\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Descarregar\', \'text\': \'O jogador alvo descarta dois cards.\\nReciclar {2} ({2}, Descarte este card de sua mão: Compre um card.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Os iniciados da Cabala iniciam seu treinamento cheios de medos e esperanças. Formam-se sem nenhum deles.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166463&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d188c8c-832d-4896-b595-719464136f99\', \'multiverseId\': 166463}, \'multiverseid\': 166463}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ewiger Drache\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{3}{W}{W}: Bringe den Ewigen Drachen aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück. Spiele diese Fähigkeit nur während deines Versorgungssegments.\\nEbenenumwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte aus deiner Hand ab: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Ebenenkarte, zeige diese Karte offen vor und nimm sie auf deine Hand. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache, Geist\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165969&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51e0acee-0b92-4a78-a3b4-ee5eeb947d56\', \'multiverseId\': 165969}, \'multiverseid\': 165969}, {\'name\': \'Dragón eterno\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{3}{W}{W}: Regresa el Dragón eterno de tu cementerio a tu mano. Juega esta habilidad sólo durante tu mantenimiento.\\nCiclo de llanura {2}. ({2}, descartar esta carta de tu mano: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de llanura, muéstrala y ponla en tu mano. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espíritu dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166542&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19ad4f1f-9384-4a3f-8175-ee8b3f193256\', \'multiverseId\': 166542}, \'multiverseid\': 166542}, {\'name\': \'Dragon éternel\', \'text\': "Vol\\n{3}{W}{W} : Renvoyez le Dragon éternel depuis votre cimetière dans votre main. Ne jouez cette capacité que pendant votre phase d\'entretien.\\nRecyclage de plaine {2} ({2}, Défaussez-vous de cette carte depuis votre main : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de plaine, révélez-la, et ajoutez-la à votre main. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.)", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon et esprit\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166112&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17188b12-1065-4d2a-a936-56b6e8ea2557\', \'multiverseId\': 166112}, \'multiverseid\': 166112}, {\'name\': \'Drago Eterno\', \'text\': \'Volare\\n{3}{W}{W}: Riprendi in mano il Drago Eterno dal tuo cimitero. Gioca questa abilità solo durante il tuo mantenimento.\\nCiclopianura {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta dalla tua mano: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio, scegli una carta pianura, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Spirito Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166255&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe4098b3-8fd0-4496-b538-9bf154cd4082\', \'multiverseId\': 166255}, \'multiverseid\': 166255}, {\'name\': \'永遠のドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38b50c4b-8b22-40b1-81a5-dca86c6723e3\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Dragão Perpétuo\', \'text\': \'Voar\\n{3}{W}{W}: Devolve Dragão Perpétuo de seu cemitério para sua mão. Use esta habilidade somente durante sua manutenção.\\nReciclar Planície {2} ({2}, Descarte este card de sua mão: Procure em seu grimório por um card de planície, revele-o e coloque-o em sua mão. Depois, embaralhe seu grimório.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espírito Dragão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166398&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d28969fa-5af0-4b4f-b19a-d2408c70a62d\', \'multiverseId\': 166398}, \'multiverseid\': 166398}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fanatischer Inquisitor\', \'text\': \'{1}{W}: Der nächste 1 Schadenspunkt, der dem Fanatischen Inquisitor in diesem Zug zugefügt würde, wird stattdessen einer Kreatur deiner Wahl zugefügt.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich gebe nur zurück, was rechtmäßig anderen gehört."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165984&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92495c29-100d-45c7-990d-003dced674b2\', \'multiverseId\': 165984}, \'multiverseid\': 165984}, {\'name\': \'Inquisidor ferviente\', \'text\': \'{1}{W}: El siguiente punto de daño que se le fuera a hacer al Inquisidor ferviente este turno, en vez de eso, se le hace a la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo\', \'flavor\': \'"I only return what rightly belongs to another."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166557&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e84da29-ec36-4a84-b7d6-2e5ab28f8812\', \'multiverseId\': 166557}, \'multiverseid\': 166557}, {\'name\': \'Inquisiteur zélé\', \'text\': "{1}{W} : La prochaine 1 blessure qui devrait être infligée à l\'Inquisiteur zélé ce tour-ci est infligée à la créature ciblée à la place.", \'type\': \'Créature : clerc\', \'flavor\': \'« Je ne rends à autrui que ce qui lui appartient de droit. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166127&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c001c7ec-c57d-41d5-8b4e-922d1431e9be\', \'multiverseId\': 166127}, \'multiverseid\': 166127}, {\'name\': \'Inquisitore Fanatico\', \'text\': "{1}{W}: Il prossimo punto danno che verrebbe inflitto all\'Inquisitore Fanatico in questo turno viene invece inflitto a una creatura bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico\', \'flavor\': \'"Restituisco solo quello che di diritto spetta ad altri".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166270&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1038a005-3cd1-4710-8297-c7012ea62d91\', \'multiverseId\': 166270}, \'multiverseid\': 166270}, {\'name\': \'盲信の審問官\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'443af9bb-e284-497d-9f33-25fd0d8ed222\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Inquisidor Zeloso\', \'text\': \'{1}{W}: O próximo 1 ponto de dano que seria causado a Inquisidor Zeloso neste turno, em vez disso, é causado à criatura alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo\', \'flavor\': \'"Devolvo apenas o que por direito pertence a outro."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166413&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdc87aca-f1e5-4a9b-b77c-07d1c70f43d0\', \'multiverseId\': 166413}, \'multiverseid\': 166413}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fehlgeleiteter Zorn\', \'text\': \'Ein Spieler deiner Wahl opfert eine bleibende Karte.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Erst als sein Wutanfall vorbei war, bemerkte Varv, dass er sein Haus niedergebrannt, seine Waffen zerstört und seinen Kumpel Furt getötet hatte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166056&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c17d8e03-f919-456c-9cec-f909f23e76aa\', \'multiverseId\': 166056}, \'multiverseid\': 166056}, {\'name\': \'Cólera insensata\', \'text\': \'El jugador objetivo sacrifica un permanente.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando pasó su enojo, Varv se dio cuenta de que había reducido a cenizas su hogar, destruido sus armas y matado a su amigo Furt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166629&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a32105b-a1ab-4fd4-97b5-064bad4789f5\', \'multiverseId\': 166629}, \'multiverseid\': 166629}, {\'name\': \'Rage malavisée\', \'text\': \'Le joueur ciblé sacrifie un permanent.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Quand il fut calmé, Varv réalisa qu\'il avait réduit sa maison en cendres, détruit ses armes, et massacré son ami Furt.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166199&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d5135bc-0418-4d01-a96f-7d40f23350b7\', \'multiverseId\': 166199}, \'multiverseid\': 166199}, {\'name\': \'Rabbia Fuorviata\', \'text\': \'Il giocatore bersaglio sacrifica un permanente.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Solo quando l\'ira fu passata Varv realizzò che aveva bruciato la propria casa, distrutto le sue armi e ucciso il suo amico Furt.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166342&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afa43268-d419-475a-bc50-7d06ae4835b2\', \'multiverseId\': 166342}, \'multiverseid\': 166342}, {\'name\': \'的外れの激怒\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1402aa0-ba69-4928-be9d-6856cd7ce863\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Raiva Mal Orientada\', \'text\': \'O jogador alvo sacrifica uma permanente.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Só depois que a explosão de raiva passou Varv percebeu que tinha incendiado sua casa, destruído suas armas e matado seu amigo Furt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166485&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10e06b5e-33df-42b1-89c2-86bfc764b408\', \'multiverseId\': 166485}, \'multiverseid\': 166485}]', "[{'name': 'Felsenjockey', 'text': 'Du kannst den Felsenjockey nicht spielen, wenn du in diesem Zug bereits ein Land ausgespielt hast.\\nDu kannst kein Land ausspielen, wenn du in diesem Zug den Felsenjockey ausgespielt hast.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Goblin', 'flavor': 'Goblins wissen nicht viel über Physik, aber sie wissen einiges über Felsen und Herunterfallen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166058&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '603b86a1-c682-4461-92bd-6f32955b67d9', 'multiverseId': 166058}, 'multiverseid': 166058}, {'name': 'Jinete de rocas', 'text': 'No puedes jugar el Jinete de rocas si jugaste una tierra este turno.\\nNo puedes jugar tierras si jugaste el Jinete de rocas este turno.', 'type': 'Criatura — Trasgo', 'flavor': 'Los trasgos no saben mucho de Física, pero saben mucho de caídas y de rocas.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166631&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '863e8137-a1a1-4e4e-9aac-e33141be006f', 'multiverseId': 166631}, 'multiverseid': 166631}, {'name': 'Chevaucheur de rocher', 'text': 'Vous ne pouvez pas jouer le Chevaucheur de rocher si vous avez joué un terrain pendant ce tour-ci.\\nVous ne pouvez pas jouer de terrain si vous avez joué le Chevaucheur de rocher pendant ce tour-ci.', 'type': 'Créature : gobelin', 'flavor': 'Les gobelins ne comprennent peut-être que goutte aux lois de la physique, mais ils en connaissent un rayon sur la chute et les rochers.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166201&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '06d61bac-1139-4f21-b38d-f33b290fa244', 'multiverseId': 166201}, 'multiverseid': 166201}, {'name': 'Cavalca Rocce', 'text': 'Non puoi giocare il Cavalca Rocce se hai giocato almeno una carta terra in questo turno.\\nNon puoi giocare terre se hai giocato il Cavalca Rocce in questo turno.', 'type': 'Creatura — Goblin', 'flavor': 'Forse i goblin non sanno molto di fisica, ma sono degli esperti sul cadere e sulle rocce.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166344&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '28994abf-fbcd-4d7c-b855-8aa286504adb', 'multiverseId': 166344}, 'multiverseid': 166344}, {'name': '岩乗り', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '02d2be24-61aa-4884-9722-ca433128095c'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Jóquei de Pedras', 'text': 'Você não pode baixar Jóquei de Pedras se tiver baixado um terreno neste turno.\\nVocê não pode baixar terrenos se tiver baixado Jóquei de Pedras neste turno.', 'type': 'Criatura — Goblin', 'flavor': 'Os goblins não sabem muito sobre física, mas sabem bastante sobre quedas e pedras.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166487&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b25071cb-0771-4ba3-9c97-1cd5b9598c31', 'multiverseId': 166487}, 'multiverseid': 166487}]", "[{'name': 'Feuerstrom', 'text': 'Feuersturm fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl Schadenspunkte in Höhe der höchsten umgewandelten Manakosten unter den bleibenden Karten, die du kontrollierst, zu.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': 'Drachenfeuer schmilzt alle Instrumente, die eigentlich dazu gedacht waren, es zu messen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166064&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '936aecbf-3d0e-459a-ad1d-5399c85fe9b3', 'multiverseId': 166064}, 'multiverseid': 166064}, {'name': 'Torrente de fuego', 'text': 'El Torrente de fuego hace una cantidad de daño igual al coste de maná convertido más alto que haya entre los permanentes que controles a la criatura o jugador objetivo.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': 'El fuego de dragón derrite cualquier instrumento diseñado para medirlo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166637&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b5f4e5ff-8576-46d2-a1d7-d87d135ca691', 'multiverseId': 166637}, 'multiverseid': 166637}, {'name': 'Torrent de feu', 'text': 'Le Torrent de feu inflige à une cible, créature ou joueur, un nombre de blessures égal au coût converti de mana le plus élevé parmi les permanents que vous contrôlez.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': 'Le feu des dragons fait fondre les instruments conçus pour en mesurer la chaleur.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166207&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1b907c5a-9169-46bb-8105-579d9c2fb657', 'multiverseId': 166207}, 'multiverseid': 166207}, {'name': 'Torrente di Fuoco', 'text': 'Il Torrente di Fuoco infligge un danno pari al più alto costo di mana convertito tra i permanenti che controlli a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': 'Il fuoco del drago distrugge anche gli strumenti costruiti apposta per misurarlo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166350&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4cf96381-e0eb-4c83-a13b-8256ca6d7bd2', 'multiverseId': 166350}, 'multiverseid': 166350}, {'name': '火炎流', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '20575e64-18be-4d08-8378-02e72c42d022'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Torrente de Fogo', 'text': 'Torrente de Fogo causa à criatura alvo ou ao jogador alvo uma quantidade de pontos de dano igual ao maior custo de mana convertido dentre as permanentes que você controla.', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': 'O fogo de um dragão derrete qualquer instrumento utilizado para medi-lo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166493&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '620a0af5-f9fc-495d-95f3-1dfd566b36a0', 'multiverseId': 166493}, 'multiverseid': 166493}]", '[{\'name\': \'Feuerzahn-Puma\', \'text\': \'{R}: Der Feuerzahn-Puma erhält +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nGebirgsumwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte aus deiner Hand ab: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Gebirgekarte, zeige diese Karte offen vor und nimm sie auf deine Hand. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze, Bestie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166041&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a8dde95-9e0f-4a66-8ae2-9342f0bfcc1d\', \'multiverseId\': 166041}, \'multiverseid\': 166041}, {\'name\': \'Puma colmillos carbonizados\', \'text\': \'{R}: El Puma colmillos carbonizados obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno.\\nCiclo de montaña {2}.({2}, descartar esta carta de tu mano: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de montaña, muéstrala y ponla en tu mano. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia felina\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166614&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f60dad3-730b-4cfe-a36e-426087664724\', \'multiverseId\': 166614}, \'multiverseid\': 166614}, {\'name\': \'Couguar cendredent\', \'text\': "{R} : Le Couguar cendredent gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nRecyclage de montagne {2} ({2}, Défaussez-vous de cette carte depuis votre main : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de montagne, révélez-la, et ajoutez-la à votre main. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.)", \'type\': \'Créature : chat et bête\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166184&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b91f3e7-0f08-4613-8936-48056685be8f\', \'multiverseId\': 166184}, \'multiverseid\': 166184}, {\'name\': \'Coguaro Dentenero\', \'text\': \'{R}: Il Coguaro Dentenero prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\\nCiclomontagna {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta dalla tua mano: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio, scegli una carta montagna, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia Felino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166327&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70f908a7-c4a7-4d92-9447-bff1f8e2b78d\', \'multiverseId\': 166327}, \'multiverseid\': 166327}, {\'name\': \'黒焦げ牙のクーガー\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eec5c71c-14ba-4049-ac88-da604b4b7e01\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Puma Dentes-de-Carvão\', \'text\': \'{R}: Puma Dentes-de-Carvão recebe +1/+0 até o final do turno.\\nReciclar Montanha {2} ({2}, Descarte este card de sua mão: Procure em seu grimório por um card de montanha, revele-o e coloque-o em sua mão. Depois, embaralhe seu grimório.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Besta Felino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166470&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdcc8ee3-8868-421d-8937-b85f2bb2f557\', \'multiverseId\': 166470}, \'multiverseid\': 166470}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fitmachen\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines du erhältst 6 Lebenspunkte dazu; oder verhindere die nächsten 6 Schadenspunkte, die in diesem Zug einer Kreatur deiner Wahl zugefügt würden.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Erhebe dich ein weiteres Mal und setze dein Werk fort, unsere Feinde zu zerstören." —Karona, falsche Göttin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165978&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a76a40c4-3fec-462e-ac1a-352aa2bbc73e\', \'multiverseId\': 165978}, \'multiverseid\': 165978}, {\'name\': \'Recuperarse\', \'text\': \'Elige uno: Gana 6 vidas; o prevén los siguientes 6 puntos de daño que se le fuera a hacer a la criatura objetivo este turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Levántate una vez más, para que puedas continuar destruyendo a nuestros enemigos". Karona, diosa falsa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166551&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe27fea4-6991-4528-9079-3f8c334693e0\', \'multiverseId\': 166551}, \'multiverseid\': 166551}, {\'name\': \'Analepsie\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un Vous gagnez 6 points de vie ; ou prévenez, ce tour-ci, les prochaines 6 blessures sur une créature ciblée.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Revenez, pour continuer à éliminer nos ennemis » —Karona, fausse divinité\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166121&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e1d98f1-3be5-438e-9d39-cfda7610740c\', \'multiverseId\': 166121}, \'multiverseid\': 166121}, {\'name\': \'Recuperare\', \'text\': \'Scegli una delle seguenti - Guadagni 6 punti vita; oppure previeni i prossimi 6 danni che verrebbero inflitti a una creatura bersaglio in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Sorgi ancora una volta, per continuare a distruggere i nostri nemici". —Karona, dio fasullo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166264&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d69f626-afb6-4d0d-ae55-fe5dca9830af\', \'multiverseId\': 166264}, \'multiverseid\': 166264}, {\'name\': \'療養\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'260b9403-2821-40c3-baf9-b11962417a58\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Recuperar-se\', \'text\': \'Escolha um Você ganha 6 pontos de vida; ou previne os próximos 6 pontos de dano que seriam causados à criatura alvo neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Ergue-te uma vez mais, para que continues a destruir nossos inimigos." —Karona, falso deus\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166407&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aea5c8fe-42ae-4c48-9ce3-c1981e75e008\', \'multiverseId\': 166407}, \'multiverseid\': 166407}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flügelscherben\', \'text\': \'Ein Spieler deiner Wahl opfert eine angreifende Kreatur.\\nSturm (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch spielst, kopiere ihn einmal für jeden Zauberspruch, der in diesem Zug bereits gespielt wurde.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165982&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf1c1b99-da0f-4f33-91bf-8fedfdd8177b\', \'multiverseId\': 165982}, \'multiverseid\': 165982}, {\'name\': \'Fragmentos de ala\', \'text\': \'El jugador objetivo sacrifica una criatura atacante.\\nTormenta (Cuando juegues este hechizo, cópialo por cada hechizo jugado antes que él en este turno.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166555&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7e92137-3efa-4b65-a330-e9bd1dd40097\', \'multiverseId\': 166555}, \'multiverseid\': 166555}, {\'name\': "Échardes d\'ailes", \'text\': \'Le joueur ciblé sacrifie une créature attaquante.\\nDéluge (Quand vous jouez ce sort, copiez-le pour chaque sort joué avant lui ce tour-ci.)\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166125&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6d05de7-6ef4-46b5-87ee-21da98dd5226\', \'multiverseId\': 166125}, \'multiverseid\': 166125}, {\'name\': "Frammenti d\'Ala", \'text\': \'Il giocatore bersaglio sacrifica una creatura attaccante.\\nTempesta (quando giochi questa magia, copiala una volta per ogni magia giocata prima di questa durante questo turno).\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166268&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ef20662-c178-4174-9957-f8be6c894eab\', \'multiverseId\': 166268}, \'multiverseid\': 166268}, {\'name\': \'翼の破片\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5322e215-6e0b-45ae-9867-3025806fed2c\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Retalhos de Asas\', \'text\': \'O jogador alvo sacrifica uma criatura atacante.\\nRajada (Quando você jogar esta mágica, faça uma cópia dela para cada mágica jogada antes dela neste turno.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166411&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a9e39b1-ec07-484c-bf01-ea1a22fd5a8c\', \'multiverseId\': 166411}, \'multiverseid\': 166411}]', '[{\'name\': \'Form des Drachens\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments fügt Form des Drachens einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 5 Schadenspunkte zu.\\nAm Ende jedes Zuges geht dein Lebenspunktestand auf 5.\\nNichtfliegende Kreaturen können dich nicht angreifen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166050&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71203dc9-72e3-46f4-af95-491fad6b586c\', \'multiverseId\': 166050}, \'multiverseid\': 166050}, {\'name\': \'Forma del dragón\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, la Forma del dragón hace 5 puntos de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo.Al final de cada turno, tu total de vida es 5.\\nLas criaturas que no tengan la habilidad de volar no pueden atacarte.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166623&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e43e6a48-79bd-415d-91c6-86682027a87e\', \'multiverseId\': 166623}, \'multiverseid\': 166623}, {\'name\': \'Forme du dragon\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre entretien, la Forme du dragon inflige 5 blessures à une cible, créature ou joueur.\\nÀ la fin de chaque tour, votre total de points de vie devient 5.\\nLes créatures sans le vol ne peuvent pas vous attaquer.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166193&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1d0047f-b5b1-414a-a93b-d517f3ba40fd\', \'multiverseId\': 166193}, \'multiverseid\': 166193}, {\'name\': \'Forma del Drago\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, la Forma del Drago infligge 5 danni a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.\\nAlla fine di ogni turno, il tuo totale dei punti vita diventa 5.\\nLe creature senza volare non possono attaccarti.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166336&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea8edb4e-ad2f-4121-b2fd-1af87df4826a\', \'multiverseId\': 166336}, \'multiverseid\': 166336}, {\'name\': \'ドラゴン変化\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfbb1700-7529-4c8c-8f37-af590b105431\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Forma do Dragão\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, Forma do Dragão causa 5 pontos de dano à criatura ou ao jogador alvo.\\nNo final de cada turno, o seu total de pontos de vida torna-se 5.\\nAs criaturas sem a habilidade de voar não podem atacá-lo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166479&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb1c8e77-8a40-4ace-9e7c-477948fb8380\', \'multiverseId\': 166479}, \'multiverseid\': 166479}]', "[{'name': 'Front-Stratege', 'text': 'Morph {W} (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur spielen. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Morph-Kosten auf.)\\nWenn der Front-Stratege aufgedeckt wird, verhindere allen Kampfschaden, den Nicht-Soldaten in diesem Zug zufügen würden.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Soldat', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165972&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '03403230-e14c-4825-9db5-4e0f9c331bd4', 'multiverseId': 165972}, 'multiverseid': 165972}, {'name': 'Estratega de primera línea', 'text': 'Metamorfosis {W}. (Puedes jugar esta carta boca abajo como una criatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Ponla boca arriba en cualquier momento pagando su coste de metamorfosis.)\\nCuando el Estratega de primera línea se ponga boca arriba, tienes que prevenir todo el daño de combate que criaturas que no sean Soldados fueran a hacer este turno.', 'type': 'Criatura — Soldado', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166545&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e451e85b-9a08-4f36-9851-f1006e7a6a28', 'multiverseId': 166545}, 'multiverseid': 166545}, {'name': 'Stratège du front', 'text': 'Mue {W}(Vous pouvez jouer cette carte face cachée comme une créature 2/2 pour {3}. Retournez-la quand vous le désirez pour son coût de mue.)\\nQuand le Stratège du front est retourné face visible, prévenez toutes les blessures de combat qui devraient être infligées par les créatures non-soldats pendant ce tour.', 'type': 'Créature : soldat', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166115&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ac59f5c9-ae07-4866-a5e0-3eff954fa3f0', 'multiverseId': 166115}, 'multiverseid': 166115}, {'name': 'Stratega del Fronte', 'text': 'Metamorfosi {W} (puoi giocare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di metamorfosi.)\\nQuando lo Stratega del Fronte viene girato a faccia in su, previeni tutti i danni da combattimento che le creature non Soldato infliggono in questo turno.', 'type': 'Creatura — Soldato', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166258&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c381d56b-27f3-4084-8d01-208d993d585e', 'multiverseId': 166258}, 'multiverseid': 166258}, {'name': '最前線の策士', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9153fb56-efe7-441b-ab8e-c6d2282f4139'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Estrategista do Front', 'text': 'Metamorfose {W} (Você pode baixar este card com a face voltada para baixo como uma criatura 2/2 por {3}. Volte sua face para cima a qualquer momento pagando seu custo de metamorfose.)\\nQuando a face de Estrategista do Front for voltada para cima, previne todo o dano de combate que criaturas que não sejam Soldados causariam neste turno.', 'type': 'Criatura — Soldado', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166401&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bd6a936f-d414-4e31-953b-d7bc1e096666', 'multiverseId': 166401}, 'multiverseid': 166401}]", '[{\'name\': \'Funkendusche\', \'text\': \'Spritzende Funken fügen einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\\nUmwandlung {R} ({R}, wirf diese Karte aus deiner Hand ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Das ist die einzige Art Dusche, die Goblins jemals tolerieren werden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166062&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c8bf3e9-208e-4b55-a9e1-b393de654174\', \'multiverseId\': 166062}, \'multiverseid\': 166062}, {\'name\': \'Rocío de chispas\', \'text\': \'El Rocío de chispas hace 1 punto de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo.\\nCiclo {R}.({R}, descartar esta carta de tu mano: Roba una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Es la única clase de baño que toleran los trasgos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166635&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81b1004f-0b8b-43e1-84d2-1b11c0641f9e\', \'multiverseId\': 166635}, \'multiverseid\': 166635}, {\'name\': "Giclée d\'étincelles", \'text\': "La Giclée d\'étincelles inflige 1 blessure à une cible, créature ou joueur.\\nRecyclage {R} ({R}, défaussez-vous de cette carte de votre main : Piochez une carte.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "C\'est le seul type de douche que les gobelins tolèrent.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166205&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9958b504-8230-420e-a950-5c35b4a94946\', \'multiverseId\': 166205}, \'multiverseid\': 166205}, {\'name\': \'Spruzzo di Scintille\', \'text\': \'Lo Spruzzo di Scintille infligge 1 danno a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.\\nCiclo {R} ({R}, Scarta questa carta dalla tua mano: Pesca una carta).\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "È l\'unico tipo di doccia che i goblin riescono a tollerare.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166348&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95e94867-3db3-4f4d-aa66-ba812aa6e712\', \'multiverseId\': 166348}, \'multiverseid\': 166348}, {\'name\': \'火花のしぶき\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b767f5e-609e-45e3-9760-c836c42e9670\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Jorro de Centelhas\', \'text\': \'Jorro de Centelhas causa 1 ponto de dano à criatura alvo ou ao jogador alvo.\\nReciclar {R} ({R}, Descarte este card de sua mão: Compre um card.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'É o único tipo de banho que os goblins irão tolerar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166491&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e78e2d4b-ad92-4f19-8ea1-c877ec61b986\', \'multiverseId\': 166491}, \'multiverseid\': 166491}]', "[{'name': 'Gehirnfrost', 'text': 'Ein Spieler deiner Wahl legt die obersten drei Karten seiner Bibliothek in seinen Friedhof.\\nSturm (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch spielst, kopiere ihn einmal für jeden Zauberspruch, der in diesem Zug bereits gespielt wurde. Du kannst andere Ziele für diese Kopien bestimmen.)', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165986&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd75e5116-b070-4695-9b99-c81e94b124b0', 'multiverseId': 165986}, 'multiverseid': 165986}, {'name': 'Congelación del cerebro', 'text': 'El jugador objetivo pone las tres cartas de la parte superior de su biblioteca en su cementerio.\\nTormenta (Cuando juegues este hechizo, cópialo por cada hechizo jugado antes que él en este turno. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para las copias.)', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166559&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '40f757b7-0d76-4c11-ae13-9ce542d0a29c', 'multiverseId': 166559}, 'multiverseid': 166559}, {'name': 'Blocage cérébral', 'text': 'Le joueur ciblé met les trois cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque dans son cimetière.\\nDéluge (Quand vous jouez ce sort, copiez-le pour chaque sort joué avant lui ce tour-ci. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour chaque copie.)', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166129&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f0f15cb9-ef7f-4ba2-8ff5-17b13d661750', 'multiverseId': 166129}, 'multiverseid': 166129}, {'name': 'Gelacervello', 'text': 'Il giocatore bersaglio mette nel proprio cimitero le prime tre carte del proprio grimorio.\\nTempesta (quando giochi questa magia, copiala una volta per ogni magia giocata prima di questa durante questo turno. Puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per le copie).', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166272&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2a3a7097-a537-4a5f-bacc-b6607e20bd0b', 'multiverseId': 166272}, 'multiverseid': 166272}, {'name': '思考停止', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e1d51d5c-5bfd-4c0c-98ec-5ddfe703d19d'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Congelamento Cerebral', 'text': 'O jogador alvo coloca os três primeiros cards de seu próprio grimório em seu próprio cemitério.\\nRajada (Quando você jogar esta mágica, faça uma cópia dela para cada mágica jogada antes dela neste turno. Você pode escolher novos alvos para as cópias.)', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166415&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3cfa0619-a94a-41d9-9841-0d99ce1e281b', 'multiverseId': 166415}, 'multiverseid': 166415}]", '[{\'name\': \'Gesichter der Vergangenheit\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, tappe oder enttappe alle Kreaturen, die mit ihr einen Kreaturentyp gemeinsam haben.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Was verbindet, kann auch erwürgen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165992&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66bf12dd-fb57-44cb-8ca2-81300d1b7e74\', \'multiverseId\': 165992}, \'multiverseid\': 165992}, {\'name\': \'Rostros del pasado\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura vaya a un cementerio desde el juego, gira o endereza todas las criaturas que compartan un tipo de criatura con ella.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Los lazos que unen también pueden estrangular.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166565&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04ead3ac-1052-4861-93e6-1f308a2916e1\', \'multiverseId\': 166565}, \'multiverseid\': 166565}, {\'name\': \'Visages du passé\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature est mise dans un cimetière depuis le jeu, engagez ou dégagez toutes les créatures qui partagent un type de créature avec elle.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'Un lien finit toujours par étrangler.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166135&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdb66e02-9422-485e-b7ef-7def6eceaebc\', \'multiverseId\': 166135}, \'multiverseid\': 166135}, {\'name\': \'Volti del Passato\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una creatura viene messa in un cimitero dal gioco, TAPpa o STAPpa tutte le creature che hanno almeno un tipo di creatura in comune con essa.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'I legami possono anche strangolare.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166278&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e4d9083-d85e-4ca4-89fd-db17aeb7ca1d\', \'multiverseId\': 166278}, \'multiverseid\': 166278}, {\'name\': \'過ぎ去りし表情\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d736981a-4044-4f2f-86c6-43c05389d491\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Rostos do Passado\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma criatura for colocada num cemitério vinda de jogo, vire ou desvire todas as criaturas que compartilhem um tipo de criatura com ela.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'Os nós que unem também podem estrangular.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166421&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ea00a2f-7e34-4a07-803f-3b73f45c9166\', \'multiverseId\': 166421}, \'multiverseid\': 166421}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gewissensschuld\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn die verzauberte Kreatur Schaden zufügt, fügt die Gewissensschuld der verzauberten Kreatur ebenso viele Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreaturenverzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Diejenigen, die sich am schuldigsten fühlen, haben den wenigsten Grund dazu, während die, die sich schuldig fühlen müssten, es nie tun." —Sprichwort des Ordens\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165974&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8aa15e1-10f7-4a31-ba2c-779f22191338\', \'multiverseId\': 165974}, \'multiverseid\': 165974}, {\'name\': \'Remordimiento de conciencia\', \'text\': \'Siempre que la criatura encantada haga daño, el Remordimiento de conciencia hace esa cantidad de daño a la criatura encantada.\', \'type\': \'Encantar criatura\', \'flavor\': \'Los que más sienten culpa, no necesitan sentirla, mientras que aquéllos que más necesitan sentir culpa, nunca la sienten. Proverbio de la Orden\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166547&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e3dd9b1-e192-4e4e-8515-5b8a1274ae99\', \'multiverseId\': 166547}, \'multiverseid\': 166547}, {\'name\': \'Conscience coupable\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que la créature enchantée par la Conscience coupable inflige des blessures, la Conscience coupable lui inflige autant de blessures.\', \'type\': \'Enchanter : créature\', \'flavor\': "« Ceux qui se sentent coupables le sont rarement. Ceux qui ne se sentent pas coupables le sont toujours. » —Proverbe de l\'Ordre", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166117&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7bff275-6e05-427a-9f59-bd9cb64866ae\', \'multiverseId\': 166117}, \'multiverseid\': 166117}, {\'name\': \'Coscienza Sporca\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta la creatura incantata infligge danno, la Coscienza Sporca infligge un pari ammontare di danni alla creatura incantata.\', \'type\': \'Incanta Creatura\', \'flavor\': "Coloro che si sentono più colpevoli non ne hanno motivo, mentre quelli che dovrebbero sentirsi colpevoli non provano alcun rimorso. —proverbio dell\'Ordine", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166260&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb03f469-5746-467a-8eb2-f85e7ac92b6a\', \'multiverseId\': 166260}, \'multiverseid\': 166260}, {\'name\': \'罪の意識\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ddf768e-1de7-4ea7-9bf2-ee1ada67e7f8\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Consciência Pesada\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que a criatura encantada causar dano, Consciência Pesada causa aquela quantidade de dano à criatura encantada.\', \'type\': \'Encantar Criatura\', \'flavor\': \'"Os que mais sentem culpa não necessitam senti-la, enquanto os que mais necessitam nunca a sentem." —Provérbio da Ordem\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166403&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b27e18aa-118d-4bfc-9248-d7317aaaa0e3\', \'multiverseId\': 166403}, \'multiverseid\': 166403}]', "[{'name': 'Goblin-Kriegshäuptling', 'text': 'Goblinzauber, die du spielst, kosten beim Ausspielen {1} weniger.\\nGoblins, die du kontrollierst, haben Eile.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Goblin', 'flavor': 'Sie strömten wie Lava aus dem Skirk-Gebirge, und alles in ihrem Weg wurde zerstört und verbrannt.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166054&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '40ccb711-171a-4d37-ba40-5aa639777dff', 'multiverseId': 166054}, 'multiverseid': 166054}, {'name': 'Jefe de guerra trasgo', 'text': 'Te cuesta {1} menos jugar los hechizos de Trasgo.\\nLos Trasgos que controles tienen la habilidad de prisa.', 'type': 'Criatura — Trasgo', 'flavor': 'Brotaron de la Cordillera Skirk como lava, quemando y devorando todo a su paso.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166627&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ed8ed324-c3a8-4cc6-8b66-58ccea63b320', 'multiverseId': 166627}, 'multiverseid': 166627}, {'name': 'Chef de guerre gobelin', 'text': 'Les sorts de gobelin que vous jouez coûtent {1} de moins à jouer.\\nLes gobelins que vous contrôlez ont la célérité.', 'type': 'Créature : gobelin', 'flavor': 'Ils déboulèrent du contrefort de Skirk comme de la lave, brûlant et dévorant tout sur leur passage.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166197&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9d01be4b-db60-4383-b7a2-87fb00d4ce9c', 'multiverseId': 166197}, 'multiverseid': 166197}, {'name': 'Condottiero Goblin', 'text': 'Le magie Goblin che giochi costano {1} in meno per essere giocate.\\nI Goblin che controlli hanno rapidità.', 'type': 'Creatura — Goblin', 'flavor': 'Sono calati dalle Cime di Skirk come lava, bruciando e divorando tutto ciò che si trovava sul loro cammino.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166340&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1af2a7f8-1d7c-4dd8-9d71-56c90028c1c7', 'multiverseId': 166340}, 'multiverseid': 166340}, {'name': 'ゴブリンの戦長', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '343b9b51-414e-458a-a274-0148b72e634e'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Comandante de Guerra Goblin', 'text': 'Suas mágicas de Goblin custam {1} a menos para serem jogadas.\\nOs Goblins que você controla têm ímpeto.', 'type': 'Criatura — Goblin', 'flavor': 'Eles extravazaram da Serra de Skirk como lava, queimando e devorando tudo em seu caminho.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166483&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4c0ab371-1a14-4691-9c10-56a0a29ba135', 'multiverseId': 166483}, 'multiverseid': 166483}]", '[{\'name\': \'Goblin-Psychopath\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn der Goblin-Psychopath angreift oder blockt, wirf eine Münze. Falls du den Münzwurf verlierst, fügt er das nächste Mal, sobald er in diesem Zug Kampfschaden zufügen würde, stattdessen dir den Schaden zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblinmutant\', \'flavor\': \'Die Zerstörung, die von ihm ausgeht, ist nichts im Vergleich mit dem Chaos in seinem Hirn.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166052&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0c0d654-1cdc-47ee-9e53-38ae6e4ffb68\', \'multiverseId\': 166052}, \'multiverseid\': 166052}, {\'name\': \'Psicópata trasgo\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Psicópata trasgo ataque o bloquee, lanza una moneda. Si pierdes el lanzamiento, la próxima vez que fuera a hacer daño de combate este turno, en su lugar, te hace daño a ti.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Mutante trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'La destrucción que él causa no es nada comparada con el caos que hay en su mente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166625&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'282e4c20-d8ee-4dc6-836a-1414db925959\', \'multiverseId\': 166625}, \'multiverseid\': 166625}, {\'name\': \'Psychopathe gobelin\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que le Psychopathe gobelin attaque ou bloque, jouez à pile ou face. Si vous perdez, la prochaine fois que le Psychopathe gobelin devrait infliger des blessures de combat ce tour-ci, il vous inflige ces blessures à la place.\', \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et mutant\', \'flavor\': "La destruction dont il est responsable n\'est rien comparée au chaos qui règne dans son esprit.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166195&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b6ef633-0c00-47d7-9cdd-9b8aaf0cba5b\', \'multiverseId\': 166195}, \'multiverseid\': 166195}, {\'name\': \'Goblin Psicopatico\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta il Goblin Psicopatico attacca o blocca, lancia una moneta. Se perdi il lancio, la prossima volta che infligge danno da combattimento in questo turno, infliggerà invece a te quel danno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Goblin Mutante\', \'flavor\': \'La distruzione che porta è niente in confronto al caos che regna nella sua mente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166338&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b9ab38f-9900-4850-86b9-430fdd1da2f3\', \'multiverseId\': 166338}, \'multiverseid\': 166338}, {\'name\': \'ゴブリンの人格崩壊者\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac400b1d-23ef-4298-a81e-062f59eb5e6e\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Goblin Psicopata\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Goblin Psicopata atacar ou bloquear, lance uma moeda. Se você perder, na próxima vez em que ele fosse causar dano de combate neste turno, ao invés disso ele o causa a você.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Goblin Mutante\', \'flavor\': \'A destruição que ele provoca não é nada se comparada ao caos em sua mente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166481&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efc3b2c0-d418-435b-a433-65f2b34fad25\', \'multiverseId\': 166481}, \'multiverseid\': 166481}]', '[{\'name\': \'Goblinbrigand\', \'text\': \'Der Goblinbrigand greift in jedem Zug an, wenn möglich.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'Nach dem Zusammenbruch des Skirk-Gebirges errichteten die Goblins ein System aus Seilen und Flaschenzügen, um das, was noch stand, zusammenzuhalten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166051&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6e46817-c5e1-44f7-8ed9-52066ea347e2\', \'multiverseId\': 166051}, \'multiverseid\': 166051}, {\'name\': \'Bandolero trasgo\', \'text\': \'El Bandolero trasgo ataca cada turno si puede.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'Después de que la Cordillera Skirk se derrumbó, los trasgos erigieron un sistema de cuerdas y de poleas para sostener lo que quedaba.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166624&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'891ebbae-c2d6-4d3e-92e4-c444905fe1a6\', \'multiverseId\': 166624}, \'multiverseid\': 166624}, {\'name\': \'Brigand gobelin\', \'text\': \'Le Brigand gobelin attaque à chaque tour si possible.\', \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin\', \'flavor\': "Après l\'effondrement du contrefort de Skirk, les gobelins construisirent un système de cordes et de poulies pour en consolider les vestiges.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166194&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5f9a535-b0c9-425d-ae49-f9cca2c5ba38\', \'multiverseId\': 166194}, \'multiverseid\': 166194}, {\'name\': \'Brigante Goblin\', \'text\': \'Il Brigante Goblin attacca ad ogni turno se può farlo.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'Dopo il crollo delle Cime di Skirk, i goblin hanno eretto un sistema di corde e pulegge per sostenere ciò che era rimasto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166337&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fb0e400-7ee5-49d8-b754-b6ad484a772b\', \'multiverseId\': 166337}, \'multiverseid\': 166337}, {\'name\': \'ゴブリンの盗賊\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32966287-a86a-448f-952f-e90a050e72c0\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Bandoleiro Goblin\', \'text\': \'Bandoleiro Goblin ataca a cada turno se estiver apto.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'Após o desabamento da Serra de Skirk, os goblins construíram um sistema de cordas e roldanas para segurar o que restava.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166480&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01905ad0-5eb1-4861-adb2-17a4c6a4495c\', \'multiverseId\': 166480}, \'multiverseid\': 166480}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gratwanderer\', \'text\': \'Klerikerzauber, die du spielst, kosten beim Ausspielen {W}{B} weniger. Dieser Effekt reduziert nur die Menge an farbigem Mana, das du bezahlst. (Spielst du zum Beispiel einen Kleriker mit Manakosten von {1}{W}, kostet er nur {1} beim Ausspielen.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Kleriker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166094&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'672aac5e-4b67-4f25-8151-bb37e66fcd73\', \'multiverseId\': 166094}, \'multiverseid\': 166094}, {\'name\': \'Andaborde\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {W}{B} menos jugar los hechizos de Clérigo. Este efecto sólo reduce la cantidad de maná de color que pagas. (Por ejemplo, si juegas un Clérigo con coste de maná {1}{W}, te cuesta {1} jugarlo.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166667&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e13e8182-f0fc-4f86-ba35-203904b38d29\', \'multiverseId\': 166667}, \'multiverseid\': 166667}, {\'name\': \'Marcheur des marges\', \'text\': \'Les sorts de clerc que vous jouez coûtent {W}{B} de moins à jouer. Cet effet réduit seulement la quantité de mana coloré que vous payez. (Par exemple, si vous jouez un clerc avec un coût de mana de {1}{W}, il coûte {1} à jouer.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : clerc\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166237&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'debe74d3-7dd6-4a2b-950e-6dda3c04a245\', \'multiverseId\': 166237}, \'multiverseid\': 166237}, {\'name\': \'Calcalimiti\', \'text\': "Le magie Chierico che giochi costano {W}{B} in meno per essere giocate. Questo effetto riduce solo l\'ammontare di mana colorato da pagare (per esempio, se giochi un Chierico con un costo di mana pari a {1}{W}, costa {1} per essere giocato).", \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166380&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4065738-44d5-4953-a98d-d4d04f0b47ff\', \'multiverseId\': 166380}, \'multiverseid\': 166380}, {\'name\': \'境を歩む者\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'113ac89a-7247-4778-80b4-9aabac3f4496\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Caminhante do Gume\', \'text\': \'Suas mágicas de Clérigo custam {W}{B} a menos para serem jogadas. Este efeito reduz apenas a quantidade de mana colorida que você paga. (Por exemplo, se você baixar um Clérigo com custo de mana igual a {1}{W}, ele custará {1} para ser jogado.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166523&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed282faa-3611-4028-b92b-210b99df3ad1\', \'multiverseId\': 166523}, \'multiverseid\': 166523}]', '[{\'name\': \'Griff des Chaos\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Zauberspruch oder eine Fähigkeit auf den Stapel kommt, bestimme das Ziel zufällig neu, falls der Zauberspruch/die Fähigkeit ein einzelnes Ziel hatte. (Wähle aus allen erlaubten Zielen.)\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Auf Welten, auf denen das Chaos herrscht, haben Kluge und Dumme die gleichen Chancen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166055&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b59e850-a4cb-4942-9ce5-1f6eb27ed18e\', \'multiverseId\': 166055}, \'multiverseid\': 166055}, {\'name\': \'Apretón del caos\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un hechizo o habilidad vaya a la pila, si tiene un solo objetivo, vuelve a elegir su objetivo al azar (Select from among all legal targets.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando el caos consume el mundo, el hábil y el tonto están en igualdad de condiciones.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4db4f98-7115-4136-9852-afe26f797952\', \'multiverseId\': 166628}, \'multiverseid\': 166628}, {\'name\': \'Poigne du chaos\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un sort ou une capacité ayant une cible unique est mis sur la pile, déterminez sa nouvelle cible au hasard. (Tirez au sort parmi toutes les cibles légales).", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'Dans un monde de chaos, idiots et sages se valent bien.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166198&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58d0c124-e769-484f-983b-19ceda4d3f93\', \'multiverseId\': 166198}, \'multiverseid\': 166198}, {\'name\': \'Stretta del Caos\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta una magia o un\'abilità viene messa nella pila, cambia il suo bersaglio con uno scelto a caso se ha un solo bersaglio (scegli tra tutti i bersagli legali).", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Quando il mondo è consumato dal caos, i saggi e i folli sono nelle stesse condizioni.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166341&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10b9439c-ce09-4528-bad3-d42047568cd3\', \'multiverseId\': 166341}, \'multiverseid\': 166341}, {\'name\': \'混沌の掌握\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac05a3e8-e913-46ad-809f-ec54f7a7f4f5\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Garras do Caos\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma mágica ou habilidade for colocada na pilha, re-selecione seu alvo, aleatoriamente, se ela tiver um único alvo. (Escolha dentre todos os alvos válidos).\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'Quando o mundo é consumido pelo caos, os habilidosos e os tolos estão em pé de igualdade.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166484&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a03b46b-42a9-4a8d-809b-65bd6477acf7\', \'multiverseId\': 166484}, \'multiverseid\': 166484}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grimmiger Empath\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Grimmige Empath ins Spiel kommt, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Kreaturenkarte mit umgewandelten Manakosten von 6 oder mehr durchsuchen, sie deinem Gegner zeigen und auf deine Hand nehmen. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166076&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eee414ac-cbda-4e8c-aa76-1e479566ee68\', \'multiverseId\': 166076}, \'multiverseid\': 166076}, {\'name\': \'Émpata fiero\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Émpata fiero entre en juego, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de criatura con un coste de maná convertido de 6 o más, mostrarla y ponerla en tu mano. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166649&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccb67890-02f9-4542-a897-2b11d275219b\', \'multiverseId\': 166649}, \'multiverseid\': 166649}, {\'name\': \'Empathe farouche\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Empathe farouche arrive en jeu, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque une carte de créature ayant un coût converti de mana de 6 ou plus, la révéler et la placer dans votre main. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166219&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31d261d0-2ee9-497e-be6e-49c3713a327d\', \'multiverseId\': 166219}, \'multiverseid\': 166219}, {\'name\': \'Empatico Spietato\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Empatico Spietato entra in gioco, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio, scegliere una carta creatura con costo di mana convertito pari o superiore a 6, rivelarla e aggiungerla alla tua mano. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166362&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7eed6639-88b5-4e08-a4ee-c5d3c52abf26\', \'multiverseId\': 166362}, \'multiverseid\': 166362}, {\'name\': \'激情の共感者\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed6ac6bb-add3-4af7-abdb-98aae073c7c1\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Empático Feroz\', \'text\': \'Quando Empático Feroz entrar em jogo, você pode procurar em seu grimório por um card de criatura com custo de mana convertido maior ou igual a 6, revelá-lo e colocá-lo em sua mão. Depois, embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166505&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd0743fa-f8c1-4cb3-bc98-991ac6678cc4\', \'multiverseId\': 166505}, \'multiverseid\': 166505}]', "[{'name': 'Grubengräber', 'text': '{2}{W}, {T}: Lege eine Fallenmarke auf ein Land deiner Wahl, das du kontrollierst.\\nOpfere ein Land, auf dem eine Fallenmarke liegt: Der Grubengräber fügt einer angreifenden Kreatur deiner Wahl ohne Flugfähigkeit 3 Schadenspunkte zu.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Soldat', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165981&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b410ea34-d5ff-43b9-b23b-c49015310d9b', 'multiverseId': 165981}, 'multiverseid': 165981}, {'name': 'Cavador de trampas', 'text': '{2}{W}, {T}: Pon un contador de trampa sobre la tierra objetivo que controles.\\nSacrificar una tierra con un contador de trampa sobre ella: El Cavador de trampas hace 3 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo atacante que no tenga la habilidad de volar.', 'type': 'Criatura — Soldado', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166554&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cd1d6cbc-3d0a-45c2-840f-7382129eefb4', 'multiverseId': 166554}, 'multiverseid': 166554}, {'name': 'Creuseur de pièges', 'text': '{2}{W}, {T} : Mettez un marqueur « piège » sur le terrain ciblé que vous contrôlez.\\nSacrifiez un terrain avec un marqueur « piège » sur lui : Le Creuseur de pièges inflige 3 blessures à la créature attaquante sans le vol ciblée.', 'type': 'Créature : soldat', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166124&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '39765245-6221-4b8d-b5e6-8912edc14158', 'multiverseId': 166124}, 'multiverseid': 166124}, {'name': 'Scava Trappole', 'text': '{2}{W}, {T}: Metti un segnalino trappola su una terra bersaglio che controlli.\\nSacrifica una terra con almeno un segnalino trappola su di essa: Lo Scava Trappole infligge 3 danni a una creatura attaccante bersaglio senza volare.', 'type': 'Creatura — Soldato', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166267&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6dd77c07-c570-47bb-8f13-5ce07eb5699f', 'multiverseId': 166267}, 'multiverseid': 166267}, {'name': '罠を掘る者', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '30f3d240-8177-4678-a2c1-d0fa134ccff4'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Cavador de Armadilhas', 'text': '{2}{W}, {T}: Coloque um marcador de armadilha no terreno alvo que você controla.\\nSacrifique um terreno com um marcador de armadilha sobre ele: Cavador de Armadilhas causa 3 pontos de dano à criatura alvo sem a habilidade de voar.', 'type': 'Criatura — Soldado', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166410&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f83187af-4341-44b7-86be-925c7de28695', 'multiverseId': 166410}, 'multiverseid': 166410}]", "[{'name': 'Gräberernte', 'text': 'Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\\nSturm (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch spielst, kopiere ihn einmal für jeden Zauberspruch, der in diesem Zug bereits gespielt wurde. Du kannst andere Ziele für diese Kopien bestimmen.)', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166029&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b6409049-61cf-4b75-885b-7307ea8eb952', 'multiverseId': 166029}, 'multiverseid': 166029}, {'name': 'Cosechar las tumbas', 'text': 'Regresa la carta objetivo de criatura de tu cementerio a tu mano.\\nTormenta (Cuando juegues este hechizo, cópialo por cada hechizo jugado antes que él en este turno. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para las copias.)', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166602&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '59ee2068-ac0d-46da-a6b0-7ce780ddb33a', 'multiverseId': 166602}, 'multiverseid': 166602}, {'name': 'Moisson des tombes', 'text': 'Renvoyez une carte de créature ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\\nDéluge (Quand vous jouez ce sort, copiez-le pour chaque sort joué avant lui ce tour-ci. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour chaque copie.)', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166172&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9115dfb5-e8d0-4bb8-b120-f1086d10ae66', 'multiverseId': 166172}, 'multiverseid': 166172}, {'name': 'Mietere le Tombe', 'text': 'Riprendi in mano una carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\\nTempesta (quando giochi questa magia, copiala una volta per ogni magia giocata prima di questa durante questo turno. Puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per le copie).', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166315&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6da8c063-7654-44a7-a3c9-0ce5f35df798', 'multiverseId': 166315}, 'multiverseid': 166315}, {'name': '墓の刈り取り', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '90d88f61-d022-4cb1-907a-a41ff06d9193'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Violando os Túmulos', 'text': 'Devolve o card de criatura alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.\\nRajada (Quando você jogar esta mágica, faça uma cópia dela para cada mágica jogada antes dela neste turno. Você pode escolher novos alvos para as cópias.)', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166458&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5cbeece8-8f62-4e29-b49a-9c410e4a95ce', 'multiverseId': 166458}, 'multiverseid': 166458}]", '[{\'name\': \'Güldenes Licht\', \'text\': \'Du kannst in diesem Zug nicht das Ziel von Zaubersprüchen oder Fähigkeiten sein.\\nUmwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte aus deiner Hand ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Nur wer den ersten Schlag übersteht, kann den zweiten landen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165973&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b1644d5-58e2-4ea5-bdc2-38276b6f425d\', \'multiverseId\': 165973}, \'multiverseid\': 165973}, {\'name\': \'Luz de oropel\', \'text\': \'No puedes ser objetivo de hechizos o habilidades este turno.\\nCiclo {2}. {2}, descartar esta carta de tu mano: Roba una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Quienquiera que sobreviva al primer golpe, vive para dar el segundo".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166546&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ec43615-6beb-4f3e-89fa-43198beaf5df\', \'multiverseId\': 166546}, \'multiverseid\': 166546}, {\'name\': \'Lumière dorée\', \'text\': \'Vous ne pouvez pas être la cible de sorts ou de capacités pendant ce tour.\\nRecyclage {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte de votre main : Piochez une carte.)\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Quiconque survit au premier coup assène le second. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166116&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2a7ecd1-5f03-42da-b100-c403955f7f19\', \'multiverseId\': 166116}, \'multiverseid\': 166116}, {\'name\': \'Luce Dorata\', \'text\': \'Non puoi essere bersaglio di magie o abilità in questo turno.\\nCiclo {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta dalla tua mano: Pesca una carta).\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Chi sopravvive al primo colpo riesce a piazzare il secondo".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166259&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ce64b5c-cba2-426a-ad6d-60d108aac8f6\', \'multiverseId\': 166259}, \'multiverseid\': 166259}, {\'name\': \'金粉の光\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82cafab3-4c8d-40b2-8e0b-e35c8b5e2bc8\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Luz Engalanada\', \'text\': \'Você não pode ser alvo de mágicas ou habilidades neste turno.\\nReciclar {2} ({2}, Descarte este card de sua mão: Compre um card.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Qualquer um que sobreviva ao primeiro golpe vive para aplicar o segundo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166402&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'680cea4f-c084-4526-a8b4-16a3e22a36aa\', \'multiverseId\': 166402}, \'multiverseid\': 166402}]', "[{'name': 'Hindernde Berührung', 'text': 'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl, falls sein Beherrscher nicht {2} bezahlt.\\nSturm (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch spielst, kopiere ihn einmal für jeden Zauberspruch, der in diesem Zug bereits gespielt wurde. Du kannst andere Ziele für diese Kopien bestimmen.)', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165994&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ce187519-6464-435f-92b7-50d7c41735fa', 'multiverseId': 165994}, 'multiverseid': 165994}, {'name': 'Toque obstaculizador', 'text': 'Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo a menos que su controlador pague {2}.\\nTormenta (Cuando juegues este hechizo, cópialo por cada hechizo jugado antes que él en este turno. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para las copias.)', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166567&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2c8c6ad7-f653-4f0f-ab05-c6dae58a3184', 'multiverseId': 166567}, 'multiverseid': 166567}, {'name': 'Achoppement', 'text': 'Contrecarrez le sort ciblé à moins que son contrôleur ne paye {2}.\\nDéluge (Quand vous jouez ce sort, copiez-le pour chaque sort joué avant lui ce tour-ci. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour chaque copie.)', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166137&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c188e233-b899-4a15-a28f-9d477c3ecfa3', 'multiverseId': 166137}, 'multiverseid': 166137}, {'name': 'Tocco Ostacolante', 'text': 'Neutralizza una magia bersaglio a meno che il suo controllore spenda {2}.\\nTempesta (quando giochi questa magia, copiala una volta per ogni magia giocata prima di questa durante questo turno. Puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per le copie).', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166280&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '34cceef7-e725-4d0f-99dc-5103813ea2df', 'multiverseId': 166280}, 'multiverseid': 166280}, {'name': '妨害の接触', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c6545186-3f71-4041-bce1-abacbce43642'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Toque de Obstrução', 'text': 'Anula a mágica alvo a menos que seu controlador pague {2}.\\nRajada (Quando você jogar esta mágica, faça uma cópia dela para cada mágica jogada antes dela neste turno. Você pode escolher novos alvos para as cópias.)', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166423&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '33b59d17-4d14-4494-9851-0875e3f282a9', 'multiverseId': 166423}, 'multiverseid': 166423}]", '[{\'name\': \'Holzrüster\', \'text\': \'Morph {2}{G}{G} (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur spielen. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Morph-Kosten auf.)\\nWenn der Holzrüster aufgedeckt wird, verursacht eine Kreatur deiner Wahl bis zum Ende des Zuges Trampelschaden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166091&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5910b9d7-2cc4-4be4-94cb-a1a8c3f61bb3\', \'multiverseId\': 166091}, \'multiverseid\': 166091}, {\'name\': \'Cubremadera\', \'text\': \'Metamorfosis {2}{G}{G}. (Puedes jugar esta carta boca abajo como una criatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Ponla boca arriba en cualquier momento pagando su coste de metamorfosis.)\\nCuando el Cubremadera se ponga boca arriba, la criatura objetivo gana la habilidad de arrollar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166664&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdb6367a-beed-46dd-974c-cbaa2f33dda5\', \'multiverseId\': 166664}, \'multiverseid\': 166664}, {\'name\': \'Cache-bois\', \'text\': "Mue {2}{G}{G} (Vous pouvez jouer cette carte face cachée comme une créature 2/2 pour {3}. Retournez-la quand vous le désirez pour son coût de mue.)\\nQuand le Cache-bois est retourné face visible, la créature ciblée acquiert le piétinement jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166234&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'127d35bf-3ca9-4658-a052-a37b4d44e53d\', \'multiverseId\': 166234}, \'multiverseid\': 166234}, {\'name\': \'Mantobosco\', \'text\': \'Metamorfosi {2}{G}{G} (puoi giocare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di metamorfosi.)\\nQuando il Mantobosco viene girato a faccia in su, la creatura bersaglio guadagna travolgere fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166377&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da91575b-130f-46c2-b6a4-3124a4c72b71\', \'multiverseId\': 166377}, \'multiverseid\': 166377}, {\'name\': \'木々をまとう者\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23702001-fcd9-49a9-ab63-0a8bf5a0ac68\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Xilo-Revestidor\', \'text\': \'Metamorfose {2}{G}{G} (Você pode baixar este card com a face voltada para baixo como uma criatura 2/2 por {3}. Volte sua face para cima a qualquer momento pagando seu custo de metamorfose.)\\nQuando a face de Xilo-Revestidor for voltada para cima, a criatura alvo ganha a habilidade atropelar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166520&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bbee8e4-54ee-4f8b-960b-9c39d6d5b6ef\', \'multiverseId\': 166520}, \'multiverseid\': 166520}]', "[{'name': 'Jagendes Rudel', 'text': 'Bringe einen 4/4 grünen Bestienspielstein ins Spiel.\\nSturm (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch spielst, kopiere ihn einmal für jeden Zauberspruch, der in diesem Zug bereits gespielt wurde.)', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166078&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2c90033c-bacb-460d-8ce5-27799667fdf9', 'multiverseId': 166078}, 'multiverseid': 166078}, {'name': 'Manada cazadora', 'text': 'Pon en juego una ficha de criatura Bestia verde 4/4.\\nTormenta (Cuando juegues este hechizo, cópialo por cada hechizo jugado antes que él en este turno.)', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166651&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c745fa24-f86b-48d3-a021-1adafa2dfd33', 'multiverseId': 166651}, 'multiverseid': 166651}, {'name': 'Meute chasseresse', 'text': 'Mettez en jeu un jeton de créature 4/4 verte Bête.\\nDéluge (Quand vous jouez ce sort, copiez-le pour chaque sort joué avant lui ce tour-ci.)', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166221&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '972142a2-2109-461f-9203-178a66fec6ab', 'multiverseId': 166221}, 'multiverseid': 166221}, {'name': 'Muta da Caccia', 'text': 'Metti in gioco una pedina creatura Bestia 4/4 verde.\\nTempesta (quando giochi questa magia, copiala una volta per ogni magia giocata prima di questa durante questo turno).', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166364&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '95e8e4e0-da1d-4bd1-887d-7334c081fa05', 'multiverseId': 166364}, 'multiverseid': 166364}, {'name': '狩り立てる群れ', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0dfb429d-26e3-4af2-a382-eb2e9401857d'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Matilha de Caça', 'text': 'Coloque em jogo uma ficha de criatura verde 4/4 do tipo Besta.\\nRajada (Quando você jogar esta mágica, faça uma cópia dela para cada mágica jogada antes dela neste turno.)', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166507&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'da77ce90-4069-4152-9a47-bfbd4e614757', 'multiverseId': 166507}, 'multiverseid': 166507}]", '[{\'name\': \'Kabbalisten-Gehirnwäsche\', \'text\': \'Eine beliebige Anzahl an Spielern deiner Wahl wirft so viele Karten aus ihrer Hand ab, wie die höchsten umgewandelten Manakosten unter den bleibenden Karten, die du kontrollierst, betragen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Höre nur der Kabbalisten Stimme Sehe nur mit der Kabbalisten Augen Spreche nur der Kabbalisten Sprache" —Mantra der Kabbalisten\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166013&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'822c3887-40c2-4c64-893c-e146ef4c4158\', \'multiverseId\': 166013}, \'multiverseid\': 166013}, {\'name\': \'Condicionamiento de la Cábala\', \'text\': \'Cada uno de cualquier número de jugadores objetivo descarta un número de cartas de su mano igual al coste de maná convertido más alto que haya entre los permanentes que controles.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Oye sólo la voz de la Cábala. Ve sólo el camino de la Cábala. Habla sólo la palabra de la Cábala". Mantra de la Cábala\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166586&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0112ea06-1b68-4229-9b6b-f41ef54b10f0\', \'multiverseId\': 166586}, \'multiverseid\': 166586}, {\'name\': \'Conditionnement de la Coterie\', \'text\': "Un nombre quelconque de joueurs ciblés se défausse chacun d\'un nombre de cartes de sa main égal au coût converti de mana le plus élevé parmi les permanents que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« N\'écoutez que la voix de la Coterie. Ne suivez que la voie de la Coterie. Ne parlez qu\'avec la voix de la Coterie. » —Mantra de la Coterie", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166156&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d5dd23a-2e4a-457b-a5f9-ca9dfde795b6\', \'multiverseId\': 166156}, \'multiverseid\': 166156}, {\'name\': \'Condizionamento della Cabala\', \'text\': \'Un qualsiasi numero di giocatori bersaglio scartano ciascuno dalla propria mano un ammontare di carte pari al più alto costo di mana convertito tra i permanenti che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Ascolta solo la voce della Cabala. Osserva solo la via della Cabala. Pronuncia solo le parole della Cabala". —mantra della Cabala\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166299&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6f70de4-1421-41bd-b95b-555a9d28075c\', \'multiverseId\': 166299}, \'multiverseid\': 166299}, {\'name\': \'陰謀団式処置\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'556be2b3-f249-45a9-8529-69849d8a2252\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Condicionamento da Cabala\', \'text\': \'Cada um de um número qualquer de jogadores alvo descarta um número de cards de sua própria mão igual ao maior custo de mana convertido dentre as permanentes que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Ouve apenas a voz da Cabala. Vê apenas o caminho da Cabala. Fala apenas a palavra da Cabala." —Mantra da Cabala\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166442&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a48a6b31-a98e-44ca-a123-9902f7ed0e4b\', \'multiverseId\': 166442}, \'multiverseid\': 166442}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kabbalisten-Vernehmer\', \'text\': \'{X}{B}, {T}: Ein Spieler deiner Wahl zeigt X Karten aus seiner Hand offen vor, und du bestimmst eine davon. Dieser Spieler wirft diese Karte ab. Spiele diese Fähigkeit nur zu einem Zeitpunkt, zu dem du auch eine Hexerei spielen könntest.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166014&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2c5bcac-76ea-4fd2-bcc8-684809fa116c\', \'multiverseId\': 166014}, \'multiverseid\': 166014}, {\'name\': \'Interrogador de la Cábala\', \'text\': \'{X}{B}, {T}: El jugador objetivo muestra X cartas de su mano y tú eliges una de ellas. Ese jugador descarta esa carta. Juega esta habilidad sólo cuando puedas jugar un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166587&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09c5005d-57d7-4b20-948c-63a6ebb81cc4\', \'multiverseId\': 166587}, \'multiverseid\': 166587}, {\'name\': \'Interrogateur de la Coterie\', \'text\': "{X}{B}, {T} : Le joueur ciblé révèle X cartes de sa main et vous choisissez l\'une d\'elles. Ce joueur se défausse de cette carte. Ne jouez cette capacité que lorsque vous pourriez jouer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Créature : zombie et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166157&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffda1326-d5bd-4259-a68a-7f67b977b68c\', \'multiverseId\': 166157}, \'multiverseid\': 166157}, {\'name\': \'Interrogatore della Cabala\', \'text\': \'{X}{B}, {T}: Il giocatore bersaglio rivela X carte dalla propria mano e tu scegli una di esse. Quel giocatore scarta quella carta. Gioca questa abilità solo quando potresti giocare una stregoneria.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166300&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b94686b-be54-44cf-9ebc-14eb1b472c38\', \'multiverseId\': 166300}, \'multiverseid\': 166300}, {\'name\': \'陰謀団の取調官\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07e2ab8c-d1ed-4365-aaf6-e69abee6ef1c\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Interrogador da Cabala\', \'text\': \'{X}{B}, {T}: O jogador alvo revela X cards de sua própria mão e você escolhe um deles. Aquele jogador descarta aquele card. Use esta habilidade somente quando pudesse jogar um feitiço.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Mago Zumbi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166443&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1bf7ed0e-973e-4f77-9ecd-bd96bde3f13d\', \'multiverseId\': 166443}, \'multiverseid\': 166443}]', '[{\'name\': \'Karona, Falsche Göttin\', \'text\': \'Eile\\nZu Beginn des Versorgungssegments jedes Spielers enttappt dieser Spieler Karona, Falsche Göttin und erhält die Kontrolle über sie.\\nImmer wenn Karona angreift, erhalten Kreaturen eines Typs, den du bestimmst, +3/+3 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Legende\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166095&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9d79e3b-d076-4515-b52d-0a336f94070c\', \'multiverseId\': 166095}, \'multiverseid\': 166095}, {\'name\': \'Karona, diosa falsa\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\nAl comienzo del mantenimiento de cada jugador, ese jugador endereza a Karona, diosa falsa y gana el control de ella.\\nSiempre que Karona ataque, las criaturas del tipo de tu elección obtienen +3/+3 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Leyenda, (legendario)\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166668&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fe26bed-62b3-4d3b-bed2-289aba59151c\', \'multiverseId\': 166668}, \'multiverseid\': 166668}, {\'name\': \'Karona, fausse divinité\', \'text\': "Célérité\\nAu début de l\'entretien de chaque joueur, ce joueur dégage Karona, fausse divinité et en acquiert le contrôle.\\nÀ chaque fois que Karona, fausse divinité, attaque, les créatures du type de votre choix gagnent +3/+3 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : Légende\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166238&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9782102-93d2-4555-91b3-4b8f85e223b5\', \'multiverseId\': 166238}, \'multiverseid\': 166238}, {\'name\': \'Karona, Dio Fasullo\', \'text\': "Rapidità\\nAll\'inizio del mantenimento di ciascun giocatore, quel giocatore STAPpa Karona, Dio Fasullo e ne prende il controllo.\\nOgniqualvolta Karona attacca, le creature di un tipo a tua scelta prendono +3/+3 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Leggende\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166381&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'238a684d-a89b-4f5c-880a-a8f76b6659bf\', \'multiverseId\': 166381}, \'multiverseid\': 166381}, {\'name\': \'邪神カローナ\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91add8d0-db3c-4b92-be1b-c4a39d22f65a\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Karona, Falso Deus\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto\\nNo início da manutenção de cada jogador, aquele jogador desvira Karona, Falso Deus e ganha o controle dele.\\nToda vez que Karona atacar, as criaturas do tipo de sua escolha recebem +3/+3 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lenda\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166524&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f574d1db-c9b3-47bc-a64b-38974e9e16f0\', \'multiverseId\': 166524}, \'multiverseid\': 166524}]', "[{'name': 'Karonas Eiferer', 'text': 'Morph {3}{W}{W} (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur spielen. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Morph-Kosten auf.)\\nWenn Karonas Eiferer aufgedeckt wird, wird aller Schaden, der ihm in diesem Zug zugefügt würde, stattdessen einer Kreatur deiner Wahl zugefügt.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Kleriker', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165975&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a15650b9-d59b-4918-bac4-6fbabea3eff8', 'multiverseId': 165975}, 'multiverseid': 165975}, {'name': 'Fanático de Karona', 'text': 'Metamorfosis {3}{W}{W}.(Puedes jugar esta carta boca abajo como una criatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Ponla boca arriba en cualquier momento pagando su coste de metamorfosis.)\\nCuando el Fanático de Karona se ponga boca arriba, todo el daño que se le fuera a hacer este turno, en vez de eso, se le hace a la criatura objetivo.', 'type': 'Criatura — Clérigo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166548&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '76111ca3-c037-4e80-9478-60beed3f9b44', 'multiverseId': 166548}, 'multiverseid': 166548}, {'name': 'Zélateur de Karona', 'text': 'Mue {3}{W}{W} (Vous pouvez jouer cette carte face cachée comme une créature 2/2 pour {3}. Retournez-la quand vous le désirez pour son coût de mue.)\\nQuand le Zélateur de Karona est retourné face visible, toutes les blessures qui devraient lui être infligées ce tour-ci sont infligées à la créature ciblée à la place.', 'type': 'Créature : clerc', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166118&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '22c79684-92b8-4071-8862-352e2fc029a7', 'multiverseId': 166118}, 'multiverseid': 166118}, {'name': 'Zelota di Karona', 'text': 'Metamorfosi {3}{W}{W} (puoi giocare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di metamorfosi.)\\nQuando lo Zelota di Karona viene girato a faccia in su, tutto il danno che gli verrebbe inflitto in questo turno viene invece inflitto a una creatura bersaglio.', 'type': 'Creatura — Chierico', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166261&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2393fc6d-717f-4789-a4cd-51923812279d', 'multiverseId': 166261}, 'multiverseid': 166261}, {'name': 'カローナの盲信者', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f2c942b4-d516-4fbb-a11e-89e2a4585e89'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Zelote de Karona', 'text': 'Metamorfose {3}{W}{W} (Você pode baixar este card com a face voltada para baixo como uma criatura 2/2 por {3}. Volte sua face para cima a qualquer momento pagando seu custo de metamorfose.)\\nQuando a face de Zelote de Karona for voltada para cima, todo o dano que seria causado a ele neste turno, ao invés disso, é causado à criatura alvo.', 'type': 'Criatura — Clérigo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166404&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '50733ce6-dae0-4c2a-9bfd-c52d9bfd2ee8', 'multiverseId': 166404}, 'multiverseid': 166404}]", "[{'name': 'Klauen des Drahtholzwalds', 'text': 'Die Klauen des Drahtholzwalds fügen jeder fliegenden Kreatur und jedem Spieler 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\\nUmwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte aus deiner Hand ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': 'Es wird gesagt, der Wald habe Augen. Aber von seinen Klauen ist nie die Rede.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166071&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '672d9bec-713f-4bcc-9b39-3ef7f267123d', 'multiverseId': 166071}, 'multiverseid': 166071}, {'name': 'Garras de Wirewood', 'text': 'Las Garras de Wirewood hacen 3 puntos de daño a cada criatura que tenga la habilidad de volar y a cada jugador.\\nCiclo {2}. {2}, descartar esta carta de tu mano: Roba una carta.)', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': 'Dicen que el bosque tiene ojos. Nunca mencionan sus garras.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166644&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '11fc3c8d-553b-48dc-8620-7b7c73932397', 'multiverseId': 166644}, 'multiverseid': 166644}, {'name': 'Griffes de Brinbois', 'text': 'Les Griffes de Brinbois infligent 3 blessures à chaque créature avec le vol et à chaque joueur.\\nRecyclage {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte de votre main : Piochez une carte.)', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': 'On dit que la forêt à des yeux. Personne ne parle jamais de ses griffes.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166214&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '008245c7-0817-4ab8-850d-e491171d3291', 'multiverseId': 166214}, 'multiverseid': 166214}, {'name': 'Artigli di Boscocavo', 'text': 'Gli Artigli di Boscocavo infliggono 3 danni a ogni creatura con volare e a ogni giocatore.\\nCiclo {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta dalla tua mano: Pesca una carta).', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': 'Dicono che la foresta abbia occhi. Ma nessuno parla dei suoi artigli.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166357&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '27b1ae41-b91d-4417-8756-323565b9daa2', 'multiverseId': 166357}, 'multiverseid': 166357}, {'name': 'ワイアウッドのかぎ爪', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e076d9d9-f256-426f-a257-44e0b81bfe3e'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Garras de Wirewood', 'text': 'Garras de Wirewood causa 3 pontos de dano a cada criatura com a habilidade de voar e a cada jogador.\\nReciclar {2} ({2}, Descarte este card de sua mão: Compre um card.)', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': 'Dizem que a floresta tem olhos. Mas nunca mencionam suas garras.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166500&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7c80703b-2771-459c-b768-ecb30d65e457', 'multiverseId': 166500}, 'multiverseid': 166500}]", '[{\'name\': \'Klingenschauer\', \'text\': \'Der Klingenschauer fügt jeder angreifenden Kreatur 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Manche behaupten, dies seien die Waffen der im Kampf gefallenen Helden, die auf einen letzten Ruhmesglanz hoffen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165977&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24cbd3f5-171e-47f4-9d79-24fef5288e3a\', \'multiverseId\': 165977}, \'multiverseid\': 165977}, {\'name\': \'Lluvia de espadas\', \'text\': \'La Lluvia de espadas hace 1 punto de daño a cada criatura atacante.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Algunos dicen que son las armas de héroes caídos en batalla, ansiosos por una última oportunidad de obtener gloria.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166550&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ad15940-ef7d-4434-8579-3bc65a2a0bff\', \'multiverseId\': 166550}, \'multiverseid\': 166550}, {\'name\': \'Pluie de lames\', \'text\': \'La Pluie de lames inflige 1 blessure à chaque créature attaquante.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "La légende veut que ce soient les armes des héros tombés au champ d\'honneur, venues chercher une dernière heure de gloire.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166120&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b9b760a-3d4c-40aa-8ee3-ba6bab119d9d\', \'multiverseId\': 166120}, \'multiverseid\': 166120}, {\'name\': \'Pioggia di Lame\', \'text\': \'La Pioggia di Lame infligge 1 danno a ogni creatura attaccante.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Alcuni dicono che siano le armi degli eroi caduti in battaglia, assetate di un\'ultima occasione di gloria.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166263&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'868d09be-98d8-45e0-b897-b8a2e8d34d27\', \'multiverseId\': 166263}, \'multiverseid\': 166263}, {\'name\': \'刃の雨\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b37eada-fdab-4a34-8e0b-526051951164\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Chuva de Lâminas\', \'text\': \'Chuva de Lâminas causa 1 ponto de dano a cada criatura atacante.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Alguns dizem que elas são as armas dos heróis que caíram no campo de batalha, sedentas por uma última chance de alcançar a glória.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166406&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0dcfa89-4c9a-452a-8b71-842718d1766a\', \'multiverseId\': 166406}, \'multiverseid\': 166406}]', "[{'name': 'Knochendorn-Valeske', 'text': 'Immer wenn eine Kreatur aufgedeckt wird, fügt die Knochendorn-Valeske einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Bestie', 'flavor': 'Ihre Sporen werden von Barbaren in Zeremonien-Amulette eingewoben, um ihre Standhaftigkeit im Kampf auszudrücken.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166039&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0e54c128-0034-4db0-a191-ccc2dd985cb0', 'multiverseId': 166039}, 'multiverseid': 166039}, {'name': 'Válesk huesopúa', 'text': 'Siempre que una criatura se ponga boca arriba, el Válesk huesopúa hace 1 punto de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo.', 'type': 'Criatura — Bestia', 'flavor': 'Los bárbaros tejen sus aguijones en amuletos ceremoniales para proclamar su fortaleza en la batalla.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166612&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '796d8351-3344-4618-bf89-4271bab80be5', 'multiverseId': 166612}, 'multiverseid': 166612}, {'name': 'Valesk ossépine', 'text': 'Quand une créature est retournée face visible, le Valesk ossépine inflige 1 blessure à une cible, créature ou joueur.', 'type': 'Créature : bête', 'flavor': 'Les barbares portent ses éperons pour montrer leur valeur au combat.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166182&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f1175572-b481-4fd9-953b-05dabe4845fc', 'multiverseId': 166182}, 'multiverseid': 166182}, {'name': 'Valesk Strappaossa', 'text': 'Ogniqualvolta una creatura viene girata a faccia in su, il Valesk Strappaossa infligge 1 danno a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.', 'type': 'Creatura — Bestia', 'flavor': 'I barbari trasformano i suoi speroni in monili cerimoniali per proclamare la loro forza in battaglia.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166325&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '46892ead-1f50-405c-ab0a-52dcb63d5d6b', 'multiverseId': 166325}, 'multiverseid': 166325}, {'name': '骨茨のヴァレスク', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f13cc24a-7a59-49c1-8317-4081063d29f5'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Valesk Espinhósseo', 'text': 'Toda vez que a face de uma criatura for voltada para cima, Valesk Espinhósseo causa 1 ponto de dano à criatura alvo ou ao jogador alvo.', 'type': 'Criatura — Besta', 'flavor': 'Os bárbaros tecem medalhões cerimoniais com seus espinhos para proclamar sua força na batalha.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166468&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6deb203a-5d0c-4e24-a535-38606511286b', 'multiverseId': 166468}, 'multiverseid': 166468}]", "[{'name': 'Krosanischer Kriegshäuptling', 'text': 'Bestienzauber, die du spielst, kosten beim Ausspielen {1} weniger.\\n{1}{G}: Regeneriere eine Bestie deiner Wahl.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Bestie', 'flavor': 'Er verwandelt Beute in Jäger.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166080&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b84f583b-3d38-4d53-9363-2eb37d41e023', 'multiverseId': 166080}, 'multiverseid': 166080}, {'name': 'Jefe de guerra krosano', 'text': 'Te cuesta {1} menos jugar los hechizos de Bestia.\\n{1}{G}: Regenera a la Bestia objetivo.', 'type': 'Criatura — Bestia', 'flavor': 'Convierte a la presa en depredador.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166653&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '725f0068-72c3-43d6-9e25-dde59b20df30', 'multiverseId': 166653}, 'multiverseid': 166653}, {'name': 'Chef de guerre krosian', 'text': 'Les sorts de bête que vous jouez coûtent {1} de moins à jouer.\\n{1}{G} : Régénérez la bête ciblée.', 'type': 'Créature : bête', 'flavor': 'Il change la proie en prédateur.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166223&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd55c7532-8cf7-4537-ae93-f485f825ca17', 'multiverseId': 166223}, 'multiverseid': 166223}, {'name': 'Condottiero di Krosa', 'text': 'Le magie Bestia che giochi costano {1} in meno per essere giocate.\\n{1}{G}: Rigenera una Bestia bersaglio.', 'type': 'Creatura — Bestia', 'flavor': 'Trasforma le prede in predatori.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166366&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4c97876f-9802-4ea9-999d-2ef04541ad99', 'multiverseId': 166366}, 'multiverseid': 166366}, {'name': 'クローサの戦長', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0c526767-2c85-41f2-bdd6-ff97407ff835'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Comandante de Guerra Krosano', 'text': 'Suas mágicas de Besta custam {1} a menos para serem jogadas.\\n{1}{G}: Regenera a Besta alvo.', 'type': 'Criatura — Besta', 'flavor': 'Ele transforma a presa em predador.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166509&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4a74b0ec-cddf-406d-99fd-37563d89b8e7', 'multiverseId': 166509}, 'multiverseid': 166509}]", '[{\'name\': \'Krosanischer Treiber\', \'text\': \'Kreaturenzauber mit umgewandelten Manakosten von 6 oder mehr, die du spielst, kosten beim Ausspielen {2} weniger.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf\', \'flavor\': \'„Sitz."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166079&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46f5e2af-0b98-4df3-8525-75d354bc8475\', \'multiverseId\': 166079}, \'multiverseid\': 166079}, {\'name\': \'Arriero krosano\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {2} menos jugar los hechizos de criatura con un coste de maná convertido de 6 o más.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Sentado".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166652&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cccfc3f4-386e-411c-8a20-293dc9961e1b\', \'multiverseId\': 166652}, \'multiverseid\': 166652}, {\'name\': \'Bouvier krosian\', \'text\': \'Les sorts de créature ayant un coût converti de mana de 6 ou plus que vous jouez coûtent {2} de moins à jouer.\', \'type\': \'Créature : elfe\', \'flavor\': \'« Assis »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166222&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3283cc89-0fce-4214-a685-47f9ceb3219a\', \'multiverseId\': 166222}, \'multiverseid\': 166222}, {\'name\': \'Mandriano di Krosa\', \'text\': \'Le magie creatura che giochi con costo di mana convertito pari o superiore a 6 costano {2} in meno per essere giocate.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Seduto".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166365&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db5933fd-210e-499f-8e9a-7e019d0c4256\', \'multiverseId\': 166365}, \'multiverseid\': 166365}, {\'name\': \'クローサの家畜商人\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cda7153d-420d-40c2-9f6f-0bb73f328ab5\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Tropeiro Krosano\', \'text\': \'As suas mágicas de criatura com custo de mana convertido maior ou igual a 6 custam {2} a menos para serem jogadas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Senta."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166508&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31763a3a-8e20-4671-9d1b-5d1dc33543cf\', \'multiverseId\': 166508}, \'multiverseid\': 166508}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kurgadon\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Kreaturenzauber mit umgewandelten Manakosten von 6 oder höher spielst, lege drei +1/+1-Marken auf das Kurgadon.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn es durch den Krosa-Wald stapft, springen die Bäume zur Seite, bekommen die Blätter Flügel, und der Boden erschauert.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166081&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4191d19-5419-40be-92cb-d76db38df837\', \'multiverseId\': 166081}, \'multiverseid\': 166081}, {\'name\': \'Kurgadón\', \'text\': \'Siempre que juegues un hechizo de criatura con un coste de maná convertido de 6 o más, pon tres contadores +1/+1 sobre el Kurgadón.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando camina a través de Krosa, los árboles se hacen a un lado, las hojas alzan el vuelo y el suelo se estremece.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166654&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4344632e-4a9c-4fd2-9efb-90f1777dd3be\', \'multiverseId\': 166654}, \'multiverseid\': 166654}, {\'name\': \'Kurgadon\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous jouez un sort de créature ayant un coût converti de mana de 6 ou plus, mettez trois marqueurs +1/+1 sur le Kurgadon.\', \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': "Quand il traverse la Krosia, les arbres s\'écartent, les feuilles s\'envolent, et le sol tremble.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166224&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b965ed0-e3a5-4e36-a5f8-cbf0fcfd91d3\', \'multiverseId\': 166224}, \'multiverseid\': 166224}, {\'name\': \'Curgadonte\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta giochi una magia creatura con costo di mana convertito pari o superiore a 6, metti tre segnalini +1/+1 sul Curgadonte.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'Quando attraversa Krosa, gli alberi si fanno da parte, le foglie mettono le ali e il terreno trema.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166367&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40104e69-839c-4332-a8e6-eff60deb788f\', \'multiverseId\': 166367}, \'multiverseid\': 166367}, {\'name\': \'クーガドン\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ce27a94-6160-4f2d-a8d6-1324e93a57da\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Kurgadonte\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você jogar uma mágica de criatura com custo de mana convertido maior ou igual a 6, coloque três marcadores +1/+1 em Kurgadonte.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Besta\', \'flavor\': \'Quando ele atravessa Krosa, as árvores abrem passagem, as folhas saem voando e o chão treme.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166510&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fac0c482-1d38-4e04-992e-0a8719d0504f\', \'multiverseId\': 166510}, \'multiverseid\': 166510}]', "[{'name': 'Küstenwächter', 'text': 'Fliegend, Schutz vor Grün', 'type': 'Kreatur — Vogel, Soldat', 'flavor': 'Die Avior lernten die Klauen des Waldes fürchten, doch die Küstenwächter gaben ihnen neuen Mut.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165987&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '627256ff-9e73-4e3a-b664-b95c769e5385', 'multiverseId': 165987}, 'multiverseid': 165987}, {'name': 'Observador del litorial', 'text': 'Vuela, protección contra verde.', 'type': 'Criatura — Soldado ave', 'flavor': 'Los aven llegaron a temerles a las ramas arañadoras del bosque, pero los observadores rápidamente renovaron su valor.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166560&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5a4be4b8-8eba-4ffe-b995-03101a401dd0', 'multiverseId': 166560}, 'multiverseid': 166560}, {'name': 'Gardien des côtes', 'text': 'Vol, protection contre le vert', 'type': 'Créature : oiseau et soldat', 'flavor': 'Les avemains en vinrent à craindre les branches griffues de la forêt, mais les gardiens leur redonnèrent courage.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166130&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ee4d1ce8-4efe-4f06-82bb-8906565c0ecb', 'multiverseId': 166130}, 'multiverseid': 166130}, {'name': 'Guardiacoste', 'text': 'Volare, protezione dal verde', 'type': 'Creatura — Soldato Uccello', 'flavor': 'Gli aviani impararono a temere i rami artigliati della foresta, ma le sentinelle rinsaldarono presto il proprio coraggio.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166273&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e78bcf7c-a6c3-448c-8116-83e98824bf34', 'multiverseId': 166273}, 'multiverseid': 166273}, {'name': '沿岸の見張り', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '60c14d2d-5e18-4bd3-bfde-77b516bffc0a'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Vigilante da Costa', 'text': 'Voar, proteção contra o verde', 'type': 'Criatura — Soldado Pássaro', 'flavor': 'Os avianos chegaram a temer os galhos-garras da floresta, mas os vigilantes rapidamente renovaram sua coragem.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166416&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fabd4878-4dc9-4209-a6d3-38469b8fb6d0', 'multiverseId': 166416}, 'multiverseid': 166416}]", '[{\'name\': \'Lade der Fäulnis\', \'text\': \'{3}, {T}, opfere die Lade der Fäulnis: Zerstöre ein Land deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn sie geöffnet wird, entfernt sie ganze Landschaften aus Karten und Erinnerungen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166097&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12b666db-015e-416b-ab88-639455f1afd0\', \'multiverseId\': 166097}, \'multiverseid\': 166097}, {\'name\': \'Arca de arruinamiento\', \'text\': \'{3}, {T}, sacrificar el Arca de arruinamiento: Destruye la tierra objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando se abre, borra paisajes enteros de las mentes y de los mapas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166670&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9b22354-5f4f-4883-ad24-045a1c8792e0\', \'multiverseId\': 166670}, \'multiverseid\': 166670}, {\'name\': \'Arche de flétrissement\', \'text\': "{3}, {T}, Sacrifiez l\'Arche de flétrissement : Détruisez le terrain ciblé.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Une fois ouverte, elle efface des paysages entiers des souvenirs et des cartes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166240&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0038eac-bce1-4d90-bb0e-df99299e5869\', \'multiverseId\': 166240}, \'multiverseid\': 166240}, {\'name\': \'Arca della Devastazione\', \'text\': "{3}, {T}, Sacrifica l\'Arca della Devastazione: Distruggi una terra bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Quando viene aperta, cancella interi paesaggi dai ricordi e dalle mappe.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166383&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dda86213-e7d1-4800-90c7-cbf09acdca58\', \'multiverseId\': 166383}, \'multiverseid\': 166383}, {\'name\': \'荒廃の箱\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef0ab1e7-946b-4510-adde-49735ff257e6\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Arca do Malogro\', \'text\': \'{3}, {T}, Sacrifique Arca do Malogro: Destrói o terreno alvo.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Ao ser aberta, elimina paisagens inteiras de mentes e mapas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166526&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fc7e8e0-abe0-4b61-8d0f-4424371196b1\', \'multiverseId\': 166526}, \'multiverseid\': 166526}]', '[{\'name\': \'Langzeitpläne\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Karte, mische deine Bibliothek und lege diese Karte als dritte von oben in deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Lass mich mal nachdenken, das fällt mir sicher gleich ein."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165995&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'152dd3cf-4248-4c55-88a4-f09b2225ba05\', \'multiverseId\': 165995}, \'multiverseid\': 165995}, {\'name\': \'Planes a largo plazo\', \'text\': \'Busca en tu biblioteca una carta, barajar la biblioteca, luego pon esa carta en tercer lugar empezando por arriba.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Espera, vendrá en un momento".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'436960a8-6774-42ae-9ab8-fa0c87f68c03\', \'multiverseId\': 166568}, \'multiverseid\': 166568}, {\'name\': \'Plans à long terme\', \'text\': \'Cherchez une carte dans votre bibliothèque, mélangez votre bibliothèque, et placez-y ensuite cette carte en troisième position, depuis le dessus.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Attendez, ça va me revenir. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166138&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b626e91-c78c-4616-a68c-2f4e631a51ec\', \'multiverseId\': 166138}, \'multiverseid\': 166138}, {\'name\': \'Piani a Lungo Termine\', \'text\': \'Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio, scegli una carta, rimescola il tuo grimorio e metti quella carta nel grimorio come terza dalla cima.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Aspetta, mi verrà in mente tra un attimo".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166281&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75181ae1-d6a6-4e29-981a-ec7944655e0b\', \'multiverseId\': 166281}, \'multiverseid\': 166281}, {\'name\': \'長期計画\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e6821d3-70f9-4fbc-bbad-a58c56058726\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Planos a Longo Prazo\', \'text\': \'Procure em seu grimório por um card, embaralhe seu grimório e coloque aquele card como o terceiro contando a partir do topo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Espere, lembrarei em um minuto"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166424&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47a809fa-75c8-42f0-99d4-c1f604fe8224\', \'multiverseId\': 166424}, \'multiverseid\': 166424}]', '[{\'name\': \'Letzte Bestrafung\', \'text\': \'Ein Spieler deiner Wahl verliert so viele Lebenspunkte, wie ihm in diesem Zug bereits Schaden zugefügt wurde.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Die Schmerzen eines ganzen Lebens jede Schramme, jede Krankheit, jede Verletzung verdichtet in einen einzigen Moment.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166024&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2f070be-8f83-40bb-9127-5117c42cc461\', \'multiverseId\': 166024}, \'multiverseid\': 166024}, {\'name\': \'Castigo final\', \'text\': \'El jugador objetivo pierde una cantidad de vida igual al daño que ya haya recibido este turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'El dolor de una vida -cada raspón, enfermedad y moretón- condensado en un solo momento.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166597&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc601290-452c-4cbf-9c3d-95d8f243674f\', \'multiverseId\': 166597}, \'multiverseid\': 166597}, {\'name\': \'Punition finale\', \'text\': "Le joueur ciblé perd un nombre de points de vie égal au nombre de blessures qu\'il a déjà subi pendant ce tour.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Vivre en un seul instant toutes les souffrances de toute une vie — la moindre égratignure, la moindre maladie, le moindre mal.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166167&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1cc3928-7dcb-44be-ba2c-9457e464d109\', \'multiverseId\': 166167}, \'multiverseid\': 166167}, {\'name\': \'Punizione Definitiva\', \'text\': \'Il giocatore bersaglio perde un ammontare di punti vita pari ai danni che gli sono già stati inflitti in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Il dolore di un\'intera vita ogni graffio, malattia e ferita condensato in un singolo istante.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166310&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8dd0aba-afdc-48e8-9fd3-596b1e8183a2\', \'multiverseId\': 166310}, \'multiverseid\': 166310}, {\'name\': \'最後の罰\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'737442d1-3138-4a04-a5a0-37fc4054d08b\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Punição Final\', \'text\': \'O jogador alvo perde uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual ao dano já causado a ele próprio neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'A dor de uma vida cada arranhão, doença e machucado condensada num único momento.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166453&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9f2ebbb-578c-45f4-8f1f-cf7fc1dee59e\', \'multiverseId\': 166453}, \'multiverseid\': 166453}]', "[{'name': 'Meister der Rabengilde', 'text': 'Immer wenn Meister der Rabengilde einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, entfernt dieser Spieler die obersten zehn Karten seiner Bibliothek ganz aus dem Spiel.\\nMorph {2}{U}{U} (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur spielen. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Morph-Kosten auf.)', 'type': 'Kreatur — Zauberer, Mutant', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166004&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1c444bf4-7fd9-4aa9-9b8c-089c14a59670', 'multiverseId': 166004}, 'multiverseid': 166004}, {'name': 'Maestro del gremio de cuervos', 'text': 'Siempre que el Maestro del Gremio de Cuervos haga daño de combate a un jugador, ese jugador remueve del juego las diez cartas de la parte superior de su biblioteca.\\nMetamorfosis {2}{U}{U}. (Puedes jugar esta carta boca abajo como una criatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Ponla boca arriba en cualquier momento pagando su coste de metamorfosis.)', 'type': 'Criatura — Mutante hechicero', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166577&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '68747a57-2de6-44a7-b2cc-23014d9bbced', 'multiverseId': 166577}, 'multiverseid': 166577}, {'name': 'Maître de la guilde du corbeau', 'text': 'À chaque fois que le Maître de la guilde du corbeau inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, ce joueur retire de la partie les dix cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque.\\nMue {2}{U}{U} (Vous pouvez jouer cette carte face cachée comme une créature 2/2 pour {3}. Retournez-la quand vous le désirez pour son coût de mue.)', 'type': 'Créature : Wizard Mutant', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166147&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b58a43f2-13a1-496f-a3aa-846477fa7451', 'multiverseId': 166147}, 'multiverseid': 166147}, {'name': 'Maestro della Gilda del Corvo', 'text': 'Ogniqualvolta il Maestro della Gilda del Corvo infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, quel giocatore rimuove dal gioco le prime dieci carte del proprio grimorio.\\nMetamorfosi {2}{U}{U} (puoi giocare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di metamorfosi.)', 'type': 'Creatura — Mutante Mago', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166290&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e3bdd1f4-8bf9-4d2b-8ed1-8efb560576ec', 'multiverseId': 166290}, 'multiverseid': 166290}, {'name': 'レイヴンギルドの師匠', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dd5b1096-1fc3-4c10-81ed-12d90744c8df'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Mestre da Guilda do Corvo', 'text': 'Toda vez que Mestre da Guilda do Corvo causar dano de combate a um jogador, aquele jogador remove de jogo os dez cards do topo do grimório dele.\\nMetamorfose {2}{U}{U} (Você pode baixar este card com a face voltada para baixo como uma criatura 2/2 por {3}. Volte sua face para cima a qualquer momento pagando seu custo de metamorfose.)', 'type': 'Criatura — Mago Mutante', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166433&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '17b662de-bf6b-48a4-878b-bec982c00102', 'multiverseId': 166433}, 'multiverseid': 166433}]", '[{\'name\': \'Mordender Zombie\', \'text\': \'Morph Bezahle 5 Lebenspunkte. (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur spielen. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Morph-Kosten auf.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Das eingleisige Denken eines Zombies kombiniert mit der Verschlagenheit eines Meuchlers.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166038&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'518cfecd-c205-4ee0-b6e0-ea1ca1f26a38\', \'multiverseId\': 166038}, \'multiverseid\': 166038}, {\'name\': \'Degollador zombie\', \'text\': \'Metamorfosis - Pagar 5 vidas. (Puedes jugar esta carta boca abajo como una criatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Ponla boca arriba en cualquier momento pagando su coste de metamorfosis.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'La determinación de un zombie, la astucia de un asesino.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166611&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ccbda27-ba16-4c26-ad8e-638e44c64662\', \'multiverseId\': 166611}, \'multiverseid\': 166611}, {\'name\': \'Surineur zombie\', \'text\': \'Mue—Payez 5 points de vie. (Vous pouvez jouer cette carte face cachée comme une créature 2/2 pour {3}. Retournez-la quand vous le désirez pour son coût de mue.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : zombie\', \'flavor\': "La ténacité d\'un zombie, la ruse d\'un assassin.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166181&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ddb4f49-ee79-4a1f-a59e-9dd5a125f82b\', \'multiverseId\': 166181}, \'multiverseid\': 166181}, {\'name\': \'Tagliagole Zombie\', \'text\': \'Metamorfosi—Paga 5 punti vita. (puoi giocare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di metamorfosi.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': "La determinazione di uno zombie, l\'astuzia di un assassino.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166324&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a8d554d-08e6-44fe-b6ce-60a4f72fa58d\', \'multiverseId\': 166324}, \'multiverseid\': 166324}, {\'name\': \'ゾンビの殺し屋\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63fa9dd2-0056-4477-ae79-386bc492dc51\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Zumbi Degolador\', \'text\': \'Metamorfose—Pague 5 pontos de vida. (Você pode baixar este card com a face voltada para baixo como uma criatura 2/2 por {3}. Volte sua face para cima a qualquer momento pagando seu custo de metamorfose.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi\', \'flavor\': \'A simplicidade de um zumbi, a astúcia de um assassino.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166467&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28a60df4-c882-4e4d-91d5-6189178b148e\', \'multiverseId\': 166467}, \'multiverseid\': 166467}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nebelgestaltkriegshäuptling\', \'text\': \'Kreaturenzauber, die du spielst und die einen Kreaturentyp mit dem Nebelgestaltkriegshäuptling gemeinsam haben, kosten beim Ausspielen {1} weniger.\\n{T}: Der Kreaturentyp des Nebelgestaltkriegshäuptlings wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einem Kreaturentyp, den du bestimmst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Illusion\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166000&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36e60d4a-379f-4b17-8ed6-71186c7b2fd2\', \'multiverseId\': 166000}, \'multiverseid\': 166000}, {\'name\': \'Jefe de guerra nebuliforme\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {1} menos jugar los hechizos de criatura que compartan un tipo de criatura con el Jefe de guerra nebuliforme.\\n{T}: El tipo del Jefe de guerra nebuliforme es el tipo de criatura de tu elección hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ilusión\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166573&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c745cc9f-af2d-412c-985c-f11587e030b4\', \'multiverseId\': 166573}, \'multiverseid\': 166573}, {\'name\': \'Chef de guerre changebrume\', \'text\': "Les sorts de créatures que vous jouez qui partagent un type de créature avec le Chef de guerre changebrume coûtent {1} de moins à jouer.\\n{T} : Le type du Chef de guerre changebrume devient le type de créature de votre choix jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : illusion\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166143&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ef6deaa-3e12-4e59-a72c-2f66be70816d\', \'multiverseId\': 166143}, \'multiverseid\': 166143}, {\'name\': \'Condottiero Nebbiforme\', \'text\': \'Le magie creatura che giochi e che hanno almeno un tipo di creatura in comune con il Condottiero Nebbiforme costano {1} in meno per essere giocate.\\n{T}: Il tipo del Condottiero Nebbiforme diventa un tipo di creatura a tua scelta fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Illusione\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166286&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33ee837c-802d-43ef-a8c3-60cdfff0995e\', \'multiverseId\': 166286}, \'multiverseid\': 166286}, {\'name\': \'霧衣の戦長\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da2d9414-9db8-4a90-a5f7-041375aeff27\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Comandante de Guerra Nebuliforme\', \'text\': \'Suas mágicas de criatura que compartilhem um tipo de criatura com Comandante de Guerra Nebuliforme custam {1} a menos para serem jogadas.\\n{T}: O tipo de Comandante de Guerra Nebuliforme torna-se do tipo de criatura de sua escolha até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ilusão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166429&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b7cc7d4-7180-48ec-aaa4-42973b63d058\', \'multiverseId\': 166429}, \'multiverseid\': 166429}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nefashu\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn der Nefashu angreift, erhalten bis zu fünf Kreaturen deiner Wahl jeweils -1/-1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie, Mutant\', \'flavor\': \'Wo ein Nefashu vorbeikommt, fließt Blut wie ein seidener Teppich.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166027&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d64a9382-dada-4f7b-800a-d92143ebc0e2\', \'multiverseId\': 166027}, \'multiverseid\': 166027}, {\'name\': \'Nefashu\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Nefashu ataque, cada una de hasta cinco criaturas objetivo obtienen -1/-1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Mutante zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Donde pasa el nefashu, la sangre se extiende como alfombra de seda.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166600&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49471601-23c8-4ea9-9bf0-e0a5ac7a872b\', \'multiverseId\': 166600}, \'multiverseid\': 166600}, {\'name\': \'Néfashu\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que le Néfashu attaque, jusqu\'à cinq créatures ciblées gagnent chacune -1/-1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : zombie et mutant\', \'flavor\': \'Là où passent les néfashus, le sang se répand tel un tapis soyeux.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166170&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34b1c39a-ca16-4064-b47e-d7e431b9824d\', \'multiverseId\': 166170}, \'multiverseid\': 166170}, {\'name\': \'Nefashu\', \'text\': \'Quando il Nefashu attacca, fino a cinque creature bersaglio prendono ciascuna -1/-1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mutante Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Dove passa il nefashu, il sangue scorre come un tappeto di seta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166313&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdd335ef-7901-48c4-85f5-22d4935b3ee2\', \'multiverseId\': 166313}, \'multiverseid\': 166313}, {\'name\': \'ネファーシュ\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13fd05cf-7972-41ec-87ed-0e847f4f4129\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Nefashu\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Nefashu atacar, cada uma de até cinco criaturas alvo recebe -1/-1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi Mutante\', \'flavor\': \'Por onde passa o nefashu, o sangue estende-se como um tapete de seda.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166456&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'696f0556-79f7-4ce6-9d3d-316fa8e99e13\', \'multiverseId\': 166456}, \'multiverseid\': 166456}]', "[{'name': 'Novize der Rabengilde', 'text': 'Morph Bringe einen Vogel, den du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück. (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur spielen. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Morph-Kosten auf.)', 'type': 'Kreatur — Zauberer', 'flavor': 'Die Rabengilde segelt auf Winden der Unbehaglichkeit.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166003&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f343724b-4b55-4623-8a02-a461881a561a', 'multiverseId': 166003}, 'multiverseid': 166003}, {'name': 'Iniciada del gremio de cuervos', 'text': 'Metamorfosis - Regresa un Ave que controles a la mano de su propietario. (Puedes jugar esta carta boca abajo como una criatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Ponla boca arriba en cualquier momento pagando su coste de metamorfosis.)', 'type': 'Criatura — Hechicero', 'flavor': 'El Gremio de Cuervos remonta el vuelo en vientos de inquietud.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166576&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1811578f-1a27-4a8c-84e2-b2bf54cebc3b', 'multiverseId': 166576}, 'multiverseid': 166576}, {'name': 'Adepte de la guilde du corbeau', 'text': 'Mue—Renvoyez un oiseau que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire. (Vous pouvez jouer cette carte face cachée comme une créature 2/2 pour {3}. Retournez-la quand vous le désirez pour son coût de mue.)', 'type': 'Créature : sorcier', 'flavor': 'La guilde du corbeau plane sur les vents troubles.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166146&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1bfc9463-a9e3-4f43-b781-822e13fa4d02', 'multiverseId': 166146}, 'multiverseid': 166146}, {'name': 'Iniziato della Gilda del Corvo', 'text': 'Metamorfosi—Il proprietario riprende in mano un Uccello che tu controlli. (puoi giocare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di metamorfosi.)', 'type': 'Creatura — Mago', 'flavor': 'La Gilda del Corvo solca i cieli più irrequieti.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166289&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2e0c0851-1271-4314-9e22-fa891d2d8b79', 'multiverseId': 166289}, 'multiverseid': 166289}, {'name': 'レイヴンギルドの信徒', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cba76498-3511-483c-823b-a9b2e5afbc5e'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Iniciado da Guilda do Corvo', 'text': 'Metamorfose—Devolva uma Ave ou um Pássaro que você controla para a mão de seu dono. (Você pode baixar este card com a face voltada para baixo como uma criatura 2/2 por {3}. Volte sua face para cima a qualquer momento pagando seu custo de metamorfose.)', 'type': 'Criatura — Mago', 'flavor': 'A Guilda do Corvo plana em ventos agitados.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166432&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e3e0ac12-4408-42ed-a7af-8598efe84cba', 'multiverseId': 166432}, 'multiverseid': 166432}]", "[{'name': 'Parallele Gedanken', 'text': 'Wenn die Parallelen Gedanken ins Spiel kommen, durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach sieben Karten, entferne diese in einem verdeckten Stapel ganz aus dem Spiel und mische diesen Stapel. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.\\nFalls du eine Karte ziehen würdest, kannst du stattdessen die oberste Karte des so ganz aus dem Spiel entfernten Stapels auf deine Hand nehmen.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166001&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cef742d3-78c0-41de-804a-1f33442915fd', 'multiverseId': 166001}, 'multiverseid': 166001}, {'name': 'Pensamientos paralelos', 'text': 'Cuando los Pensamientos paralelos entren en juego, busca en tu biblioteca siete cartas, remuévelas del juego en un montón boca abajo y baraja ese montón. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.\\nSi fueras a robar una carta, en vez de eso, puedes poner en tu mano la carta de la parte superior del montón que removiste.', 'type': 'Encantamiento', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166574&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4f6c9c7e-317f-4327-93b1-655eade39bbf', 'multiverseId': 166574}, 'multiverseid': 166574}, {'name': 'Pensées parallèles', 'text': 'Quand les Pensées parallèles arrivent en jeu, cherchez sept cartes dans votre bibliothèque, retirez-les de la partie, empilez-les face cachée et mélangez cette pile. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.\\nSi vous deviez piocher une carte, vous pouvez, à la place, mettre dans votre main la carte du dessus de la pile des cartes retirées.', 'type': 'Enchantement', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166144&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '04b94b44-6a27-495c-811c-2f64114af6ac', 'multiverseId': 166144}, 'multiverseid': 166144}, {'name': 'Pensieri Paralleli', 'text': 'Quando i Pensieri Paralleli entrano in gioco, passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio, scegli sette carte, rimuovile dal gioco in una pila a faccia in giù e rimescola quella pila. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\\nSe devi pescare una carta, puoi invece aggiungere alla tua mano la carta in cima alla pila che hai rimosso.', 'type': 'Incantesimo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166287&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'beed95eb-a7d4-4764-9ca4-6537b0b6398e', 'multiverseId': 166287}, 'multiverseid': 166287}, {'name': '平行思考', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd7b55e3c-b264-4046-93b0-b26e1aef4e59'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Pensamentos Paralelos', 'text': 'Quando Pensamentos Paralelos entra em jogo, procure em seu grimório por sete cards, remova-os do jogo com a face voltada para baixo em uma pilha e embaralhe-a. Depois, embaralhe seu grimório.\\nSe fosse comprar um card, ao invés disso você pode colocar em sua mão o card do topo da pilha que você removeu de jogo.', 'type': 'Encantamento', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166430&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3852198d-b389-4e3a-bd9e-52a355ef4c9b', 'multiverseId': 166430}, 'multiverseid': 166430}]", '[{\'name\': \'Pemmins Aura\', \'text\': \'{U}: Enttappe die verzauberte Kreatur.\\n{U}: Die verzauberte Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält Flugfähigkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n{U}: Die verzauberte Kreatur kann in diesem Zug nicht das Ziel von Zaubersprüchen und Fähigkeiten sein.\\n{1}: Die verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/-1 oder -1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreaturenverzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166002&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b7a4f29-ae6b-4c50-8b14-6ef88af6f6e2\', \'multiverseId\': 166002}, \'multiverseid\': 166002}, {\'name\': \'Aura de Pemmin\', \'text\': \'{U}: Endereza la criatura encantada.\\n{U}: La criatura encantada gana la habilidad de volar hasta el final del turno.\\n{U}: La criatura encantada no puede ser objetivo de hechizos o habilidades este turno.\\n{1}: La criatura encantada obtiene +1/-1 ó -1/+1 hasta el final del turno\', \'type\': \'Encantar criatura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166575&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d9295ec-8485-4466-8f3b-ff8340ac4ef1\', \'multiverseId\': 166575}, \'multiverseid\': 166575}, {\'name\': \'Aura de Pemmin\', \'text\': "{U} : Dégagez la créature enchantée.\\n{U} : La créature enchantée acquiert le vol jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n{U} : La créature enchantée ne peut pas être la cible de sorts ou de capacités ce tour-ci.\\n{1} : La créature enchantée gagne +1/-1 ou -1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Enchanter : créature\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166145&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0b8fb97-a568-479a-8fa1-37dc46ee088a\', \'multiverseId\': 166145}, \'multiverseid\': 166145}, {\'name\': \'Aura Pemmins\', \'text\': \'{U}: STAPpa la creatura incantata.\\n{U}: La creatura incantata guadagna volare fino alla fine del turno.\\n{U}: La creatura incantata non può essere bersaglio di magie o abilità in questo turno.\\n{1}: La creatura incantata prende +1/-1 o -1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Incanta Creatura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166288&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1c0c2d5-de86-47d2-ad53-21743650fab4\', \'multiverseId\': 166288}, \'multiverseid\': 166288}, {\'name\': \'ペミンのオーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e72e9f82-4037-49c3-b196-d3a42888fb9e\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Aura de Pemmin\', \'text\': \'{U}: Desvira a criatura encantada.\\n{U}: A criatura encantada ganha a habilidade de voar até o final do turno.\\n{U}: A criatura encantada não pode ser alvo de mágicas ou habilidades neste turno.\\n{1}: A criatura encantada recebe +1/-1 ou -1/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantar Criatura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166431&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22afbecf-3e9e-418a-9153-5dafe48206cd\', \'multiverseId\': 166431}, \'multiverseid\': 166431}]', '[{\'name\': \'Primitive Einkerbungen\', \'text\': \'Zeige die erste Karte, die du in jedem Zug ziehst, offen vor. Immer wenn du dabei eine Kreaturenkarte vorzeigst, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Uralte Scharten in den Bäumen des Krosa-Waldes glühen voll vergessener Macht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166083&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'032268d6-bc17-4578-8950-a6c39483c6fe\', \'multiverseId\': 166083}, \'multiverseid\': 166083}, {\'name\': \'Grabados primitivos\', \'text\': \'Muestra la primera carta que robes cada turno. Siempre que muestres una carta de criatura de esta manera, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Los grabados primitivos en los árboles de Krosa resplandecen con poder nuevamente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166656&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'429cc2a6-21ed-4429-a859-2b8328af7e18\', \'multiverseId\': 166656}, \'multiverseid\': 166656}, {\'name\': \'Gravures primitives\', \'text\': \'Révélez la première carte que vous piochez à chaque tour. À chaque fois que vous révélez une carte de créature de cette manière, piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "D\'anciens signes gravés sur l\'écorce des arbres de la Krosia brillent soudain, recouvrant leur puissance.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166226&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14a56b5a-618e-4a82-909f-bddb9772c698\', \'multiverseId\': 166226}, \'multiverseid\': 166226}, {\'name\': \'Incisioni Primitive\', \'text\': \'Rivela la prima carta che peschi ad ogni turno. Ogniqualvolta riveli una carta creatura in questo modo, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Le incisioni primitive negli alberi di Krosa sono nuovamente illuminate dal potere.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166369&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2f03255-3cf5-4d0f-8a75-2711942bfa7f\', \'multiverseId\': 166369}, \'multiverseid\': 166369}, {\'name\': \'原始的刻印\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45f5867d-6e1b-4130-a390-63e452b4e5a7\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Esboços Primitivos\', \'text\': \'Revele o primeiro card que você comprar em cada turno. Toda vez que você revelar um card de criatura desta maneira, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'Os antigos entalhes nas árvores de Krosa voltaram a brilhar com poder.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166512&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32e4a1db-882d-48e6-ae1f-88cb1f859a5b\', \'multiverseId\': 166512}, \'multiverseid\': 166512}]', "[{'name': 'Proteusmaschine', 'text': 'Morph {0} (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur spielen. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Morph-Kosten auf.)\\nWenn die Proteusmaschine aufgedeckt wird, wird ihr Typ zu einem Kreaturentyp, den du bestimmst. (Dieser Effekt endet nicht am Ende des Zuges.)', 'type': 'Artefaktkreatur', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166098&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fb766590-463a-4719-8c0c-d67f542a7ba9', 'multiverseId': 166098}, 'multiverseid': 166098}, {'name': 'Máquina proteica', 'text': 'Metamorfosis {0}.(Puedes jugar esta carta boca abajo como una criatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Ponla boca arriba en cualquier momento pagando su coste de metamorfosis.)\\nCuando la Máquina proteica se ponga boca arriba, su tipo es el tipo de criatura de tu elección. (Este efecto no termina al final del turno.)', 'type': 'Criatura artefacto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166671&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b1f5d883-1919-4394-84d7-bda6b27d96e1', 'multiverseId': 166671}, 'multiverseid': 166671}, {'name': 'Machine de Protée', 'text': 'Mue {0} (Vous pouvez jouer cette carte face cachée comme une créature 2/2 pour {3}. Retournez-la quand vous le désirez pour son coût de mue.)\\nQuand la Machine de Protée est retournée face visible, son type devient le type de créature de votre choix. (Cet effet ne cesse pas à la fin du tour.)', 'type': 'Créature-artefact', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166241&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ffb1b32a-4bef-48c9-90b5-d8846d85a9d2', 'multiverseId': 166241}, 'multiverseid': 166241}, {'name': 'Macchina Proteus', 'text': 'Metamorfosi {0} (puoi giocare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di metamorfosi.)\\nQuando la Macchina Proteus viene girata a faccia in su, il suo tipo diventa un tipo di creatura a tua scelta (questo effetto non termina alla fine del turno).', 'type': 'Creatura Artefatto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166384&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2e85b870-dc41-4f20-a5c5-5f91c07c933b', 'multiverseId': 166384}, 'multiverseid': 166384}, {'name': '変幻の機械', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9c54fe3a-6cd7-4d72-828a-d89e84a856a5'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Máquina de Proteus', 'text': 'Metamorfose {0} (Você pode baixar este card com a face voltada para baixo como uma criatura 2/2 por {3}. Volte sua face para cima a qualquer momento pagando seu custo de metamorfose.)\\nQuando a face de Máquina de Proteus for voltada para cima, seu tipo torna-se do tipo de criatura de sua escolha. (Este efeito não cessa no final do turno.)', 'type': 'Criatura Artefato', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166527&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3e08b8c0-d370-4d48-b6ab-c561436de616', 'multiverseId': 166527}, 'multiverseid': 166527}]", '[{\'name\': \'Pyrostatische Säule\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Spieler einen Zauberspruch mit umgewandelten Manakosten von 3 oder weniger ausspielt, fügt die Pyrostatische Säule diesem Spieler 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166057&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f81ec0e-9490-4eda-b8b7-f6f81f1ea50b\', \'multiverseId\': 166057}, \'multiverseid\': 166057}, {\'name\': \'Pilar piroestático\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un jugador juegue un hechizo con un coste de maná convertido de 3 o menos, el Pilar piroestático hace 2 puntos de daño a ese jugador.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166630&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae2df2da-a3b9-435c-bc11-a410052ccbde\', \'multiverseId\': 166630}, \'multiverseid\': 166630}, {\'name\': \'Pilier pyrostatique\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un joueur joue un sort ayant un coût converti de mana de 3 ou moins, le Pilier pyrostatique inflige 2 blessures à ce joueur.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166200&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09e1bb92-4462-485e-a006-ff042a4e6260\', \'multiverseId\': 166200}, \'multiverseid\': 166200}, {\'name\': \'Colonna di Fuoco\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un giocatore gioca una magia con costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore a 3, la Colonna di Fuoco infligge 2 danni a quel giocatore.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166343&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b865a19-ec60-443d-aafb-f192284c2a70\', \'multiverseId\': 166343}, \'multiverseid\': 166343}, {\'name\': \'紅蓮光電の柱\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6ad0bc1-2f0d-46da-9db3-45237444f260\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Pilar Pirostático\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um jogador jogar uma mágica com custo de mana convertido menor ou igual a 3, Pilar Pirostático causa 2 pontos de dano àquele jogador.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166486&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52b9a480-ab46-43d2-b2f5-69be758f586e\', \'multiverseId\': 166486}, \'multiverseid\': 166486}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rachsüchtiger Toter\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn der Rachsüchtige Tote oder ein anderer Zombie aus dem Spiel in einen Friedhof gelegt wird, verliert jeder Gegner 1 Lebenspunkt.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Wer aus seinem Tod nichts lernt, ist dazu bestimmt, ihn zu wiederholen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166037&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c46ba9f-c956-43ed-804b-6f5cdf2643a8\', \'multiverseId\': 166037}, \'multiverseid\': 166037}, {\'name\': \'Muerto vengativo\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Muerto vengativo u otro Zombie vaya a un cementerio desde el juego, cada oponente pierde 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Aquéllos que no aprenden de sus muertes están destinados a repetirlas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166610&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34825141-3263-487b-83fa-994ca177c6c4\', \'multiverseId\': 166610}, \'multiverseid\': 166610}, {\'name\': \'Mort vengeur\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que le Mort vengeur ou un autre zombie est mis dans un cimetière depuis le jeu, chacun de vos adversaires perd 1 point de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : zombie\', \'flavor\': "Ceux qui n\'ont rien appris de la mort sont appelés à la revivre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166180&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f398b12-1ca3-4034-8509-c3fe51864bab\', \'multiverseId\': 166180}, \'multiverseid\': 166180}, {\'name\': \'Morto Vendicativo\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta il Morto Vendicativo o un altro Zombie viene messo in un cimitero dal gioco, ogni avversario perde 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Coloro che non imparano dalla propria morte sono destinati a ripeterla.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166323&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'037261ab-7431-4e20-89c4-cc0d038e4728\', \'multiverseId\': 166323}, \'multiverseid\': 166323}, {\'name\': \'復讐に燃えた死者\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30d2b840-4aee-4a64-8a96-dbba83370466\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Morto Vingativo\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Morto Vingativo ou qualquer outro Zumbi for colocado num cemitério vindo de jogo, cada oponente perde 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi\', \'flavor\': \'O destino dos que não aprenderam com suas mortes é repeti-las.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166466&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e077450-2dac-47a4-b4ae-fd79708d37a8\', \'multiverseId\': 166466}, \'multiverseid\': 166466}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ranken der Pein\', \'text\': \'Ein Spieler deiner Wahl verliert 2 Lebenspunkte, und du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\\nSturm (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch spielst, kopiere ihn einmal für jeden Zauberspruch, der in diesem Zug bereits gespielt wurde. Du kannst andere Ziele für diese Kopien bestimmen.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166032&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de33e951-179d-4afc-9c0a-8e0752a82bcf\', \'multiverseId\': 166032}, \'multiverseid\': 166032}, {\'name\': \'Zarcillos de agonía\', \'text\': \'El jugador objetivo pierde 2 vida y tú ganas 2 vida.\\nTormenta (Cuando juegues este hechizo, cópialo por cada hechizo jugado antes que él en este turno. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para las copias.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166605&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f956752-6a43-4efb-8daf-849f970f686e\', \'multiverseId\': 166605}, \'multiverseid\': 166605}, {\'name\': "Vrilles d\'angoisse", \'text\': \'Le joueur ciblé perd 2 points de vie et vous gagnez 2 points de vie.\\nDéluge (Quand vous jouez ce sort, copiez-le pour chaque sort joué avant lui ce tour-ci. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour chaque copie.)\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166175&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee19696e-eb74-4d3c-bb65-f2567d703ab0\', \'multiverseId\': 166175}, \'multiverseid\': 166175}, {\'name\': "Filamenti dell\'Agonia", \'text\': \'Il giocatore bersaglio perde 2 punti vita e tu guadagni 2 punti vita.\\nTempesta (quando giochi questa magia, copiala una volta per ogni magia giocata prima di questa durante questo turno. Puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per le copie).\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166318&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6999e776-0adf-4b47-b3f2-5b2f76e6cce0\', \'multiverseId\': 166318}, \'multiverseid\': 166318}, {\'name\': \'苦悶の触手\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f84601a-68d0-4650-af85-f804344bdd52\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Gavinhas da Agonia\', \'text\': \'O jogador alvo perde 2 pontos de vida e você ganha 2 pontos de vida.\\nRajada (Quando você jogar esta mágica, faça uma cópia dela para cada mágica jogada antes dela neste turno. Você pode escolher novos alvos para as cópias.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166461&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd11ad13-81ba-4eac-ae4e-62663954a01c\', \'multiverseId\': 166461}, \'multiverseid\': 166461}]', '[{\'name\': \'Remasuri-Oberkommandant\', \'text\': \'{3}: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Remasurikarte, zeige die Karte offen vor und nimm sie auf deine Hand. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.\\n{3}: Übernimm die Kontrolle über einen Remasuri deiner Wahl. (Dieser Effekt endet nicht am Ende des Zuges.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Remasuri, Mutant, Legende\', \'flavor\': \'Das Ende der Evolution.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166096&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab620454-7280-49e7-8529-7b4bb297388a\', \'multiverseId\': 166096}, \'multiverseid\': 166096}, {\'name\': \'Jefe supremo fragmentado\', \'text\': \'{3}: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de Fragmentado, muestra esa carta y ponla en tu mano. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.\\n{3}: Gana el control del Fragmentado objetivo. (Este efecto no termina al final del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Mutante fragmentado legendario\', \'flavor\': \'El fin de la evolución.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166669&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fa18890-dd5b-4f5b-a5cc-b420519f0192\', \'multiverseId\': 166669}, \'multiverseid\': 166669}, {\'name\': \'Suzerain slivoïde\', \'text\': \'{3} : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de slivoïde, révélez cette carte et mettez-la dans votre main. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.\\n{3} : Acquérez le contrôle du slivoïde ciblé. (Cet effet ne cesse pas à la fin du tour.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : slivoïde et mutant et légende\', \'flavor\': "La fin de l\'évolution.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166239&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53681a93-06fd-496d-9c17-31033eb70a30\', \'multiverseId\': 166239}, \'multiverseid\': 166239}, {\'name\': \'Signore Supremo dei Tramutanti\', \'text\': \'{3}: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio, scegli una carta Tramutante, rivela quella carta e aggiungila alla tua mano. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\\n{3}: Prendi il controllo di un Tramutante bersaglio (questo effetto non termina alla fine del turno).\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Leggenda Mutante Tramutante\', \'flavor\': "La fine dell\'evoluzione.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166382&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ba5cbfc-4888-4ccd-b430-cb9e867dd821\', \'multiverseId\': 166382}, \'multiverseid\': 166382}, {\'name\': \'スリヴァーの首領\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad1578d0-174c-473c-b28e-7ec0a159d8df\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Senhor dos Fractius\', \'text\': \'{3}: Procure em seu grimório por um card de Fractius, revele aquele card e coloque-o em sua mão. Depois, embaralhe seu grimório.\\n{3}: Ganhe o controle do Fractius alvo. (Este efeito não cessa no final do turno.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fractius Mutante Lenda\', \'flavor\': \'O fim da evolução.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166525&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ada2fd7-4f09-4ca5-80c9-253e1d0559ab\', \'multiverseId\': 166525}, \'multiverseid\': 166525}]', "[{'name': 'Rudelführer-Status', 'text': 'Die verzauberte Kreatur erhält +2/+2 für jede andere Kreatur im Spiel, mit der sie einen Kreaturentyp teilt.', 'type': 'Kreaturenverzauberung', 'flavor': 'Die besten Anführer werden von ihren Gefolgsleuten gemacht.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166067&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '219106f8-c78a-4b72-b01b-4a24a07e96e0', 'multiverseId': 166067}, 'multiverseid': 166067}, {'name': 'Categoría alfa', 'text': 'La criatura encantada obtiene +2/+2 por cada una de las demás criaturas en juego que compartan un tipo de criatura con ella.', 'type': 'Encantar criatura', 'flavor': 'A los mejores líderes los hacen sus seguidores.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166640&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dbd1eee3-0a47-4b3f-b8f7-9a2f78ffc93c', 'multiverseId': 166640}, 'multiverseid': 166640}, {'name': 'Dominance', 'text': 'La créature enchantée gagne +2/+2 pour chaque autre créature en jeu qui partage un type de créature avec elle.', 'type': 'Enchanter : créature', 'flavor': 'Les meilleurs chefs sont choisis par leurs soldats.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166210&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c2618ad4-767b-423d-9a97-5545a8fdb9ad', 'multiverseId': 166210}, 'multiverseid': 166210}, {'name': 'Esemplare Alpha', 'text': 'La creatura incantata prende +2/+2 per ogni altra creatura in gioco che condivide con essa almeno un tipo di creatura.', 'type': 'Incanta Creatura', 'flavor': 'I migliori condottieri sono designati dai loro seguaci.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166353&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '728016b7-6534-4c7b-b767-961b38bb19f0', 'multiverseId': 166353}, 'multiverseid': 166353}, {'name': '最上位', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9a4994cb-5501-4c73-95f9-d4b49aa6ea3a'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Status de Alfa', 'text': 'A criatura encantada recebe +2/+2 para cada outra criatura em jogo que compartilhar um tipo de criatura com ela.', 'type': 'Encantar Criatura', 'flavor': 'Os melhores líderes são feitos por seus seguidores.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166496&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '18d4103a-98f4-416a-9533-2896e6d0aef7', 'multiverseId': 166496}, 'multiverseid': 166496}]", '[{\'name\': \'Ruf in das Grab\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn des Versorgungssegments jedes Spielers opfert dieser Spieler eine Nicht-Zombiekreatur.\\nSind am Ende eines Zuges keine Kreaturen im Spiel, opfere den Ruf in das Grab.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166015&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c744b370-cb87-4019-9bc9-768f1f170eef\', \'multiverseId\': 166015}, \'multiverseid\': 166015}, {\'name\': \'Llamar a la tumba\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo del mantenimiento de cada jugador, ese jugador sacrifica una criatura que no sea Zombie.\\nAl final del turno, si no hay criaturas en juego, sacrifica el Llamar a la tumba.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166588&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b14e1473-b43e-4193-a6d7-d60b00b8a96a\', \'multiverseId\': 166588}, \'multiverseid\': 166588}, {\'name\': \'Appel à la tombe\', \'text\': "Au début de l\'entretien de chaque joueur, ce joueur sacrifie une créature non-zombie.\\nÀ la fin du tour, s\'il n\'y a pas de créature en jeu, sacrifiez l\'Appel à la tombe.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166158&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08d1d325-c810-4dda-9fbf-84c794965371\', \'multiverseId\': 166158}, \'multiverseid\': 166158}, {\'name\': \'Richiamo del Sepolcro\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del mantenimento di ogni giocatore, quel giocatore sacrifica una creatura non Zombie.\\nAlla fine del turno, se non ci sono creature in gioco, sacrifica il Richiamo del Sepolcro.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166301&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3229ded1-c416-479a-89fd-dd41e83214bf\', \'multiverseId\': 166301}, \'multiverseid\': 166301}, {\'name\': \'墓への呼び声\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cfb7b32-a509-476e-9047-97de89c478d2\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Chamado ao Túmulo\', \'text\': \'No início da manutenção de cada jogador, aquele jogador sacrifica uma criatura que não seja um Zumbi.\\nNo final do turno, se não houver criaturas em jogo, sacrifique Chamado ao Túmulo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166444&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffa07d49-1945-43e5-b084-441c14568725\', \'multiverseId\': 166444}, \'multiverseid\': 166444}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sauberwischen\', \'text\': \'Entferne eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl ganz aus dem Spiel.\\nUmwandlung {3} ({3}, wirf diese Karte aus deiner Hand ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Das Licht der Ahnin wird den Schmutz der Dunkelheit vom Land abscheuern."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165983&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'864ce8e2-d0e6-4081-84a2-291a8762614e\', \'multiverseId\': 165983}, \'multiverseid\': 165983}, {\'name\': \'Limpiar totalmente\', \'text\': \'Remueve del juego el encantamiento objetivo.\\nCiclo {3}. {3}, descartar esta carta de tu mano: Roba una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"La luz de la Antepasada quitará de la tierra la contaminación de las tinieblas".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166556&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'772bc4bd-3ea4-45ba-b501-a8172e781a10\', \'multiverseId\': 166556}, \'multiverseid\': 166556}, {\'name\': \'Assainissement\', \'text\': "Retirez l\'enchantement ciblé de la partie.\\nRecyclage {3} ({3}, défaussez-vous de cette carte de votre main : Piochez une carte.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« La lumière purificatrice de l\'Ancêtre dispersera les ténèbres qui souillent la terre. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166126&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ed5ef26-9dd6-4644-916e-c6dbf7eac4dc\', \'multiverseId\': 166126}, \'multiverseid\': 166126}, {\'name\': \'Piazza Pulita\', \'text\': \'Rimuovi dal gioco un incantesimo bersaglio.\\nCiclo {3} ({3}, Scarta questa carta dalla tua mano: Pesca una carta).\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"La luce dell\\\'Antenata spazzerà via l\\\'infezione dell\\\'oscurità da queste terre".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166269&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bded5295-7ab8-42c1-90f1-839c5d10bff7\', \'multiverseId\': 166269}, \'multiverseid\': 166269}, {\'name\': \'拭い去り\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7e6444a-f952-448f-aa0c-8000ddb38a91\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Limpeza Inexorável\', \'text\': \'Remove de jogo o encantamento alvo.\\nReciclar {3} ({3}, Descarte este card de sua mão: Compre um card.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"A luz da Ancestral purgará desta terra a mácula das trevas."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166412&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1e1a95e-adc1-4c82-a33d-efe64aa23580\', \'multiverseId\': 166412}, \'multiverseid\': 166412}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schauriger Spuk\', \'text\': \'Entferne als zusätzliche Kosten, um den Schaurigen Spuk zu spielen, X Kreaturenkarten aus deinem Friedhof ganz aus dem Spiel.\\nEine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -X/-X bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166017&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'598de9da-01af-49d1-ae2b-8f5eaf92dcdb\', \'multiverseId\': 166017}, \'multiverseid\': 166017}, {\'name\': \'Acoso escalofriante\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para jugar el Acoso escalofriante, remueve del juego X cartas de criatura de tu cementerio.\\nLa criatura objetivo obtiene -X/-X hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166590&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'236e43f6-f8e9-4f12-a23a-b4380b1dd13f\', \'multiverseId\': 166590}, \'multiverseid\': 166590}, {\'name\': \'Hantise glaciale\', \'text\': "En tant que coût supplémentaire pour jouer la Hantise glaciale, retirez de la partie X cartes de créature de votre cimetière.\\nLa créature ciblée gagne -X/-X jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166160&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1bfc768-c6c0-49e0-95c3-1dc3bf859fd9\', \'multiverseId\': 166160}, \'multiverseid\': 166160}, {\'name\': \'Presenza Raggelante\', \'text\': \'Come costo addizionale per giocare la Presenza Raggelante, rimuovi dal gioco X carte creatura presenti nel tuo cimitero.\\nLa creatura bersaglio prende -X/-X fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166303&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0619ef45-6bca-4c9d-a3a6-652f2f36ebce\', \'multiverseId\': 166303}, \'multiverseid\': 166303}, {\'name\': \'つきまとう寒け\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4453f76e-a50d-4360-a6c8-ab77e7a74eba\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Calafrio de Pavor\', \'text\': \'Como um custo adicional para jogar Calafrio de Pavor, remova de jogo X cards de criatura de seu cemitério.\\nA criatura alvo recebe -X/-X até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166446&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79436a8d-e0f1-49d8-ba14-22ee2a7faf12\', \'multiverseId\': 166446}, \'multiverseid\': 166446}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schwefeliger Strudel\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn des Versorgungssegments jedes Spielers fügt der Schwefelige Strudel diesem Spieler 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\\nFalls ein Spieler Lebenspunkte dazu erhalten würde, erhält er stattdessen keine Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166063&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de5911a1-f10c-46a0-8991-ef01995be400\', \'multiverseId\': 166063}, \'multiverseid\': 166063}, {\'name\': \'Vórtice sulfúrico\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo del mantenimiento de cada jugador, el Vórtex sulfúrico hace 2 puntos de daño a ese jugador.\\nSi un jugador fuera a ganar vida, en vez de eso, ese jugador no gana vida.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166636&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce64a6a6-de06-4f21-91f8-8aafaa628d73\', \'multiverseId\': 166636}, \'multiverseid\': 166636}, {\'name\': \'Vortex sulfureux\', \'text\': "Au début de l\'entretien de chaque joueur, le Vortex sulfureux inflige 2 blessures à ce joueur.\\nSi un joueur devait gagner des points de vie, ce joueur n\'en gagne aucun à la place.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166206&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'672539c1-8337-4386-bb89-b65dffa403b6\', \'multiverseId\': 166206}, \'multiverseid\': 166206}, {\'name\': \'Vortice Sulfureo\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del mantenimento di ogni giocatore, il Vortice Sulfureo infligge 2 danni a quel giocatore.\\nSe un giocatore guadagna dei punti vita, invece quel giocatore non guadagna alcun punto vita.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166349&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d910456-bde1-4e5e-b8be-49b3f671acce\', \'multiverseId\': 166349}, \'multiverseid\': 166349}, {\'name\': \'硫黄の渦\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24ca3fb9-7808-44ea-b850-6dd9f93c731c\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Vórtice Sulfúrico\', \'text\': \'No início da manutenção de cada jogador, Vótice Sulfúrico causa 2 pontos de dano àquele jogador.\\nSe um jogador fosse ganhar pontos de vida, aquele jogador deixa de ganhá-los.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166492&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61dbbfa1-dd96-4035-9172-22bb590baaf3\', \'multiverseId\': 166492}, \'multiverseid\': 166492}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schädelanzapfen\', \'text\': \'Opfere eine Kreatur als zusätzliche Kosten, um Schädelanzapfen zu spielen.\\nZiehe zwei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Ah, endlich hat dein Kopf irgendeinen Nutzen." —Braids, Wahnwitzbeschwörerin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166030&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b97634b2-3815-4766-b866-6feab4c222b1\', \'multiverseId\': 166030}, \'multiverseid\': 166030}, {\'name\': \'Sacar del cráneo\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para jugar el Sacar del cráneo, sacrifica una criatura.\\nRoba dos cartas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Al fin, un uso para esa cabeza tuya". Trenzas, invocadora de demencia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166603&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29e7586b-e669-4031-b3ca-6866fe6a6556\', \'multiverseId\': 166603}, \'multiverseid\': 166603}, {\'name\': \'Frappe-crâne\', \'text\': \'En tant que coût supplémentaire pour jouer le Frappe-crâne, sacrifiez une créature.\\nPiochez deux cartes.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Ta tête va enfin servir à quelque chose. » — Nattes, invocatrice de démences.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166173&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38e83bcf-3c18-43eb-b32c-50bffdac57b1\', \'multiverseId\': 166173}, \'multiverseid\': 166173}, {\'name\': \'Svuotacranio\', \'text\': \'Come costo addizionale per giocare lo Svuotacranio, sacrifica una creatura.\\nPesca due carte.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Finalmente, un uso per quella tua dannata testa". —Braids, evocatore di dementia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166316&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94444367-f250-4cd4-94a5-0a4f1eb63356\', \'multiverseId\': 166316}, \'multiverseid\': 166316}, {\'name\': \'頭叩き\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfb0d7f5-cb16-462f-983d-dc3d61700453\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Drenar Crânio\', \'text\': \'Como um custo adicional para jogar Drenar Crânio, sacrifique uma criatura.\\nCompre dois cards.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Até que enfim, uma utilidade para essa tua cabeça." —Braids, invocadora da demência\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166459&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'422d707c-1cf3-4343-82dc-bd39a311b83f\', \'multiverseId\': 166459}, \'multiverseid\': 166459}]', '[{\'name\': \'Seelensammler\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur, der in diesem Zug Schaden durch den Seelensammler zugefügt wurde, auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, bringe diese Karte unter deiner Kontrolle zurück ins Spiel.\\nMorph {B}{B}{B} (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur spielen. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Morph-Kosten auf.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166031&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c87de9a2-c753-43f6-8d01-28bcb5532b12\', \'multiverseId\': 166031}, \'multiverseid\': 166031}, {\'name\': \'Coleccionista de almas\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que una criatura que reciba daño de la Coleccionista de almas este turno vaya a un cementerio, regresa al juego esa carta bajo tu control.\\nMetamorfosis {B}{B}{B}.(Puedes jugar esta carta boca abajo como una criatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Ponla boca arriba en cualquier momento pagando su coste de metamorfosis.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166604&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c03ba0f-f9c5-4e0e-a937-ed36a5eca7fb\', \'multiverseId\': 166604}, \'multiverseid\': 166604}, {\'name\': "Collecteur d\'âmes", \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature ayant subi ce tour-ci des blessures du Collecteur d\'âmes est mise dans un cimetière, renvoyez cette carte en jeu sous votre contrôle.\\nMue {B}{B}{B} (Vous pouvez jouer cette carte face cachée comme une créature 2/2 pour {3}. Retournez-la quand vous le désirez pour son coût de mue.)", \'type\': \'Créature : vampire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166174&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd696576-06fb-4c28-8c2d-114ad913ee10\', \'multiverseId\': 166174}, \'multiverseid\': 166174}, {\'name\': \'Collezionista di Anime\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura a cui è stato inflitto danno dal Collezionista di Anime in questo turno viene messa in un cimitero, rimetti in gioco quella carta sotto il tuo controllo.\\nMetamorfosi {B}{B}{B} (puoi giocare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di metamorfosi.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166317&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'752a9bb1-8d5a-4a52-a05c-d995f6710204\', \'multiverseId\': 166317}, \'multiverseid\': 166317}, {\'name\': \'魂の収集家\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67c891ea-4b63-4d3e-8ddc-ad7e20ea7702\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Colecionador de Almas\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que uma criatura que sofreu dano causado pelo Colecionador de Almas for colocada num cemitério, devolva aquele card para o jogo sob seu controle.\\nMetamorfose {B}{B}{B} (Você pode baixar este card com a face voltada para baixo como uma criatura 2/2 por {3}. Volte sua face para cima a qualquer momento pagando seu custo de metamorfose.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166460&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b391d07-aa91-480b-a7bb-feb76d1ed13e\', \'multiverseId\': 166460}, \'multiverseid\': 166460}]', '[{\'name\': \'Silberner Ritter\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag, Schutz vor Rot\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Ritter\', \'flavor\': \'Er ist Otarias letzter Verteidiger gegen die Wellen des Chaos, die es zu überfluten drohen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165980&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81882cce-c59d-4c6b-8cd8-3d48f0e72885\', \'multiverseId\': 165980}, \'multiverseid\': 165980}, {\'name\': \'Caballero plateado\', \'text\': \'Daña primero, protección contra rojo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero\', \'flavor\': \'Es la última defensa de Otaria contra la oleada de caos que amenaza con envolverla.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166553&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f2d7a52-d7b6-4cf7-ab92-f064ce9d3964\', \'multiverseId\': 166553}, \'multiverseid\': 166553}, {\'name\': \'Chevalier argenté\', \'text\': \'Initiative, protection contre le rouge\', \'type\': \'Créature : chevalier\', \'flavor\': "Il était la dernière défense d\'Otaria, face à la vague de chaos qui menace de l\'engloutir.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166123&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8847d517-65c4-45f3-ad05-9f0152d16736\', \'multiverseId\': 166123}, \'multiverseid\': 166123}, {\'name\': "Cavaliere d\'Argento", \'text\': \'Attacco improvviso, protezione dal rosso\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere\', \'flavor\': "L\'ultima difesa di Otaria contro l\'ondata di caos che minaccia di sommergerla.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166266&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa436049-4704-41ba-a2de-66a94df980c6\', \'multiverseId\': 166266}, \'multiverseid\': 166266}, {\'name\': \'銀騎士\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83aae43e-4cea-4d8b-b44e-fdbc160feba2\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Cavaleiro Prateado\', \'text\': \'Iniciativa, proteção contra o vermelho\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Cavaleiro\', \'flavor\': \'A última defesa de Otaria contra a onda de caos que ameaça engoli-la.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166409&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'787eea1f-f573-48e8-92d6-ee13b1d9c5f6\', \'multiverseId\': 166409}, \'multiverseid\': 166409}]', "[{'name': 'Skirk-Vulkanologe', 'text': 'Morph Opfere zwei Gebirge. (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur spielen. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Morph-Kosten auf.)\\nWenn der Skirk-Vulkanist aufgedeckt wird, fügt er 3 Schadenspunkte zu, deren Verteilung auf eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen deiner Wahl du bestimmst.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Goblin', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166061&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c1ae2f58-ad06-4d40-81f7-73ce15827f26', 'multiverseId': 166061}, 'multiverseid': 166061}, {'name': 'Vulcanista de Skirk', 'text': 'Metamorfosis - Sacrificar dos montañas. (Puedes jugar esta carta boca abajo como una criatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Ponla boca arriba en cualquier momento pagando su coste de metamorfosis.)\\nCuando el Vulcanista de Skirk se ponga boca arriba, hace 3 puntos de daño divididos como elijas entre cualquier número de criaturas objetivo.', 'type': 'Criatura — Trasgo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166634&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '50f7ac65-0986-4963-b2a5-05e37e73fc60', 'multiverseId': 166634}, 'multiverseid': 166634}, {'name': 'Volcaniste skirkien', 'text': 'Mue—Sacrifiez deux montagnes. (Vous pouvez jouer cette carte face cachée comme une créature 2/2 pour {3}. Retournez-la quand vous le désirez pour son coût de mue.)\\nQuand le Volcaniste skirkien est retourné face visible, il inflige 3 blessures réparties de la manière que vous choisissez entre un nombre quelconque de créatures ciblées.', 'type': 'Créature : gobelin', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166204&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b2818495-36cb-4587-9abd-cedbad6f1981', 'multiverseId': 166204}, 'multiverseid': 166204}, {'name': 'Vulcanologo di Skirk', 'text': 'Metamorfosi—Sacrifica due montagne (puoi giocare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di metamorfosi.)\\nQuando il Vulcanologo di Skirk viene girato a faccia in su, infligge 3 danni suddivisi come preferisci tra un qualsiasi numero di creature bersaglio.', 'type': 'Creatura — Goblin', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166347&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'de7fba64-1bbb-4c81-ab94-9defc5a350e4', 'multiverseId': 166347}, 'multiverseid': 166347}, {'name': 'スカークの火山使い', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8c48f198-b464-49f9-ae6b-fbd649210517'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Vulcanólogo de Skirk', 'text': 'Metamorfose—Sacrifique duas montanhas. (Você pode baixar este card com a face voltada para baixo como uma criatura 2/2 por {3}. Volte sua face para cima a qualquer momento pagando seu custo de metamorfose.)\\nQuando a face de Vulcanólogo de Skirk for voltada para cima, ele causa 3 pontos de dano divididos como você quiser dentre um número qualquer de criaturas alvo.', 'type': 'Criatura — Goblin', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166490&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '15d65974-a2c4-41ef-b5e6-0561edea1ea1', 'multiverseId': 166490}, 'multiverseid': 166490}]", "[{'name': 'Sprießende Ranken', 'text': 'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einem Standardland, zeige die Karte offen vor und nimm sie in deine Hand. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.\\nSturm (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch spielst, kopiere ihn einmal für jeden Zauberspruch, der in diesem Zug bereits gespielt wurde.)', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166085&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3ddea7be-4d27-4586-979e-99a1f0385876', 'multiverseId': 166085}, 'multiverseid': 166085}, {'name': 'Parra germinante', 'text': 'Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, muestra esa carta y ponla en tu mano. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.\\nTormenta (Cuando juegues este hechizo, cópialo por cada hechizo jugado antes que él en este turno.)', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166658&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '056312ea-8870-47bb-a9f9-effabd64d0ca', 'multiverseId': 166658}, 'multiverseid': 166658}, {'name': 'Vignes bourgeonnantes', 'text': 'Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, révélez cette carte et mettez-la dans votre main. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.\\nDéluge (Quand vous jouez ce sort, copiez-le pour chaque sort joué avant lui ce tour-ci.)', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166228&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b0db93bb-e997-406c-9840-d950940150fe', 'multiverseId': 166228}, 'multiverseid': 166228}, {'name': 'Viticci Germoglianti', 'text': 'Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, rivela quella carta e aggiungila alla tua mano. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\\nTempesta (quando giochi questa magia, copiala una volta per ogni magia giocata prima di questa durante questo turno).', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166371&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0641bc51-a78c-409c-bf5c-cd93e4da693e', 'multiverseId': 166371}, 'multiverseid': 166371}, {'name': '芽吹くツタ', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '17cd5f4e-4171-41b4-a92e-aa93c5a581ad'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Vinhas em Germinação', 'text': 'Procure em seu grimório por um card de terreno básico, revele aquele card e coloque-o em sua mão. Depois, embaralhe seu grimório.\\nRajada (Quando você jogar esta mágica, faça uma cópia dela para cada mágica jogada antes dela neste turno.)', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166514&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7a201ab1-e549-483f-b206-5a2168cf459d', 'multiverseId': 166514}, 'multiverseid': 166514}]", "[{'name': 'Springflut-Überlebender', 'text': 'Morph {1}{U}{U} (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur spielen. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Morph-Kosten auf.)\\nWenn der Springflut-Überlebende aufgedeckt wird, wirf zwei Karten aus deiner Hand ab und ziehe dann drei Karten.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Zauberer', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166005&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '750ee537-33fa-4b62-a54d-493edb1c7686', 'multiverseId': 166005}, 'multiverseid': 166005}, {'name': 'Sobreviviente del Proyecto Resaca', 'text': 'Metamorfosis {1}{U}{U}. (Puedes jugar esta carta boca abajo como una criatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Ponla boca arriba en cualquier momento pagando su coste de metamorfosis.)\\nCuando el Sobreviviente del Proyecto Resaca se ponga boca arriba, descarta dos cartas de tu mano, luego roba tres cartas.', 'type': 'Criatura — Hechicero', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166578&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd937a785-201a-43e2-9f2d-15e88b1fe2fd', 'multiverseId': 166578}, 'multiverseid': 166578}, {'name': 'Rescapé du projet Jusant', 'text': 'Mue {1}{U}{U} (Vous pouvez jouer cette carte face cachée comme une créature 2/2 pour {3}. Retournez-la quand vous le désirez pour son coût de mue.)\\nQuand le Rescapé du projet Jusant est retourné face visible, défaussez-vous de deux cartes de votre main, et piochez ensuite trois cartes.', 'type': 'Créature : sorcier', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166148&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4bd23ad4-d201-48d0-9818-b5fa243e7077', 'multiverseId': 166148}, 'multiverseid': 166148}, {'name': 'Sopravvissuto della Marea', 'text': 'Metamorfosi {1}{U}{U} (puoi giocare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di metamorfosi.)\\nQuando il Sopravvissuto della Marea viene girato a faccia in su, scarta due carte dalla tua mano, poi pesca tre carte.', 'type': 'Creatura — Mago', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166291&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '78d743bf-ec40-4bfd-993d-dfadecb3c1dd', 'multiverseId': 166291}, 'multiverseid': 166291}, {'name': '激浪計画の生き残り', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '51284898-beb0-4d23-9949-7a8fdef6a2ed'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Sobrevivente da Rebentação', 'text': 'Metamorfose {1}{U}{U} (Você pode baixar este card com a face voltada para baixo como uma criatura 2/2 por {3}. Volte sua face para cima a qualquer momento pagando seu custo de metamorfose.)\\nQuando a face de Sobrevivente da Rebentação for voltada para cima, descarte dois cards de sua mão e depois compre três cards.', 'type': 'Criatura — Mago', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166434&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f58fe44f-4015-4570-8a8b-c7c80fb89066', 'multiverseId': 166434}, 'multiverseid': 166434}]", '[{\'name\': \'Spöttischer Egozentriker\', \'text\': \'Morph {U} (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur spielen. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Morph-Kosten auf.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Einst war ich Mensch. Jetzt bin ich weitaus mehr."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166007&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58e735ee-1fcd-447b-8421-c75187548952\', \'multiverseId\': 166007}, \'multiverseid\': 166007}, {\'name\': \'Egotista desdeñoso\', \'text\': \'Metamorfosis {U}.(Puedes jugar esta carta boca abajo como una criatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Ponla boca arriba en cualquier momento pagando su coste de metamorfosis.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero\', \'flavor\': \'"Una vez fui humano. Ahora soy mucho más".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166580&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abcf2245-391e-442f-a84a-2bfe0facd565\', \'multiverseId\': 166580}, \'multiverseid\': 166580}, {\'name\': \'Égotiste dédaigneux\', \'text\': \'Mue {U} (Vous pouvez jouer cette carte face cachée comme une créature 2/2 pour {3}. Retournez-la quand vous le désirez pour son coût de mue.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« J\'ai été humain, autrefois. Je suis devenu bien plus à présent. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166150&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ddd7a100-1ac2-4d3c-84ee-c2671a297aee\', \'multiverseId\': 166150}, \'multiverseid\': 166150}, {\'name\': \'Egoista Sprezzante\', \'text\': \'Metamorfosi {U} (puoi giocare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di metamorfosi.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Un tempo ero umano. Adesso sono molto di più".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166293&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfa58dea-3c25-40c1-b496-a9395f59a72a\', \'multiverseId\': 166293}, \'multiverseid\': 166293}, {\'name\': \'軽蔑する利己主義者\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'013e00c0-00c5-4a4d-a592-5b53f8dc1ee7\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Egotista Desdenhoso\', \'text\': \'Metamorfose {U} (Você pode baixar este card com a face voltada para baixo como uma criatura 2/2 por {3}. Volte sua face para cima a qualquer momento pagando seu custo de metamorfose.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Já fui humano. Agora sou muito mais."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166436&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cef10670-0222-4cbf-9502-056bb832855e\', \'multiverseId\': 166436}, \'multiverseid\': 166436}]', '[{\'name\': \'Stabilisator\', \'text\': \'Spieler können keine Karten umwandeln.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Halt den Gedanken mal fest." —Pemmin, Überlebender des Springflutprojekts\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166099&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'738f17f5-2d58-40da-b6de-d8e76a32c097\', \'multiverseId\': 166099}, \'multiverseid\': 166099}, {\'name\': \'Estabilizador\', \'text\': \'Los jugadores no pueden usar la habilidad de ciclo de las cartas.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Aguanta esa idea". Pemmin, sobreviviente del Proyecto Resaca\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166672&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2cd3811-e476-4fa4-9be0-a5eccfea46e6\', \'multiverseId\': 166672}, \'multiverseid\': 166672}, {\'name\': \'Stabilisateur\', \'text\': \'Les joueurs ne peuvent pas recycler de cartes.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'« Ne perdez pas cette idée. » —Pemmin, rescapé du projet Jusant\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166242&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7843879c-f8b9-41e5-b67c-666a7dc4c52c\', \'multiverseId\': 166242}, \'multiverseid\': 166242}, {\'name\': \'Stabilizzatore\', \'text\': "I giocatori non possono usare l\'abilità ciclo delle carte.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Conserva quell\\\'idea". —Pemmin, sopravvissuto della Marea\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166385&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5e8992a-4233-40b0-8a19-c430c5945aaf\', \'multiverseId\': 166385}, \'multiverseid\': 166385}, {\'name\': \'波停機\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ff5817b-9c63-4d1b-93cd-bbb566b20152\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Estabilizador\', \'text\': \'Os jogadores não podem reciclar cards.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Guarde esta idéia." —Pemmin, sobrevivente da Rebentação\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166528&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'767f75b0-be93-43fc-88c2-1b07b95316bf\', \'multiverseId\': 166528}, \'multiverseid\': 166528}]', '[{\'name\': \'Steinaltes Schlammwesen\', \'text\': \'Stärke und Widerstandskraft des Steinalten Schlammwesens sind jeweils gleich der gesamten umgewandelten Manakosten aller anderen Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Schlammwesen\', \'flavor\': \'Schlamm hat es schon immer gegeben. Schlamm wird es immer geben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166069&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb27f785-fe70-4406-82d8-68557fc8555c\', \'multiverseId\': 166069}, \'multiverseid\': 166069}, {\'name\': \'Cieno antiguo\', \'text\': \'Tanto la fuerza como la resistencia del Cieno antiguo son iguales al coste total de maná convertido de las demás criaturas que controles.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Cieno\', \'flavor\': \'El cieno siempre ha sido. El cieno siempre será.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166642&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a1dca3b-597e-4ece-b822-0b6ac203d436\', \'multiverseId\': 166642}, \'multiverseid\': 166642}, {\'name\': \'Limon ancien\', \'text\': "La force et l\'endurance du Limon ancien sont chacune égale à la somme des coûts convertis de mana des autres créatures que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature : limon\', \'flavor\': \'Le limon a toujours été. Le limon sera toujours.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166212&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5d891d6-909a-43d0-8cbd-cc7418676ab1\', \'multiverseId\': 166212}, \'multiverseid\': 166212}, {\'name\': \'Melma Antica\', \'text\': \'La forza e la costituzione della Melma Antica sono pari ciascuna al costo di mana convertito totale delle altre creature che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Melma\', \'flavor\': "La melma c\'è da sempre. La melma ci sarà sempre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166355&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71b0a22a-e76a-4eb7-a40c-9c84151a0cdc\', \'multiverseId\': 166355}, \'multiverseid\': 166355}, {\'name\': \'古代の軟泥\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f86769c-e1f9-4c2f-bcc0-45557f5f80fd\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Lodo Antigo\', \'text\': \'O poder e a resistência de Lodo Antigo são ambos iguais à soma dos custos de mana convertidos das outras criaturas que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lodo\', \'flavor\': \'O lodo sempre foi. O lodo sempre será.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166498&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed542af6-a9f7-434d-bf0e-63de113b048e\', \'multiverseId\': 166498}, \'multiverseid\': 166498}]', '[{\'name\': \'Strandpatrouille\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nInselumwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte aus deiner Hand ab: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Inselkarte, zeige diese Karte offen vor und nimm sie auf deine Hand. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166008&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a8d010b-bb6b-4849-93ce-3e4cb389dd03\', \'multiverseId\': 166008}, \'multiverseid\': 166008}, {\'name\': \'Explorador costero\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCiclo de isla {2}.({2}, descartar esta carta de tu mano: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de isla, muéstrala y ponla en tu mano. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado ave\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166581&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4826768f-746f-4f30-9fcc-c81cbeb471e2\', \'multiverseId\': 166581}, \'multiverseid\': 166581}, {\'name\': \'Ranger des côtes\', \'text\': "Vol\\nRecyclage d\'île {2} ({2}, Défaussez-vous de cette carte depuis votre main : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte d\'île, révélez-la, et ajoutez-la à votre main. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.)", \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166151&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc0b1a5a-ca10-4747-b669-840a71d7a87b\', \'multiverseId\': 166151}, \'multiverseid\': 166151}, {\'name\': \'Ranger della Costa\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nCicloisola {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta dalla tua mano: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio, scegli una carta isola, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Uccello\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166294&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82946a59-e641-41e5-bb29-a5b73d481265\', \'multiverseId\': 166294}, \'multiverseid\': 166294}, {\'name\': \'海辺のレインジャー\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48e643dd-5ed6-408b-a672-703e94c0b2f1\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Batedor da Orla\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nReciclar Ilha {2} ({2}, Descarte este card de sua mão: Procure em seu grimório por um card de ilha, revele-o e coloque-o em sua mão. Depois, embaralhe seu grimório.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado Pássaro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166437&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4eb4e4c3-e00c-4ad5-b6ff-cf1d64a13540\', \'multiverseId\': 166437}, \'multiverseid\': 166437}]', "[{'name': 'Streuschuss', 'text': 'Der Streuschuss fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\\nSturm (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch spielst, kopiere ihn einmal für jeden Zauberspruch, der in diesem Zug bereits gespielt wurde. Du kannst andere Ziele für diese Kopien bestimmen.)', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166059&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8857f1b2-f237-4418-980f-85a40771af62', 'multiverseId': 166059}, 'multiverseid': 166059}, {'name': 'Disparo aislado', 'text': 'El Disparo aislado hace 1 punto de daño a la criatura objetivo.\\nTormenta (Cuando juegues este hechizo, cópialo por cada hechizo jugado antes que él en este turno. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para las copias.)', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166632&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1cf3e2ad-29da-45db-848f-e297931dfcc3', 'multiverseId': 166632}, 'multiverseid': 166632}, {'name': 'Tir en pluie', 'text': 'Le Tir en pluie inflige 1 blessure à la créature ciblée.\\nDéluge (Quand vous jouez ce sort, copiez-le pour chaque sort joué avant lui ce tour-ci. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour chaque copie.)', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166202&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7b898352-3b44-45e6-85c4-396268df537a', 'multiverseId': 166202}, 'multiverseid': 166202}, {'name': 'Colpo Frantumante', 'text': 'Il Colpo Frantumante infligge 1 danno a una creatura bersaglio.\\nTempesta (quando giochi questa magia, copiala una volta per ogni magia giocata prima di questa durante questo turno. Puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per le copie).', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166345&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9cb99291-9ceb-4dc2-8045-bccc84972726', 'multiverseId': 166345}, 'multiverseid': 166345}, {'name': '乱射', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7c387ee6-c7a4-4b9c-84e1-54b4b3631f61'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Tiro Dispersor', 'text': 'Tiro Dispersor causa 1 ponto de dano à criatura alvo.\\nRajada (Quando você jogar esta mágica, faça uma cópia dela para cada mágica jogada antes dela neste turno. Você pode escolher novos alvos para as cópias.)', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166488&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '01c39044-040e-4206-ac52-bd61d0cb02ed', 'multiverseId': 166488}, 'multiverseid': 166488}]", '[{\'name\': \'Streuungsschild\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl, falls seine umgewandelten Manakosten höchstens so groß sind wie die höchsten umgewandelten Manakosten unter den bleibenden Karten, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Vielleicht beim nächsten Mal."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165990&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ba71008-af5c-4099-946d-e4121744a735\', \'multiverseId\': 165990}, \'multiverseid\': 165990}, {\'name\': \'Escudo de dispersión\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo si su coste de maná convertido es igual o menor que el coste de maná convertido más alto que haya entre los permanentes que controles.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Quizá la próxima vez".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166563&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'414a0b27-8087-44a4-9d6d-3eb6ddf9a875\', \'multiverseId\': 166563}, \'multiverseid\': 166563}, {\'name\': \'Bouclier de dispersion\', \'text\': \'Contrez le sort ciblé si son coût converti de mana est inférieur ou égal au coût converti de mana le plus élevé parmi les permanents que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Une autre fois, peut-être. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166133&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e90f6e3b-691b-4aa1-9c17-d2f505e13319\', \'multiverseId\': 166133}, \'multiverseid\': 166133}, {\'name\': \'Scudo della Dispersione\', \'text\': \'Neutralizza una magia bersaglio se il suo costo di mana convertito è pari o inferiore al più alto costo di mana convertito tra i permanenti che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Magari la prossima volta".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166276&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6b149f5-3cf4-408a-bb3a-84ec99b78d0d\', \'multiverseId\': 166276}, \'multiverseid\': 166276}, {\'name\': \'分散の盾\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7ee45af-1456-4351-b451-695dd7098036\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Escudo Dispersor\', \'text\': \'Anula a mágica alvo se seu custo de mana convertido for menor ou igual ao maior custo de mana convertido dentre as permanentes que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Quem sabe, para a próxima vez."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166419&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b254ac27-f1cc-4973-b909-53c3abaa7e2e\', \'multiverseId\': 166419}, \'multiverseid\': 166419}]', "[{'name': 'Tag der Drachen', 'text': 'Entferne alle Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, ganz aus dem Spiel, wenn der Tag der Drachen ins Spiel kommt. Bringe dann ebenso viele 5/5 rote Drachen-Spielsteine mit Flugfähigkeit ins Spiel.\\nWenn der Tag der Drachen das Spiel verlässt, opfere alle Drachen, die du kontrollierst. Bringe dann die so ganz aus dem Spiel entfernten Karten unter deiner Kontrolle wieder ins Spiel zurück.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165988&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5be920f8-a1f4-4598-bf2f-066c8fd16bff', 'multiverseId': 165988}, 'multiverseid': 165988}, {'name': 'Día de los dragones', 'text': 'Cuando el Día de los dragones entre en juego, remueve del juego todas las criaturas que controles. Luego pon en juego ese número de fichas de criatura Dragón roja 5/5 con la habilidad de volar.\\nCuando el Día de los dragones salga del juego, sacrifica todos los Dragones que controles. Luego regresa al juego las cartas removidas bajo tu control.', 'type': 'Encantamiento', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166561&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '37f446f2-0abc-4220-922f-15aa1ce157c1', 'multiverseId': 166561}, 'multiverseid': 166561}, {'name': 'Jour des dragons', 'text': 'Quand le Jour des dragons arrive en jeu, retirez de la partie toutes les créatures que vous contrôlez. Mettez ensuite en jeu autant de jetons de créature 5/5 rouge Dragon avec le vol.\\nQuand le Jour des dragons quitte le jeu, sacrifiez tous les dragons que vous contrôlez. Renvoyez ensuite les cartes retirées en jeu, sous votre contrôle.', 'type': 'Enchantement', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166131&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bd7aa5fe-c370-4099-ad80-9b37c9010b0a', 'multiverseId': 166131}, 'multiverseid': 166131}, {'name': 'Il Giorno dei Draghi', 'text': 'Quando Il Giorno dei Draghi entra in gioco, rimuovi dal gioco tutte le creature che controlli. Poi metti in gioco altrettante pedine creatura Drago 5/5 rosse con volare.\\nQuando il Giorno dei Draghi lascia il gioco, sacrifica tutti i Draghi che controlli. Poi rimetti in gioco sotto il tuo controllo le carte rimosse.', 'type': 'Incantesimo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166274&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6f8793b9-dd69-496b-9dd5-40158d5bbbf1', 'multiverseId': 166274}, 'multiverseid': 166274}, {'name': 'ドラゴンの日', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '15d95738-8fbd-4652-a237-7096978b09ba'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Dia dos Dragões', 'text': 'Quando Dia dos Dragões entrar em jogo, remova de jogo todas as criaturas que você controla. Depois, coloque em jogo aquela quantidade de fichas de criatura vermelha 5/5, com a habilidade de voar, do tipo Dragão.\\nQuando Dia dos Dragões sair de jogo, sacrifique todos os Dragões que você controla. Depois, devolva todos os cards removidos para o jogo sob seu controle.', 'type': 'Encantamento', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166417&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '25f59bf1-0c6a-417c-b618-f2529eb50d23', 'multiverseId': 166417}, 'multiverseid': 166417}]", '[{\'name\': \'Tempel der falschen Göttin\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {2}. Spiele diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du fünf oder mehr Länder kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Die, die nichts zum Tempel bringen, nehmen auch nichts fort.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166100&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f24d4e5-2c66-4c70-8715-cdcf7a1928f5\', \'multiverseId\': 166100}, \'multiverseid\': 166100}, {\'name\': \'Templo de la diosa falsa\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {2} a tu reserva de maná. Juega esta habilidad sólo si controlas cinco o más tierras.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Aquéllos que no traen nada al templo, no se llevan nada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166673&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de80a077-7993-4bce-bc69-b4c2e404936e\', \'multiverseId\': 166673}, \'multiverseid\': 166673}, {\'name\': \'Temple de la fausse divinité\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {2} à votre réserve. Ne jouez cette capacité que si vous contrôlez au moins cinq terrains.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Ceux qui n\'apportent rien au temple ne remportent rien avec eux.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166243&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b26b16e9-96a3-453f-84e5-d3aafe77a831\', \'multiverseId\': 166243}, \'multiverseid\': 166243}, {\'name\': \'Tempio del Dio Fasullo\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {2} alla tua riserva di mana. Gioca questa abilità solo se controlli almeno cinque terre.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Coloro che non portano niente al tempio non ricevono nulla da esso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166386&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a5f606b-6fcf-46b3-af71-0c00eb3c032f\', \'multiverseId\': 166386}, \'multiverseid\': 166386}, {\'name\': \'邪神の寺\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1780fc9-a9b5-4b27-bed5-5eab10af9434\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Templo do Falso Deus\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adiciona {2} à sua reserva de mana. Use esta habilidade somente se você controlar cinco ou mais terrenos.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Os que nada levam ao templo, nada levam do templo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166529&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79345e74-bb01-47b2-beca-a2deacf59ca2\', \'multiverseId\': 166529}, \'multiverseid\': 166529}]', '[{\'name\': \'Titanischer Bulvox\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nMorph {4}{G}{G}{G} (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur spielen. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Morph-Kosten auf.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn Naturgesetze nicht mehr gelten, regiert das Übermaß.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166086&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fe900eb-d273-40f1-9041-c0be69434934\', \'multiverseId\': 166086}, \'multiverseid\': 166086}, {\'name\': \'Búlvox titánico\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nMetamorfosis {4}{G}{G}{G}.(Puedes jugar esta carta boca abajo como una criatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Ponla boca arriba en cualquier momento pagando su coste de metamorfosis.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'Con el abandono de las leyes naturales, el exceso prospera.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166659&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a0c3557-1ca2-4972-b664-eab0e22ea540\', \'multiverseId\': 166659}, \'multiverseid\': 166659}, {\'name\': \'Bulvox titanesque\', \'text\': \'Piétinement\\nMue {4}{G}{G}{G} (Vous pouvez jouer cette carte face cachée comme une créature 2/2 pour {3}. Retournez-la quand vous le désirez pour son coût de mue.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': "Une fois délaissées les lois de la nature, l\'excès prit le dessus.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166229&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73772917-21c2-4d37-a272-ff6ec1201094\', \'multiverseId\': 166229}, \'multiverseid\': 166229}, {\'name\': \'Torobue Titanico\', \'text\': \'Travolgere\\nMetamorfosi {4}{G}{G}{G} (puoi giocare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di metamorfosi.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'Una volta abbandonate le leggi della natura, gli eccessi hanno proliferato.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166372&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30a265c6-6e93-4dcc-85f1-98dff78a9c2b\', \'multiverseId\': 166372}, \'multiverseid\': 166372}, {\'name\': \'剛力のブルヴァックス\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b16b57e-ac40-4a60-9ed3-05119af8494e\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Bôifalo Titânico\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nMetamorfose {4}{G}{G}{G} (Você pode baixar este card com a face voltada para baixo como uma criatura 2/2 por {3}. Volte sua face para cima a qualquer momento pagando seu custo de metamorfose.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Besta\', \'flavor\': \'Com o abandono das leis naturais, o excesso prospera.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166515&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04744edb-aca2-4b3d-afe6-165c78343f6a\', \'multiverseId\': 166515}, \'multiverseid\': 166515}]', '[{\'name\': \'Totenkopf-Bussard\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Totenkopf-Bussard aus dem Spiel auf den Friedhof gelegt wird, erhalten alle Kreaturen -1/-1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel\', \'flavor\': \'Das Gefieder voller Ungeziefer und immer hungrig stürzt er sich vom Nachthimmel auf seine Opfer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166020&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b14f2aa0-ab9e-4fc0-b54d-66c5d30f07dc\', \'multiverseId\': 166020}, \'multiverseid\': 166020}, {\'name\': \'Aura calavera\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Aura calavera vaya a un cementerio desde el juego, todas las criaturas obtienen -1/-1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave\', \'flavor\': \'Infestada de alimañas, siempre hambrienta, lanzándose desde el cielo nocturno.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166593&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c69201ae-3b02-4820-8978-455180b64e75\', \'multiverseId\': 166593}, \'multiverseid\': 166593}, {\'name\': \'Buse tête de mort\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand la Buse tête de mort est mise dans un cimetière depuis le jeu, toutes les créatures gagnent -1/-1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau\', \'flavor\': \'Infestée par la vermine, toujours affamée, elle fond sur sa proie, jaillissant des ténèbres.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166163&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'685f1c24-b998-40e0-86fe-e428452ea2ed\', \'multiverseId\': 166163}, \'multiverseid\': 166163}, {\'name\': \'Poiana Atropa\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando la Poiana Atropa viene messa in un cimitero dal gioco, tutte le creature prendono -1/-1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Uccello\', \'flavor\': \'Infestata da parassiti, sempre affamata, cala in picchiata dal cielo notturno.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166306&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fbe3872-f5c1-4b67-998e-0cfa0dc9fa22\', \'multiverseId\': 166306}, \'multiverseid\': 166306}, {\'name\': \'死神頭のノスリ\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d677288-0a8b-4bbe-a4d6-2dbccca6f095\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Busardo Cabeça-da-Morte\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Busardo Cabeça-da-Morte for colocado num cemitério vindo de jogo, todas as criaturas recebem -1/-1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave\', \'flavor\': \'Infestado de parasitas, sempre faminto, ele mergulha do céu noturno.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166449&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'394689a8-267a-49a5-ad44-0107603fefe1\', \'multiverseId\': 166449}, \'multiverseid\': 166449}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tyrannischer Drache\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, verursacht Trampelschaden\\nDoppelschlag (Diese Kreatur fügt sowohl Erstschlags- als auch regulären Schaden zu.)\\nOpfere den Tyrannischen Drachen zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments, falls du nicht {R}{R}{R}{R} bezahlst.\\n{R}: Der Tyrannische Drache erhält +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166045&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'931e357a-c761-40de-8cf4-cb508282a1fc\', \'multiverseId\': 166045}, \'multiverseid\': 166045}, {\'name\': \'Tirano dragón\', \'text\': \'Vuela, arrolla.\\nDaña dos veces. (Esta criatura daña primero y también hace daño de combate normal.)\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, sacrifica el Tirano dragón a menos que pagues {R}{R}{R}{R}.{R}: El Tirano dragón obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166618&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c7851ae-ed2f-4108-89ac-3ab53b56ddf9\', \'multiverseId\': 166618}, \'multiverseid\': 166618}, {\'name\': \'Dragon tyran\', \'text\': "Vol, piétinement\\nDouble initiative (Cette créature inflige des blessures de combat à deux reprises : lors de l\'étape d\'initiative, et lors de l\'étape d\'attribution des blessures.)\\nAu début de votre entretien, sacrifiez le Dragon tyran à moins que vous ne payiez {R}{R}{R}{R}.\\n{R} : Le Dragon tyran gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166188&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3a8e0cb-96e2-4258-a7b1-66f63f2c1add\', \'multiverseId\': 166188}, \'multiverseid\': 166188}, {\'name\': \'Dragotiranno\', \'text\': "Volare, travolgere\\nDoppio attacco (questa creatura infligge sia il danno da attacco improvviso sia il normale danno da combattimento).\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, sacrifica il Dragotiranno a meno che tu spenda {R}{R}{R}{R}.\\n{R}: Il Dragotiranno prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno", \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166331&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f403239a-fac0-4f5a-9aca-cd7750bbb4b1\', \'multiverseId\': 166331}, \'multiverseid\': 166331}, {\'name\': \'ドラゴンの暴君\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7455b70-0273-4aa9-a166-6283969c4cb8\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Dragão Tirano\', \'text\': \'Voar, atropelar\\nGolpe duplo (Esta criatura causa tanto o dano da iniciativa quanto o dano de combate normal.)\\nNo início de sua manutenção sacrifique Dragão Tirano a menos que você pague {R}{R}{R}{R}.\\n{R}: Dragão Tirano recebe +1/+0 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166474&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be62ab1b-0af7-4916-abee-19b114696a25\', \'multiverseId\': 166474}, \'multiverseid\': 166474}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tödliche Dämpfe\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur ins Spiel kommt, zerstöre sie.\\n{0}: Zerstöre die Tödlichen Dämpfe. Du übergehst deinen nächsten Zug. Jeder Spieler kann diese Fähigkeit spielen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Die Dämpfe kriechen in jede Spalte, vergiften jede Lunge und ersticken jedes Leben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166025&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'794a0953-2aab-4fa7-b69e-94fe9efe6b1b\', \'multiverseId\': 166025}, \'multiverseid\': 166025}, {\'name\': \'Vapores letales\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura entre en juego, destrúyela.\\n{0}: Destruir los Vapores letales. Sáltate tu siguiente turno. Cualquier jugador puede jugar esta habilidad.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Los vapores penetran en cada grieta, envenenan cada pulmón y sofocan cada vida.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166598&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad01c1a3-3737-4e7e-be79-88de6eac1d3a\', \'multiverseId\': 166598}, \'multiverseid\': 166598}, {\'name\': \'Vapeurs mortelles\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature arrive en jeu, détruisez-la.\\n{0} : Détruisez les Vapeurs mortelles. Vous passez votre prochain tour. N\'importe quel joueur peut jouer cette capacité.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'Les vapeurs inondent chaque crevasse, empoisonnent chaque poumon et étouffent chaque vie.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166168&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'776c2314-dcb6-4bc6-bc89-a9e791cd8d85\', \'multiverseId\': 166168}, \'multiverseid\': 166168}, {\'name\': \'Vapori Letali\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una creatura entra in gioco, distruggila.\\n{0}: Distruggi i Vapori Letali. Salta il tuo prossimo turno. Ogni giocatore può giocare questa abilità.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'I vapori si infiltrano in tutte le crepe, avvelenano tutti i polmoni e stroncano tutte le vite.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166311&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2207654-d504-4797-854e-a22a48431be7\', \'multiverseId\': 166311}, \'multiverseid\': 166311}, {\'name\': \'致死の蒸気\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b553d022-3a27-4932-bdf5-da5c12d4742e\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Vapores Letais\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma criatura entrar em jogo, destrua-a.\\n{0}: Destrói Vapores Letais. Você pula seu próximo turno. Qualquer jogador pode usar esta habilidade.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'Os vapores infiltram-se em cada fenda, envenenam cada pulmão e acabam com cada vida.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166454&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'158e8202-7e2b-43d4-860d-389d57e33c29\', \'multiverseId\': 166454}, \'multiverseid\': 166454}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tödliche Mutation\', \'text\': \'Wenn die verzauberte Kreatur aufgedeckt wird, zerstöre sie. Sie kann nicht regeneriert werden.\', \'type\': \'Kreaturenverzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Du trugst diese Haut als eine Maske. Nun ist sie dein Sarg." —Kabbalisten-Kleriker\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166023&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c05896c-c424-45a2-a95a-33fb61f00577\', \'multiverseId\': 166023}, \'multiverseid\': 166023}, {\'name\': \'Mutación fatal\', \'text\': \'Cuando la criatura encantada se ponga boca arriba, destrúyela. No puede ser regenerado.\', \'type\': \'Encantar criatura\', \'flavor\': \'"Usas ese caparazón como máscara. Ahora es tu ataúd". Clérigo de la Cábala\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166596&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29ffa1ff-5cad-412a-8263-33a96a93d435\', \'multiverseId\': 166596}, \'multiverseid\': 166596}, {\'name\': \'Mutation fatale\', \'text\': \'Quand la créature enchantée est retournée face visible, détruisez-la. Elle ne peut pas être régénérée.\', \'type\': \'Enchanter : créature\', \'flavor\': \'« Cette coquille était ton masque. Elle sera désormais ton cercueil. » —Clerc de la Coterie\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166166&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebcbd106-906f-4b95-8893-e4aa6a5c2485\', \'multiverseId\': 166166}, \'multiverseid\': 166166}, {\'name\': \'Mutazione Fatale\', \'text\': \'Quando la creatura incantata viene girata a faccia in su, distruggila. Non può essere rigenerata.\', \'type\': \'Incanta Creatura\', \'flavor\': \'"Indossavi quel guscio come una maschera. Ora sarà la tua bara". —Chierico della Cabala\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166309&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'360bfd59-a4d4-4135-b85e-8b21eb19af0d\', \'multiverseId\': 166309}, \'multiverseid\': 166309}, {\'name\': \'致命的突然変異\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc552d11-64c8-4033-98b6-59574160a9a8\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Mutação Fatal\', \'text\': \'Quando a face da criatura encantada for voltada para cima, destrua-a. Ela não pode ser regenerada.\', \'type\': \'Encantar Criatura\', \'flavor\': \'"Você veste aquela concha como uma máscara. Agora ela é seu caixão." —Clérigo da Cabala\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166452&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b283240-ed30-4809-81cf-d850fcd871dc\', \'multiverseId\': 166452}, \'multiverseid\': 166452}]', '[{\'name\': \'Umgestalten\', \'text\': \'Lege eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, oben auf die Bibliothek ihres Besitzers. Dieser Gegner kann eine Artefaktkarte, Kreaturenkarte, Verzauberungskarte oder ein Land aus seiner Hand ins Spiel bringen.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn es das eine nicht ist, ist es halt das andere.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165997&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26db6f91-17ee-4038-8436-95ed12dc27e7\', \'multiverseId\': 165997}, \'multiverseid\': 165997}, {\'name\': \'Metamorfosear\', \'text\': \'Pon el permanente objetivo que controle un oponente en la parte superior de la biblioteca de su propietario. Ese oponente puede poner en juego una carta de artefacto, de criatura, de encantamiento o de tierra de su mano.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Si no es una cosa, es otra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166570&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'440fed78-ad32-4614-8130-7f0630806a91\', \'multiverseId\': 166570}, \'multiverseid\': 166570}, {\'name\': \'Transmigration\', \'text\': "Mettez le permanent contrôlé par un adversaire ciblé au-dessus de la bibliothèque de son propriétaire. Cet adversaire peut mettre en jeu une carte d\'artefact, de créature, d\'enchantement ou de terrain de sa main.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Si ce n\'est pas une chose, c\'en est une autre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166140&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d39c12b-76c7-4ae3-b789-b7a90705f2d0\', \'multiverseId\': 166140}, \'multiverseid\': 166140}, {\'name\': \'Trasformare\', \'text\': "Metti un permanente bersaglio controllato da un avversario in cima al grimorio del suo proprietario. Quell\'avversario può mettere in gioco una carta artefatto, creatura, incantesimo o terra dalla propria mano.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Se non è una cosa, è l\'altra.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166283&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59c877d7-b7e3-43f7-bc82-7aa96abbd35e\', \'multiverseId\': 166283}, \'multiverseid\': 166283}, {\'name\': \'変態\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ff56dc8-f3cf-4edf-9297-91c92e7db4ae\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Metamorfosear\', \'text\': \'Coloque a permanente alvo que um oponente controla no topo do grimório de seu dono. Aquele oponente pode colocar em jogo um card de artefato, criatura, encantamento ou terreno de sua própria mão.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Se não é uma coisa, é outra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166426&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7eb2d78c-e3f7-4007-8310-badc7e4c458e\', \'multiverseId\': 166426}, \'multiverseid\': 166426}]', "[{'name': 'Unaussprechliches Symbol', 'text': 'Bezahle 3 Lebenspunkte: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': 'Die Symbole sind in ganz Aphetto zu finden; sie zeigen an, wo Anhänger der Rabengilde und der Kabbalisten Zuflucht suchen können.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166036&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4f3a19a0-f23d-4b19-bbde-cd170db8ce53', 'multiverseId': 166036}, 'multiverseid': 166036}, {'name': 'Símbolo impronunciable', 'text': 'Pagar 3 vidas: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo.', 'type': 'Encantamiento', 'flavor': 'Los símbolos están esparcidos a través de Afeto y marcan los sitios donde los subalternos del Gremio de Cuervos y de la Cábala pueden buscar refugio.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166609&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e37a18d3-75a3-4bdd-9412-53c63d69b408', 'multiverseId': 166609}, 'multiverseid': 166609}, {'name': 'Symbole innommable', 'text': 'Payez 3 points de vie : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur la créature ciblée.', 'type': 'Enchantement', 'flavor': 'Les symboles se trouvent dans tout Aphetto, partout où les sbires de la guilde du corbeau et de la Coterie peuvent trouver refuge.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166179&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd1720d01-7f7f-42ef-abc7-1135250875d7', 'multiverseId': 166179}, 'multiverseid': 166179}, {'name': 'Simbolo Impronunciabile', 'text': 'Paga 3 punti vita: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio.', 'type': 'Incantesimo', 'flavor': 'I simboli sono sparsi per tutta Aphetto, per indicare i luoghi in cui i servitori della Gilda del Corvo e della Cabala possono trovare rifugio.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166322&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c4766a2a-a8e4-4d4e-a7b6-18b5a9b90ad6', 'multiverseId': 166322}, 'multiverseid': 166322}, {'name': '語られざる印', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1ccd7fc8-1838-478d-8bab-7fede77f7f16'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Símbolo Impronunciável', 'text': 'Pague 3 pontos de vida: Coloque um marcador +1/+1 na criatura alvo.', 'type': 'Encantamento', 'flavor': 'Os símbolos estão espalhados por Aphetto, marcando lugares em que os asseclas da Guilda do Corvo e da Cabala podem procurar refúgio.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166465&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5f39e839-375e-406f-a1d2-a652be2e58d1', 'multiverseId': 166465}, 'multiverseid': 166465}]", '[{\'name\': \'Unberechenbarer Milan\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn der Unberechenbare Milan einer Kreatur Kampfschaden zufügt, tappe diese Kreatur. Sie enttappt während des nächsten Enttapp-Segments ihres Beherrschers nicht.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165996&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3f32cda-92b5-4621-8864-3f9507bfdd48\', \'multiverseId\': 165996}, \'multiverseid\': 165996}, {\'name\': \'Milano mercurial\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que el Milano mercurial haga daño de combate a una criatura, gira esa criatura. No se endereza durante el siguiente paso de enderezar de su controlador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166569&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f015dafb-64fc-45a4-af1f-d3fd7b292c9f\', \'multiverseId\': 166569}, \'multiverseid\': 166569}, {\'name\': \'Escoufle lunatique\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Escoufle lunatique inflige des blessures de combat à une créature, engagez cette créature. Elle ne se dégage pas pendant la prochaine étape de dégagement de son contrôleur.", \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166139&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d2cdd9e-044c-4d70-bb30-63ef025e5047\', \'multiverseId\': 166139}, \'multiverseid\': 166139}, {\'name\': \'Nibbio di Mercurio\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta il Nibbio di Mercurio infligge danno da combattimento a una creatura, TAPpa quella creatura. Essa non STAPpa durante il prossimo STAP del suo controllore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Uccello\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166282&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6cad5ba-21fa-4d7b-9eb7-45c1d6704c7c\', \'multiverseId\': 166282}, \'multiverseid\': 166282}, {\'name\': \'気まぐれなトビ\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b89da11c-18a4-4522-a7e0-e4077465dd61\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Milhafre Mercurial\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que Milhafre Mercurial causar dano de combate a uma criatura, vire aquela criatura. Ela não pode ser desvirada durante a próxima etapa de desvirar de seu controlador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166425&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9220e586-3f58-49e6-b341-50c36f8e0b7c\', \'multiverseId\': 166425}, \'multiverseid\': 166425}]', '[{\'name\': \'Unheilbringender Quanar\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}{U}: Verdecke den Unheilbringenden Quanar.\\nMorph {1}{U}{U} (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur spielen. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Morph-Kosten auf.)\\nWenn der Unheilbringende Quanar aufgedeckt wird, kopiere einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei. Du kannst andere Ziele für die Kopie bestimmen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165999&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22a90607-3fcb-46dc-8f0c-47c90d301a91\', \'multiverseId\': 165999}, \'multiverseid\': 165999}, {\'name\': \'Quánar travieso\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}{U}: Pon el Quánar travieso boca abajo.\\nMetamorfosis {1}{U}{U}.(Puedes jugar esta carta boca abajo como una criatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Ponla boca arriba en cualquier momento pagando su coste de metamorfosis.)\\nCuando el Quánar travieso se ponga boca arriba, copia el hechizo objetivo de instantáneo o de conjuro. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para esa copia.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166572&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7fe2823-63c1-4396-8f5f-dd90ec22d6c4\', \'multiverseId\': 166572}, \'multiverseid\': 166572}, {\'name\': \'Quénar espiègle\', \'text\': "{3}{U}{U} : Retournez le Quénar espiègle face cachée.\\nMue {1}{U}{U} (Vous pouvez jouer cette carte face cachée comme une créature 2/2 pour {3}. Retournez-la quand vous le désirez pour son coût de mue.)\\nQuand le Quénar espiègle est retourné face visible, copiez le sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel ciblé. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour cette copie.", \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166142&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74db02f9-9bc4-49f6-b14e-ed5966e05ab1\', \'multiverseId\': 166142}, \'multiverseid\': 166142}, {\'name\': \'Quanar Malevolo\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}{U}: Gira il Quanar Malevolo a faccia in giù.\\nMetamorfosi {1}{U}{U} (puoi giocare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di metamorfosi.)\\nQuando il Quanar Malevolo viene girato a faccia in su, copia una magia istantaneo o una stregoneria bersaglio. Puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per quella copia.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166285&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d92560d3-8019-4da1-8232-2baf7f28dd91\', \'multiverseId\': 166285}, \'multiverseid\': 166285}, {\'name\': \'悪戯なクェイナー\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d8af546-f7b0-4967-b7a7-924477086b74\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Quanar Travesso\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}{U}: Volte a face de Quanar Travesso para baixo.\\nMetamorfose {1}{U}{U} (Você pode baixar este card com a face voltada para baixo como uma criatura 2/2 por {3}. Volte sua face para cima a qualquer momento pagando seu custo de metamorfose.)\\nQuando a face de Quanar Travesso for voltada para cima, copie a mágica instantânea ou o feitiço alvo. Você pode escolher novos alvos para aquela cópia.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Besta\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166428&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f66a95ad-2fac-426e-bf42-55247a9fa66b\', \'multiverseId\': 166428}, \'multiverseid\': 166428}]', '[{\'name\': \'Unkontrollierter Befall\', \'text\': \'Der Unkontrollierte Befall kann nur ein Nicht-Standardland verzaubern.\\nWenn das verzauberte Land getappt wird, zerstöre es.\', \'type\': \'Landverzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Auf dem Gelände des Springflut-Projekts kann man nun nur noch Remasuris, zerbrochene Reagenzgläser und einsam kreischende Möwen finden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166065&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50907139-74f8-4502-9b84-3876c37bf38f\', \'multiverseId\': 166065}, \'multiverseid\': 166065}, {\'name\': \'Infestación incontrolada\', \'text\': \'La Infestación descontrolada puede encantar sólo a una tierra que no sea básica.\\nCuando la tierra encantada sea girada, destrúyela.\', \'type\': \'Encantar tierra\', \'flavor\': \'El terreno del Proyecto Resaca ahora sólo está poblado de fragmentados, de vasos de precipitado rotos y del solitario chillido de las gaviotas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166638&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03490ad6-21b2-41e4-aedf-e5360804793c\', \'multiverseId\': 166638}, \'multiverseid\': 166638}, {\'name\': \'Infestation incontrôlée\', \'text\': "L\'Infestation incontrôlée ne peut enchanter qu\'un terrain non-base.\\nQuand le terrain enchanté devient engagé, détruisez-le.", \'type\': \'Enchanter : terrain\', \'flavor\': \'Les locaux du projet Jusant sont à présent hantés par les slivoïdes, les instruments brisés et le cri grinçant des mouettes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166208&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b38625c9-ad3a-4719-91ca-755a83cea2bb\', \'multiverseId\': 166208}, \'multiverseid\': 166208}, {\'name\': \'Infestazione Incontrollata\', \'text\': "L\'Infestazione Incontrollata può incantare solo una terra non base.\\nQuando la terra incantata viene TAPpata, distruggila.", \'type\': \'Incanta Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Il terreno su cui sorgeva il Progetto Marea è ora abitato solo da tramutanti, ampolle rotte e dal solitario richiamo dei gabbiani.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166351&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12a53c71-d5ed-454e-b493-6e83bd4b7f6f\', \'multiverseId\': 166351}, \'multiverseid\': 166351}, {\'name\': \'支配されざる横行\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd0ee58f-491e-4bde-952e-88b971526e64\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Infestação Descontrolada\', \'text\': \'A Infestação Descontrolada pode encantar apenas um terreno que não seja básico.\\nQuando o terreno encantado for virado, destrua-o.\', \'type\': \'Encantar Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'A área do Projeto da Rebentação é agora habitada apenas por Fractius, béqueres quebrados e o guinchado solitário das gaivotas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166494&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c0f9fa0-cff1-4efe-bae1-058fde55795f\', \'multiverseId\': 166494}, \'multiverseid\': 166494}]', '[{\'name\': \'Untoter Griff\', \'text\': \'Die verzauberte Kreatur erhält +3/+3, solange sie ein Zombie ist. Andernfalls erhält sie -3/-3.\', \'type\': \'Kreaturenverzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Die linke Hand des Todes erkennt die rechte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166018&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'deb6e1f7-34b4-46d2-ac2b-3107fa97d152\', \'multiverseId\': 166018}, \'multiverseid\': 166018}, {\'name\': \'Agarre de muerte viviente\', \'text\': \'La criatura encantada obtiene +3/+3 mientras sea un Zombie. Si no, obtiene -3/-3.\', \'type\': \'Encantar criatura\', \'flavor\': \'La mano de la muerte reconoce a los suyos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166591&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69c92a20-64e4-4d60-9cca-3f0d3b4a183c\', \'multiverseId\': 166591}, \'multiverseid\': 166591}, {\'name\': \'Emprise de la morte-vie\', \'text\': "La créature enchantée gagne +3/+3 tant qu\'elle est un zombie. Sinon, elle gagne -3/-3.", \'type\': \'Enchanter : créature\', \'flavor\': \'La main de la mort reconnaît les siens.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166161&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d30ace0-ce12-46be-99ba-0599ddf6d5bd\', \'multiverseId\': 166161}, \'multiverseid\': 166161}, {\'name\': \'Stretta del Non Morto\', \'text\': \'La creatura incantata prende +3/+3 fintanto che è uno Zombie. Altrimenti, prende -3/-3.\', \'type\': \'Incanta Creatura\', \'flavor\': \'Il tocco della morte riconosce chi le appartiene.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166304&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45a4f7c4-1097-4109-a1c2-d66b8646ca8c\', \'multiverseId\': 166304}, \'multiverseid\': 166304}, {\'name\': \'すがりつく不死\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3638a671-2ba6-42a9-b5cb-49d085715025\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Garra de Morte-Vida\', \'text\': \'A criatura encantada recebe +3/+3 desde que seja um Zumbi. Caso contrário, ela recebe -3/-3.\', \'type\': \'Encantar Criatura\', \'flavor\': \'A mão da morte reconhece os seus iguais.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166447&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3574c5fe-afcf-4fd5-b2a7-ca4111f36263\', \'multiverseId\': 166447}, \'multiverseid\': 166447}]', '[{\'name\': \'Untoter Kriegshäuptling\', \'text\': \'Zombiezauber, die du spielst, kosten beim Ausspielen {1} weniger.\\nZombies, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +2/+1.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Er hat die Stärke von sieben Männern. Um genau zu sein er war einmal sieben Männer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166035&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee50d92f-3a95-42d5-add7-a926080ce6c1\', \'multiverseId\': 166035}, \'multiverseid\': 166035}, {\'name\': \'Jefe de guerra muerto viviente\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {1} menos jugar los hechizos de Zombie.\\nLos Zombies que controles obtienen +2/+1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Tiene la fuerza de siete hombres. En realidad, solía ser siete hombres.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166608&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72e28e3e-ebfb-47a4-a478-165b6b086626\', \'multiverseId\': 166608}, \'multiverseid\': 166608}, {\'name\': \'Chef de guerre mort-vivant\', \'text\': \'Les sorts de zombie coûtent {1} de moins à jouer.\\nLes zombies que vous contrôlez gagnent +2/+1.\', \'type\': \'Créature : zombie\', \'flavor\': "Il a la force de sept hommes d\'ailleurs, de son vivant, il était sept hommes.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166178&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55f206af-6ef9-4131-94a7-79226795c1bc\', \'multiverseId\': 166178}, \'multiverseid\': 166178}, {\'name\': \'Condottiero Non Morto\', \'text\': \'Le magie Zombie che giochi costano {1} in meno per essere giocate.\\nGli Zombie che controlli prendono +2/+1.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Ha la forza di sette uomini. In effetti è stato messo insieme usando i pezzi di sette uomini.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166321&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba6d3fb5-c921-4e7f-a1b8-a54fdd92261e\', \'multiverseId\': 166321}, \'multiverseid\': 166321}, {\'name\': \'アンデッドの戦長\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3218e89d-f057-44b4-82c9-87b6eede5aac\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Comandante de Guerra Morto-Vivo\', \'text\': \'Suas mágicas de Zumbi custam {1} a menos para serem jogadas.\\nOs Zumbis que você controla recebem +2/+1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi\', \'flavor\': \'Ele tem a força de sete homens. Na verdade, ele já foi sete homens.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166464&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50d37ccd-665d-45e3-bd53-abf90dbac9bf\', \'multiverseId\': 166464}, \'multiverseid\': 166464}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verbunden mit der Natur\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn die verzauberte Kreatur einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einem Standardland durchsuchen und diese Karte getappt ins Spiel bringen. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Kreaturenverzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166082&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6df48fb8-36ab-42c7-9adf-d7a2aee23393\', \'multiverseId\': 166082}, \'multiverseid\': 166082}, {\'name\': \'En armonía con la naturaleza\', \'text\': \'Siempre que la criatura encantada haga daño de combate a un jugador, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica y poner esa carta en juego girada. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Encantar criatura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166655&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2eed07bb-2128-4718-b4ee-0889e64c4624\', \'multiverseId\': 166655}, \'multiverseid\': 166655}, {\'name\': \'Fusion avec la nature\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que la créature enchantée inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, vous pouvez chercher une carte de terrain de base dans votre bibliothèque et mettre cette carte en jeu engagée. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.\', \'type\': \'Enchanter : créature\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166225&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ade64ae2-0908-4c9c-bd7a-59c1a098c3e2\', \'multiverseId\': 166225}, \'multiverseid\': 166225}, {\'name\': "Tutt\'uno con la Natura", \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta la creatura incantata infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio, scegliere una carta terra base e metterla in gioco TAPpata. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Incanta Creatura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166368&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'728aed24-328c-4169-80c2-47202d1cf6f7\', \'multiverseId\': 166368}, \'multiverseid\': 166368}, {\'name\': \'自然との一体化\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b78e3b69-fda2-46d0-9d89-9e32edf96d0a\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Um com a Natureza\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que a criatura encantada causar dano de combate a um jogador, você pode procurar por um card de terreno básico em seu grimório e colocá-lo em jogo virado. Depois, embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Encantar Criatura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166511&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3386405c-f826-4610-b0e8-6c5bd19db5d0\', \'multiverseId\': 166511}, \'multiverseid\': 166511}]', '[{\'name\': \'Vergessenes Urwesen\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Spieler einen Zauberspruch spielt, kannst du eine +1/+1 Marke auf das Vergessene Urwesen legen.\\nDu kannst zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments eine beliebige Anzahl an +1/+1-Marken vom Vergessenen Urwesen auf andere Kreaturen legen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': \'Sein Blut ist Leben. Sein Körper ist Wachstum.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166077&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'861434f5-1b27-4667-8cee-d8f939f102c7\', \'multiverseId\': 166077}, \'multiverseid\': 166077}, {\'name\': \'Ancestro olvidado\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un jugador juegue un hechizo, puedes poner un contador +1/+1 sobre el Ancestro olvidado.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, puedes mover cualquier número de contadores +1/+1 del Ancestro olvidado a otras criaturas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'Su sangre es vida. Su cuerpo es crecimiento.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166650&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b6b8f9b-3a72-4b10-8047-205a04115d60\', \'multiverseId\': 166650}, \'multiverseid\': 166650}, {\'name\': \'Ancien immémoré\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un joueur joue un sort, vous pouvez mettre un marqueur +1/+1 sur l\'Ancien immémoré.\\nAu début de votre entretien, vous pouvez déplacer un nombre quelconque de marqueurs +1/+1 de l\'Ancien immémoré sur d\'autres créatures.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': \'La vie est son sang. La végétation est son corps.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166220&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10d8d921-d6f2-4e06-acee-99017854cca6\', \'multiverseId\': 166220}, \'multiverseid\': 166220}, {\'name\': \'Antico Dimenticato\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta un giocatore gioca una magia, puoi mettere un segnalino +1/+1 sull\'Antico Dimenticato.\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, puoi spostare un numero qualsiasi di segnalini +1/+1 dall\'Antico Dimenticato ad altre creature.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': \'Il suo sangue è vita. Il suo corpo è crescita.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166363&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24332b03-4554-4c70-9542-46d6b301a99b\', \'multiverseId\': 166363}, \'multiverseid\': 166363}, {\'name\': \'忘れられた古霊\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9bf9896-3f77-4e2a-8a9a-d514371ee376\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Ancião Esquecido\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um jogador jogar uma mágica, você pode colocar um marcador +1/+1 sobre Ancião Esquecido.\\nNo início de sua manutenção, você pode transferir um número qualquer de marcadores +1/+1 de Ancião Esquecido para outras criaturas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'Seu sangue é vida. Seu corpo, crescimento.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166506&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f31d772-2ea3-44f4-b12f-286a76442c15\', \'multiverseId\': 166506}, \'multiverseid\': 166506}]', "[{'name': 'Verkoken', 'text': 'Verkoken fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu. Diese Kreatur kann in diesem Zug nicht regeneriert werden. Falls die Kreatur in diesem Zug auf den Friedhof gelegt würde, entferne sie stattdessen ganz aus dem Spiel.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166040&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3243535f-b918-47ab-ba92-d61d9669eb5b', 'multiverseId': 166040}, 'multiverseid': 166040}, {'name': 'Carbonizar', 'text': 'Carbonizar hace 3 puntos de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo. Esa criatura no puede ser regenerada este turno. Si la criatura fuera a ir a un cementerio este turno, en vez de eso, remuévela del juego.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166613&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '11909182-fdb6-4c4d-a3ae-c1518beecdfd', 'multiverseId': 166613}, 'multiverseid': 166613}, {'name': 'Carbonisation', 'text': 'La Carbonisation inflige 3 blessures à une cible, joueur ou créature. Cette créature ne peut pas être régénérée ce tour-ci. Si cette créature devait être mise dans un cimetière durant ce tour, retirez-la de la partie à la place.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166183&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '87cec98f-38ba-4211-978a-397be904edb2', 'multiverseId': 166183}, 'multiverseid': 166183}, {'name': 'Carbonizzare', 'text': 'Carbonizzare infligge 3 danni a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio. Quella creatura non può essere rigenerata in questo turno. Se la creatura viene messa in un cimitero in questo turno, invece rimuovila dal gioco.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166326&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c5ab25e8-0f74-4ea7-a61c-3a2e7e26dad0', 'multiverseId': 166326}, 'multiverseid': 166326}, {'name': '炭化', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6b35332b-b5bf-41e3-bb33-b9b207d9a14c'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Carbonizar', 'text': 'Carbonizar causa 3 pontos de dano à criatura alvo ou ao jogador alvo. Aquela criatura não pode ser regenerada neste turno. Se a criatura fosse colocada em um cemitério neste turno, ao invés disso remova-a de jogo.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166469&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0c554d5c-a757-48c1-a8a0-d6db8843e10b', 'multiverseId': 166469}, 'multiverseid': 166469}]", '[{\'name\': \'Vertriebener Schwarzseher\', \'text\': \'Alle Morphkosten kosten {2} mehr. (Dies beeinflusst die Kosten, eine Kreatur verdeckt zu spielen, nicht.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'Er versucht verzweifelt, die Zukunft aufzuhalten, da er sie schon gesehen hat.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165970&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81aaa062-91f7-4357-bb52-b32d4befc82f\', \'multiverseId\': 165970}, \'multiverseid\': 165970}, {\'name\': \'Condenador exiliado\', \'text\': \'Todos los costes de metamorfosis cuestan {2} más. (Esto no afecta el coste de jugar criaturas boca abajo.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo\', \'flavor\': \'Está desesperado por frenar el futuro porque lo ha visto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166543&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6e7e26e-1e45-427a-b991-83ae94ca27dc\', \'multiverseId\': 166543}, \'multiverseid\': 166543}, {\'name\': \'Conte-destin exilé\', \'text\': "Tous les coûts de mue coûtent {2} supplémentaires. (Ceci n\'affecte en rien le coût pour jouer des créature face cachée.)", \'type\': \'Créature : clerc\', \'flavor\': "S\'il tente à tout prix de retarder l\'avenir, c\'est parce qu\'il l\'a vu de ses propres yeux.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166113&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56b605b6-e7ee-43da-928b-fc0da74168a7\', \'multiverseId\': 166113}, \'multiverseid\': 166113}, {\'name\': \'Profeta Esiliato\', \'text\': \'Tutti i costi di metamorfosi costano {2} in più (Questo effetto non influenza il costo per giocare le creature a faccia in giù).\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico\', \'flavor\': \'Vuole disperatamente rimandare il futuro poiché ha visto cosa lo aspetta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166256&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bcff577f-3461-4248-86d7-b04734caf28e\', \'multiverseId\': 166256}, \'multiverseid\': 166256}, {\'name\': \'流刑の終末論者\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa184198-17ef-4939-a4fc-ff8b9fd0add5\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Áugure do Infortúnio Exilado\', \'text\': \'Todos os custos de metamorfose custam {2} a mais. (Isto não afeta o custo para baixar as criaturas com a face voltada para baixo.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo\', \'flavor\': \'Ele está desesperado para adiar o futuro porque ele já o viu.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166399&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03296c6a-fb5a-493d-aa07-bda47a036cf1\', \'multiverseId\': 166399}, \'multiverseid\': 166399}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verwesender Raptor\', \'text\': \'Morph Wirf eine Zombie-Karte aus deiner Hand ab. (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur spielen. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Morph-Kosten auf.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie, Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'Er schnappt eifrig Stückchen seines eigenen verwesenden Fleisches auf, wenn sie auf den sumpfigen Boden fallen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166028&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75481602-7058-4320-a762-9e64f77816b1\', \'multiverseId\': 166028}, \'multiverseid\': 166028}, {\'name\': \'Ráptor pútrido\', \'text\': \'Metamorfosis - Descartar de tu mano una carta de Zombie. (Puedes jugar esta carta boca abajo como una criatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Ponla boca arriba en cualquier momento pagando su coste de metamorfosis.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Engulle con avidez pedazos de su propia carne putrefacta en cuanto caen al suelo pantanoso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166601&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03c37d1f-030d-4552-87c9-96b2820541d6\', \'multiverseId\': 166601}, \'multiverseid\': 166601}, {\'name\': \'Raptor putride\', \'text\': "Mue Défaussez-vous d\'une carte de zombie de votre main. (Vous pouvez jouer cette carte face cachée comme une créature 2/2 pour {3}. Retournez-la quand vous le désirez pour son coût de mue.)", \'type\': \'Créature : zombie et bête\', \'flavor\': \'Il avale goulûment les lambeaux de chair putréfiée qui se détachent de son corps.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166171&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15c0c3f0-cc8b-472b-8975-46660d170439\', \'multiverseId\': 166171}, \'multiverseid\': 166171}, {\'name\': \'Raptor Putrido\', \'text\': \'Metamorfosi—Scarta una carta Zombie dalla tua mano. (puoi giocare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di metamorfosi.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Inghiotte avidamente i pezzi della sua stessa carne putrefatta che cadono sul terreno paludoso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166314&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f434a75-317d-41b9-a4ec-424d247ce148\', \'multiverseId\': 166314}, \'multiverseid\': 166314}, {\'name\': \'朽ちゆく猛禽\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6aee5ca-f958-4f24-91d0-d993b05a8a2e\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Raptor Pútrido\', \'text\': \'Metamorfose—Descarte um card de Zumbi de sua mão. (Você pode baixar este card com a face voltada para baixo como uma criatura 2/2 por {3}. Volte sua face para cima a qualquer momento pagando seu custo de metamorfose.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Besta Zumbi\', \'flavor\': \'Ele devora com sofreguidão os nacos de sua própria carne apodrecida que caem ao chão pantanoso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166457&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba61169b-8ed6-491f-8b5e-c15c83ef3a04\', \'multiverseId\': 166457}, \'multiverseid\': 166457}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verzehrender Schlamm\', \'text\': \'{2}{B}{B}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -1/-1 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Verzehrenden Schlamm.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Schlammwesen\', \'flavor\': \'Still wie der Nebel und unbarmherzig wie eine Seuche ein kalter, schleichender Tod.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166019&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1aabda1-bd09-45a4-9333-476e9e12839d\', \'multiverseId\': 166019}, \'multiverseid\': 166019}, {\'name\': \'Lodo tísico\', \'text\': \'{2}{B}{B}: La criatura objetivo obtiene -1/-1 hasta el final del turno. Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Lodo tísico.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Cieno\', \'flavor\': \'Silenciosa como niebla e implacable como peste, es muerte húmeda que se desliza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166592&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43cd9ed6-1ecf-4855-8487-10f186cec840\', \'multiverseId\': 166592}, \'multiverseid\': 166592}, {\'name\': \'Empois vorace\', \'text\': "{2}{B}{B} : La créature ciblée gagne -1/-1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur l\'Empois vorace.", \'type\': \'Créature : limon\', \'flavor\': "Aussi silencieux qu\'un brouillard et aussi implacable que la peste, c\'est une mort rampante et humide.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166162&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2398302-5817-4bdf-be16-579fcc988e39\', \'multiverseId\': 166162}, \'multiverseid\': 166162}, {\'name\': \'Fanghiglia Corrosiva\', \'text\': \'{2}{B}{B}: La creatura bersaglio prende -1/-1 fino alla fine del turno. Metti un segnalino +1/+1 sulla Fanghiglia Corrosiva.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Melma\', \'flavor\': \'Silenziosa come la nebbia e imbloccabile come la peste. È una morte umida e strisciante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166305&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'605c4697-27be-42a4-802a-662073a21b21\', \'multiverseId\': 166305}, \'multiverseid\': 166305}, {\'name\': \'消耗の軟体\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06c16085-1f63-4dcd-a24d-4ffc5efe0554\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Visco Consumidor\', \'text\': \'{2}{B}{B}: A criatura alvo recebe -1/-1 até o final do turno. Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Visco Consumidor.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lodo\', \'flavor\': \'Silencioso como a neblina e implacável como a peste, ele é morte viscosa e rastejante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166448&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8fc9a4c-f069-462d-83eb-609edddfa4fa\', \'multiverseId\': 166448}, \'multiverseid\': 166448}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verzerrte Scheußlichkeit\', \'text\': \'{B}: Regeneriere die Verzerrte Scheußlichkeit.\\nSumpfumwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte aus deiner Hand ab: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Sumpfkarte, zeige diese Karte offen vor und nimm sie auf deine Hand. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie, Mutant\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166033&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73fbf9b7-4e34-4621-959a-e82e916c0100\', \'multiverseId\': 166033}, \'multiverseid\': 166033}, {\'name\': \'Abominación torcida\', \'text\': \'{B}: Regenera a la Abominación torcida.\\nCiclo de pantano {2}.({2}, descartar esta carta de tu mano: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de pantano, muéstrala y ponla en tu mano. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Mutante zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166606&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f620f04f-4ffd-456d-a57c-72c6e82758b3\', \'multiverseId\': 166606}, \'multiverseid\': 166606}, {\'name\': \'Abomination perverse\', \'text\': "{B} : Régénérez l\'Abomination perverse.\\nRecyclage de marais {2} ({2}, Défaussez-vous de cette carte depuis votre main : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de marais, révélez-la, et ajoutez-la à votre main. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.)", \'type\': \'Créature : zombie et mutant\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166176&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42e3114a-36a6-4aa7-91f6-5bd81ec2eb7c\', \'multiverseId\': 166176}, \'multiverseid\': 166176}, {\'name\': \'Abominio Folle\', \'text\': "{B}: Rigenera l\'Abominio Folle.\\nCiclopalude {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta dalla tua mano: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio, scegli una carta palude, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mutante Zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166319&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5408a60-abe4-4d1c-9553-43b08832be8d\', \'multiverseId\': 166319}, \'multiverseid\': 166319}, {\'name\': \'よじれた嫌悪者\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'427f13aa-fc25-4723-b428-52b8e3e7b815\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Abominação Distorcida\', \'text\': \'{B}: Regenera Abominação Distorcida.\\nReciclar Pântano {2} ({2}, Descarte este card de sua mão: Procure em seu grimório por um card de pântano, revele-o e coloque-o em sua mão. Depois, embaralhe seu grimório.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi Mutante\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166462&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19ee8c9d-1874-47a9-856a-99c483a11cf8\', \'multiverseId\': 166462}, \'multiverseid\': 166462}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verzögerter Tod\', \'text\': \'Der Beherrscher der verzauberten Kreatur opfert sie am Ende seines Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreaturenverzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Sieht nicht gut aus. Ich habe keine Ahnung, ob er die Nacht übersteht." —Kabbalisten-Kleriker\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166026&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c2a3585-ff4c-4b14-8ae4-3f223192d964\', \'multiverseId\': 166026}, \'multiverseid\': 166026}, {\'name\': \'Muerte prolongada\', \'text\': \'El controlador de la criatura encantada la sacrifica al final de su turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantar criatura\', \'flavor\': \'"Luce mal. No sé si sobreviva a la noche". Clérigo de la Cábala\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166599&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ad1353d-251a-48b5-8c25-f3c53a9cbcb5\', \'multiverseId\': 166599}, \'multiverseid\': 166599}, {\'name\': \'Mort persistante\', \'text\': \'Le contrôleur de la créature enchantée la sacrifie à la fin de son tour.\', \'type\': \'Enchanter : créature\', \'flavor\': "« Il est très mal en point. J\'ignore s\'il passera la nuit. » —Clerc de la Coterie", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166169&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd2f2d1c-719f-41dd-96ce-8faf14a3c39c\', \'multiverseId\': 166169}, \'multiverseid\': 166169}, {\'name\': \'Morte Persistente\', \'text\': \'Il controllore della creatura incantata la sacrifica alla fine del proprio turno.\', \'type\': \'Incanta Creatura\', \'flavor\': \'"È messo male. Non so se arriverà a domani". —Chierico della Cabala\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166312&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0d3f957-19be-4e2a-9f13-18b4c23ab14c\', \'multiverseId\': 166312}, \'multiverseid\': 166312}, {\'name\': \'長引く死\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8c5344c-d93a-4854-a3be-983b07186dd0\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Às Portas da Morte\', \'text\': \'O controlador da criatura encantada a sacrifica no final de seu próprio turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantar Criatura\', \'flavor\': \'"Não está nada bem. Não sei se ele resistirá à noite." —Clérigo da Cabala\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166455&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a65e69ec-ab27-4c63-802a-49ac688c631c\', \'multiverseId\': 166455}, \'multiverseid\': 166455}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wissensschwall\', \'text\': \'Ziehe so viele Karten, wie die höchsten umgewandelten Manakosten unter den bleibenden Karten, die du kontrollierst, betragen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Unbegrenzte Macht ist wunderbar bis man unbegrenztes Verständnis erlangt."—Ixidor, Realitätsgestalter\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166006&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa5aac7c-f5eb-4473-aea9-c0bc6f140c40\', \'multiverseId\': 166006}, \'multiverseid\': 166006}, {\'name\': \'Torrente de conocimiento\', \'text\': \'Roba un número de cartas igual al coste de maná convertido más alto que haya entre los permanentes que controles.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"El poder ilimitado es glorioso hasta que adquieres entendimiento ilimitado". Íxidor, escultor de realidad\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166579&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97660ea3-4e1d-43d4-a82c-12ca0ba399f6\', \'multiverseId\': 166579}, \'multiverseid\': 166579}, {\'name\': \'Déferlante de connaissance\', \'text\': \'Piochez un nombre de cartes équivalent au coût converti de mana le plus élevé parmi les permanents que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Le pouvoir illimité n\'est jouissif que si vous n\'en saisissez pas toutes les implications. »— Ixidor, sculpteur de réalité", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166149&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4924891b-3332-48ab-856f-68ee4765ad96\', \'multiverseId\': 166149}, \'multiverseid\': 166149}, {\'name\': \'Flusso di Conoscenza\', \'text\': \'Pesca un numero di carte pari al più alto costo di mana convertito tra i permanenti che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Il potere infinito è delizioso fino a quando non acquisisci anche una comprensione infinita". —Ixidor, manipolatore della realtà\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166292&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2a216ac-f5d5-4aab-a53b-fbe30b017326\', \'multiverseId\': 166292}, \'multiverseid\': 166292}, {\'name\': \'流れ込む知識\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a197b34-a344-41dc-830f-90948ff32dd3\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Torrente de Conhecimento\', \'text\': \'Compre um número de cards igual ao maior custo de mana convertido dentre as permanentes que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"O poder ilimitado é glorioso até que você obtenha compreensão ilimitada." —Ixidor, escultor da realidade\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166435&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc5dc345-2726-4eca-ae60-5d7390c8c89b\', \'multiverseId\': 166435}, \'multiverseid\': 166435}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wurzelelementar\', \'text\': \'Morph {5}{G}{G} (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur spielen. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Morph-Kosten auf.)\\nWenn das Wurzelelementar aufgedeckt wird, kannst du eine Kreaturenkarte aus deiner Hand ins Spiel bringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166084&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88b82817-2dae-4983-9891-f1a74734013b\', \'multiverseId\': 166084}, \'multiverseid\': 166084}, {\'name\': \'Elemental de raíz\', \'text\': \'Metamorfosis {5}{G}{G}.(Puedes jugar esta carta boca abajo como una criatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Ponla boca arriba en cualquier momento pagando su coste de metamorfosis.)\\nCuando el Elemental de raíz se ponga boca arriba, puedes poner en juego una carta de criatura de tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166657&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f23e3644-286e-4367-955c-8b0bdec6d69e\', \'multiverseId\': 166657}, \'multiverseid\': 166657}, {\'name\': \'Élémental de racines\', \'text\': "Mue {5}{G}{G} (Vous pouvez jouer cette carte face cachée comme une créature 2/2 pour {3}. Retournez-la quand vous le désirez pour son coût de mue.)\\nQuand l\'Élémental de racines est retourné face visible, vous pouvez mettre en jeu une carte de créature de votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166227&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'923e4dd0-52e6-46ab-bc26-5c3b2cd5c37d\', \'multiverseId\': 166227}, \'multiverseid\': 166227}, {\'name\': \'Elementale della Radice\', \'text\': "Metamorfosi {5}{G}{G} (puoi giocare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di metamorfosi.)\\nQuando l\'Elementale della Radice viene girato a faccia in su, puoi mettere in gioco una carta creatura dalla tua mano.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166370&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cb658c0-8cc8-4160-bb81-85c6a10516fe\', \'multiverseId\': 166370}, \'multiverseid\': 166370}, {\'name\': \'根の精霊\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae86b3e7-a058-4925-b8d5-ceb81aa34099\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Elemental da Raiz\', \'text\': \'Metamorfose {5}{G}{G} (Você pode baixar este card com a face voltada para baixo como uma criatura 2/2 por {3}. Volte sua face para cima a qualquer momento pagando seu custo de metamorfose.)\\nQuando a face de Elemental da Raiz for voltada para cima, você pode colocar em jogo um card de criatura de sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166513&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'595c6bc1-e723-4f2b-b966-6e939405aa60\', \'multiverseId\': 166513}, \'multiverseid\': 166513}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wütendwerden\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +X/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Du wirst mich nicht mögen, wenn ich ärgerlich werde."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166048&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d11a2a17-ca5b-4678-90bb-a44a550d6f37\', \'multiverseId\': 166048}, \'multiverseid\': 166048}, {\'name\': \'Encolerizar\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene +X/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Yo no te agradaría si me enojara".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166621&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fef89d0-dcc6-478a-823a-ccb9f14974a7\', \'multiverseId\': 166621}, \'multiverseid\': 166621}, {\'name\': \'Enrager\', \'text\': "La créature ciblée gagne +X/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Là je suis calme Vous me verriez quand je suis en colère... »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166191&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c1f35e1-b053-4d98-8e0e-49c5a938c73c\', \'multiverseId\': 166191}, \'multiverseid\': 166191}, {\'name\': \'Infuriare\', \'text\': \'La creatura bersaglio prende +X/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Non ti piacerei quando sono arrabbiato."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166334&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'464e879e-f70d-457a-8292-ad972bedbbf5\', \'multiverseId\': 166334}, \'multiverseid\': 166334}, {\'name\': \'怒髪天\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef96b8de-8b21-438c-af43-114dbd5c3a4e\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Enfurecer\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe +X/+0 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Você não gostaria de me ver zangado."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166477&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d04f44bd-caf0-4c75-a3b9-1e956dd92b2b\', \'multiverseId\': 166477}, \'multiverseid\': 166477}]', '[{\'name\': \'Xantiden-Schwarm\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn der Xantiden-Schwarm angreift, kann der verteidigende Spieler in diesem Zug keine Zauber spielen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Insekt\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn sie auf dir landen, kannst du nur noch daran denken, wie du sie am besten loswirst.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166092&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d8d8a0a-b8cc-45e8-a44e-98d50a8f4dc0\', \'multiverseId\': 166092}, \'multiverseid\': 166092}, {\'name\': \'Enjambre de xántidos\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que el Enjambre de xántidos ataque, el jugador defensor no puede jugar hechizos este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Insecto\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando aterrizan sobre ti, sólo puedes pensar en arrancártelos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166665&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d7e4e39-06ae-4068-bb46-5744a1bbf488\', \'multiverseId\': 166665}, \'multiverseid\': 166665}, {\'name\': \'Nuée xanthide\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que la Nuée xanthide attaque, le joueur défenseur ne peut pas jouer de sorts ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Créature : insecte\', \'flavor\': "Quand ils se posent sur vous, vous ne pensez plus qu\'à vous en débarrasser.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166235&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27f89c11-3b2c-4a4b-9a45-86ec69245684\', \'multiverseId\': 166235}, \'multiverseid\': 166235}, {\'name\': \'Sciame Xantide\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta lo Sciame Xantide attacca, il giocatore in difesa non può giocare magie in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Insetto\', \'flavor\': \'Quando ti atterrano addosso, riesci solo a pensare a come strapparle via.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166378&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98b4f63a-3d9d-476f-9480-df491c885cdd\', \'multiverseId\': 166378}, \'multiverseid\': 166378}, {\'name\': \'ザンティッドの大群\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2eb734f-2ff3-4e82-958f-ada2656571e4\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Enxame de Xantídeos\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que Enxame de Xantídeos atacar, o jogador defensor não poderá jogar mágicas neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Inseto\', \'flavor\': \'Quando eles pousam em você, só se consegue pensar em arrancá-los do corpo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166521&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bc6ad97-88b5-40a9-ac74-6b751f0694a7\', \'multiverseId\': 166521}, \'multiverseid\': 166521}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zeitloser Wachposten\', \'text\': \'(Mauern können nicht angreifen.)\\nFliegend\\nWenn der Zeitlose Wachposten blockt, wird sein Kreaturentyp zu Riese, Vogel. (Er ist nicht länger eine Mauer. Dieser Effekt endet nicht am Ende des Zuges.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mauer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165958&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6dab61c0-f570-4148-bd83-d180b69429a5\', \'multiverseId\': 165958}, \'multiverseid\': 165958}, {\'name\': \'Centinelas eternos\', \'text\': \'(Los muros no pueden atacar.)Vuela.\\nCuando los Centinelas eternos bloquean, su tipo de criatura se convierte en Ave Gigante. (Deja de ser Muro. Este efecto no termina al final del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Muro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166531&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02fa7b80-099b-4d04-bfde-1fc6473eb8ff\', \'multiverseId\': 166531}, \'multiverseid\': 166531}, {\'name\': \'Sentinelles séculaires\', \'text\': "(Les murs ne peuvent pas attaquer.)\\nVol\\nQuand les Sentinelles séculaires bloquent, leur type de créature devient géant et oiseau. (Ce n\'est plus un mur. Cet effet ne s\'arrête pas à la fin du tour.)", \'type\': \'Créature : mur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166101&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2511c6c-ce49-4dc0-a72d-0d7736652581\', \'multiverseId\': 166101}, \'multiverseid\': 166101}, {\'name\': \'Sentinelle Sempiterne\', \'text\': \'(I Muri non possono attaccare.)\\nVolare\\nQuando le Sentinelle Sempiterne bloccano, il loro tipo di creatura diventa Uccello Gigante (Non sono più un Muro. questo effetto non termina alla fine del turno).\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Muro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166244&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6ace430-c634-4219-8ac8-7e91907ff1cd\', \'multiverseId\': 166244}, \'multiverseid\': 166244}, {\'name\': \'老いざる歩哨\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bcf6702-5255-4df6-85f1-ebf7247da433\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Sentinelas Eternas\', \'text\': \'(As Barreiras não podem atacar.)\\nVoar\\nQuando Sentinelas Eternas bloquear, seu tipo de criatura torna-se Pássaro Gigante. (Ele não é mais uma Barreira. Este efeito não cessa no final do turno.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Barreira\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166387&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'678c0213-9845-4c5a-8b6e-b1ce7bb1f5cd\', \'multiverseId\': 166387}, \'multiverseid\': 166387}]', "[{'name': 'Zeitriss', 'text': 'Bringe eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\\nSturm (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch spielst, kopiere ihn einmal für jeden Zauberspruch, der in diesem Zug bereits gespielt wurde. Du kannst andere Ziele für diese Kopien bestimmen.)', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166010&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd3588c1f-c075-415c-ad9d-b63f68933f45', 'multiverseId': 166010}, 'multiverseid': 166010}, {'name': 'Fisura temporal', 'text': 'Regresa el permanente objetivo a la mano de su propietario.\\nTormenta (Cuando juegues este hechizo, cópialo por cada hechizo jugado antes que él en este turno. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para las copias.)', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166583&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd50556cb-7c17-4e49-8248-74e96b9315fd', 'multiverseId': 166583}, 'multiverseid': 166583}, {'name': 'Fissure temporelle', 'text': 'Renvoyez le permanent ciblé dans la main de son propriétaire.\\nDéluge (Quand vous jouez ce sort, copiez-le pour chaque sort joué avant lui ce tour-ci. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour chaque copie.)', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166153&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '39cf606c-0caf-4575-873a-79aab88dc6b8', 'multiverseId': 166153}, 'multiverseid': 166153}, {'name': 'Fenditura Temporale', 'text': 'Il proprietario riprende in mano un permanente bersaglio.\\nTempesta (quando giochi questa magia, copiala una volta per ogni magia giocata prima di questa durante questo turno. Puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per le copie).', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166296&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '41852329-4410-48d8-81e6-1d744612d623', 'multiverseId': 166296}, 'multiverseid': 166296}, {'name': '時間の亀裂', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e0f8b7ef-ad3d-475d-bd6e-3a543e3aa3bc'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Fissura Temporal', 'text': 'Devolve a permanente alvo para a mão de seu dono.\\nRajada (Quando você jogar esta mágica, faça uma cópia dela para cada mágica jogada antes dela neste turno. Você pode escolher novos alvos para as cópias.)', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166439&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2ebca9bb-988d-48bf-9c10-6ab7bbd10f64', 'multiverseId': 166439}, 'multiverseid': 166439}]", '[{\'name\': \'Zusätzliche Arme\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn die verzauberte Kreatur angreift, fügt sie einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreaturenverzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Vielleicht hätten ihnen zusätzliche Köpfe mehr geholfen." —Hügelkenner\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166049&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2a71c44-728f-419c-9f56-24bfd3cf0683\', \'multiverseId\': 166049}, \'multiverseid\': 166049}, {\'name\': \'Brazos extra\', \'text\': \'Siempre que la criatura encantada ataque, hace 2 puntos de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Encantar criatura\', \'flavor\': \'"Quizá les habría sido más útil tener cabezas extra". Explorador de las estribaciones\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166622&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b7cf7b6-fa26-4265-98f4-fcd6b66e0451\', \'multiverseId\': 166622}, \'multiverseid\': 166622}, {\'name\': \'Bras supplémentaires\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que la créature enchantée attaque, elle inflige 2 blessures à une cible, créature ou joueur.\', \'type\': \'Enchanter : créature\', \'flavor\': "« Il s\'en serait peut-être mieux sorti avec une tête supplémentaire. » —Guide des contreforts", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166192&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfbaaa2d-668b-4b11-a1e9-531d358ea561\', \'multiverseId\': 166192}, \'multiverseid\': 166192}, {\'name\': \'Braccia Extra\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta la creatura incantata attacca, infligge 2 danni a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Incanta Creatura\', \'flavor\': \'"Forse gli sarebbero state più utili delle teste aggiuntive". —Guida della Collina\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166335&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22b3e503-a4ac-4787-8e99-30256ab3c4c1\', \'multiverseId\': 166335}, \'multiverseid\': 166335}, {\'name\': \'追加武装\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'719d6284-d01d-48a3-8c45-46b1a9aedd60\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Braços Extras\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que a criatura encantada atacar, ela causa 2 pontos de dano à criatura alvo ou ao jogador alvo.\', \'type\': \'Encantar Criatura\', \'flavor\': \'"Talvez cabeças extras lhes fossem mais úteis." —Guia do Sopé\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166478&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f0bebd8-53ad-41b6-b582-a8b021aa5f3b\', \'multiverseId\': 166478}, \'multiverseid\': 166478}]', '[{\'name\': \'Überfall-Kommandant\', \'text\': \'Wälder, die du kontrollierst, sind 1/1 grüne Elf-Kreaturen, die auch noch Länder sind.\\n{1}{G}, opfere einen Elf: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +3/+3 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166068&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd929724-f6ae-4077-82bf-6905e94f45b6\', \'multiverseId\': 166068}, \'multiverseid\': 166068}, {\'name\': \'Comandante de emboscada\', \'text\': \'Los bosques que controlas son criaturas Elfo verde 1/1 que siguen siendo tierras.\\n{1}{G}, sacrificar un Elfo: La criatura objetivo obtiene +3/+3 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166641&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'faf23769-65e9-434f-990e-ec475fc54466\', \'multiverseId\': 166641}, \'multiverseid\': 166641}, {\'name\': "Commandant d\'embuscade", \'text\': "Les forêts que vous contrôlez sont des créatures 1/1 vertes Elfe, mais restent toujours des terrains.\\n{1}{G}, Sacrifiez un elfe : La créature ciblée gagne +3/+3 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166211&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10c9fc49-c1a7-49a9-a3fc-47b0ccd7cbfb\', \'multiverseId\': 166211}, \'multiverseid\': 166211}, {\'name\': \'Capo Imboscata\', \'text\': \'Le foreste che controlli sono creature Elfo 1/1 verdi che sono ancora terre.\\n{1}{G}, Sacrifica un Elfo: La creatura bersaglio prende +3/+3 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166354&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d93bf7b-aac5-4801-9b6b-4e6f6730731d\', \'multiverseId\': 166354}, \'multiverseid\': 166354}, {\'name\': \'待ち伏せ司令官\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'102a99d9-2b53-4132-b51e-7ad8011e238a\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Comandante de Emboscada\', \'text\': \'As florestas que você controla são criaturas verdes 1/1 do tipo Elfo que ainda contam como terrenos.\\n{1}{G}, Sacrifique um Elfo: A criatura alvo recebe +3/+3 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=166497&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78a655bd-7400-43ff-9005-7d062ed862b6\', \'multiverseId\': 166497}, \'multiverseid\': 166497}]']
printings: ['10E', '2XM', '40K', '8ED', '9ED', 'A25', 'AFC', 'AKH', 'AKR', 'ARC', 'BBD', 'C13', 'C14', 'C15', 'C16', 'C17', 'C18', 'C19', 'C20', 'C21', 'CLB', 'CM1', 'CM2', 'CMA', 'CMD', 'CMM', 'CN2', 'CNS', 'CSP', 'DD1', 'DD2', 'DDD', 'DDE', 'DDG', 'DDI', 'DDK', 'DDN', 'DDO', 'DDS', 'DDU', 'DMR', 'DOM', 'DPA', 'DRB', 'E01', 'EMA', 'EVG', 'F04', 'F06', 'F07', 'F08', 'F16', 'G07', 'G08', 'G09', 'GN3', 'GNT', 'GVL', 'H09', 'HA5', 'HOP', 'IMA', 'J21', 'J22', 'JMP', 'JVC', 'KHC', 'LCC', 'LTC', 'M10', 'M12', 'M13', 'M20', 'M21', 'MH1', 'MH2', 'MIC', 'MKC', 'MMA', 'MOC', 'MP2', 'NCC', 'NEC', 'ONC', 'OTC', 'P02', 'P30A', 'PAL03', 'PANA', 'PD3', 'PDOM', 'PIP', 'PLST', 'PPRO', 'PRM', 'PS11', 'PSAL', 'PSCG', 'PZ1', 'SCD', 'SCG', 'SLD', 'STA', 'TD0', 'TSB', 'V14', 'V16', 'VMA', 'VOC', 'WC03', 'WC04', 'WHO', 'WOC']
original_text: ["(Walls can't attack.)\\nFlying\\nWhen Ageless Sentinels blocks, its creature type becomes Giant Bird. (It's no longer a Wall. This effect doesn't end at end of turn.)", "All morph costs cost {2} more. (This doesn't affect the cost to play creatures face down.)", "Ancient Ooze's power and toughness are each equal to the total converted mana cost of other creatures you control.", 'Any number of target players each discards cards from his or her hand equal to the highest converted mana cost among permanents you control.', 'Any number of target players each gains life equal to the highest converted mana cost among permanents you control.', 'As an additional cost to play Chill Haunting, remove X creature cards in your graveyard from the game.\\nTarget creature gets -X/-X until end of turn.', 'As an additional cost to play Skulltap, sacrifice a creature.\\nDraw two cards.', "At the beginning of each player's upkeep, Sulfuric Vortex deals 2 damage to that player.\\nIf a player would gain life, that player gains no life instead.", "At the beginning of each player's upkeep, that player sacrifices a non-Zombie creature.\\nAt end of turn, if no creatures are in play, sacrifice Call to the Grave.", "At the beginning of your upkeep, Form of the Dragon deals 5 damage to target creature or player.\\nAt the end of each turn, your life total becomes 5.\\nCreatures without flying can't attack you.", "Attacking doesn't cause Noble Templar to tap.\\nPlainscycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card from your hand: Search your library for a plains card, reveal it, and put it into your hand. Then shuffle your library.)", 'Beast spells you play cost {1} less to play.\\n{1}{G}: Regenerate target Beast.', "Bladewing's Thrall has flying as long as you control a Dragon.\\nWhen a Dragon comes into play, you may return Bladewing's Thrall from your graveyard to play.", "Carbonize deals 3 damage to target creature or player. That creature can't be regenerated this turn. If the creature would be put into a graveyard this turn, remove it from the game instead.", "Carrion Feeder can't block.\\nSacrifice a creature: Put a +1/+1 counter on Carrion Feeder.", 'Choose one You gain 6 life; or prevent the next 6 damage that would be dealt to target creature this turn.', 'Claws of Wirewood deals 3 damage to each creature with flying and each player.\\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card from your hand: Draw a card.)', 'Cleric spells you play cost {W}{B} less to play. This effect reduces only the amount of colored mana you pay. (For example, if you play a Cleric with mana cost {1}{W}, it costs {1} to play.)', "Counter target activated or triggered ability. (Mana abilities can't be countered.)", 'Counter target spell if its converted mana cost is less than or equal to the highest converted mana cost among permanents you control.', 'Counter target spell unless its controller pays {2}.\\nStorm (When you play this spell, copy it for each spell played before it this turn. You may choose new targets for the copies.)', "Creature spells you play that share a creature type with Mistform Warchief cost {1} less to play.\\n{T}: Mistform Warchief's type becomes the creature type of your choice until end of turn.", 'Creature spells you play with converted mana cost 6 or more cost {2} less to play.', "Destroy all creatures. They can't be regenerated. Draw a card for each creature destroyed this way.\\nCycling {3}{B}{B}\\nWhen you cycle Decree of Pain, all creatures get -2/-2 until end of turn.", 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment.\\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card from your hand: Draw a card.)', 'Dragon spells you play cost {2} less to play.', 'Draw cards equal to the highest converted mana cost among permanents you control.', "Enchanted creature doesn't untap during its controller's untap step.\\nWhen damage is dealt to enchanted creature, destroy it.", "Enchanted creature gets +1/+0 and has fear. (It can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)\\nWhen a creature with converted mana cost 6 or more comes into play, you may return Dragon Shadow from your graveyard to play enchanting that creature.", 'Enchanted creature gets +1/+1 and has trample.\\nWhen a creature with converted mana cost 6 or more comes into play, you may return Dragon Fangs from your graveyard to play enchanting that creature.', "Enchanted creature gets +1/+2 and attacking doesn't cause it to tap.\\nWhen a creature with converted mana cost 6 or more comes into play, you may return Dragon Scales from your graveyard to play enchanting that creature.", 'Enchanted creature gets +2/+2 for each other creature in play that shares a creature type with it.', "Enchanted creature gets +3/+3 as long as it's a Zombie. Otherwise, it gets -3/-3.", 'Enchanted creature has flying.\\nCycling {1}{U} ({1}{U}, Discard this card from your hand: Draw a card.)\\nWhen a creature with converted mana cost 6 or more comes into play, you may return Dragon Wings from your graveyard to play enchanting that creature.', 'Enchanted creature has haste.\\noo\\nR Enchanted creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn.\\nWhen a creature with converted mana cost 6 or more comes into play, you may return Dragon Breath from your graveyard to play enchanting that creature.', 'First strike, protection from red', 'Flying, protection from Dragons', 'Flying, protection from green', 'Flying, trample\\nDouble strike (This creature deals both first-strike and regular combat damage.)\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Dragon Tyrant unless you pay {R}{R}{R}{R}.\\n{R}: Dragon Tyrant gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\nIslandcycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card from your hand: Search your library for an island card, reveal it, and put it into your hand. Then shuffle your library.)', 'Flying\\nMorph {3}{W} (You may play this face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)\\nWhen Aven Liberator is turned face up, target creature you control gains protection from the color of your choice until end of turn.', 'Flying\\nPrevent all damage that would be dealt to Dawn Elemental.', 'Flying\\nWhen Bladewing the Risen comes into play, you may return target Dragon card from your graveyard to play.\\n{B}{R}: All Dragons get +1/+1 until end of turn.', "Flying\\nWhen Death's-Head Buzzard is put into a graveyard from play, all creatures get -1/-1 until end of turn.", 'Flying\\nWhenever Dragon Mage deals combat damage to a player, each player discards his or her hand and draws seven cards.', "Flying\\nWhenever Mercurial Kite deals combat damage to a creature, tap that creature. It doesn't untap during its controller's next untap step.", "Flying\\nWhenever Xantid Swarm attacks, defending player can't play spells this turn.", 'Flying\\nWhenever a creature dealt damage by Soul Collector this turn is put into a graveyard, return that card to play under your control.\\nMorph {B}{B}{B} (You may play this face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)', 'Flying\\nWhenever a creature is turned face up, put a +1/+1 counter on Aven Farseer.', 'Flying\\n{3}{U}: Tap all creatures with toughness 2 or less.\\n{3}{U}: All other creatures lose flying until end of turn.', 'Flying\\n{3}{W}{W}: Return Eternal Dragon from your graveyard to your hand. Play this ability only during your upkeep.\\nPlainscycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card from your hand: Search your library for a plains card, reveal it, and put it into your hand. Then shuffle your library.)', 'Forestcycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card from your hand: Search your library for a forest card, reveal it, and put it into your hand. Then shuffle your library.)', 'Forests you control are 1/1 green Elf creatures that are still lands.\\n{1}{G}, Sacrifice an Elf: Target creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn.', 'Goblin Brigand attacks each turn if able.', 'Goblin War Strike deals damage equal to the number of Goblins you control to target player.', 'Goblin spells you play cost {1} less to play.\\nGoblins you control have haste.', "Haste\\nAt the beginning of each player's upkeep, that player untaps Karona, False God and gains control of it.\\nWhenever Karona attacks, creatures of the type of your choice get +3/+3 until end of turn.", 'If damage would be dealt to you, put that many depletion counters on Force Bubble instead.\\nWhen there are four or more depletion counters on Force Bubble, sacrifice it.\\nAt end of turn, remove all depletion counters from Force Bubble.', "Mana pools don't empty at the end of phases or turns. (This effect stops mana burn.)", "Morph {0} (You may play this face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)\\nWhen Proteus Machine is turned face up, its type becomes the creature type of your choice. (This effect doesn't end at end of turn.)", 'Morph {1}{U}{U} (You may play this face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)\\nWhen Riptide Survivor is turned face up, discard two cards from your hand, then draw three cards.', 'Morph {2}{G}{G} (You may play this face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)\\nWhen Woodcloaker is turned face up, target creature gains trample until end of turn.', "Morph {3}{W}{W} (You may play this face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)\\nWhen Karona's Zealot is turned face up, all damage that would be dealt to it this turn is dealt to target creature instead.", 'Morph {5}{G}{G} (You may play this face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)\\nWhen Root Elemental is turned face up, you may put a creature card from your hand into play.', 'Morph {U} (You may play this face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)', 'Morph {W} (You may play this face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)\\nWhen Frontline Strategist is turned face up, prevent all combat damage non-Soldiers would deal this turn.', 'Morph—\\nDiscard a Zombie card from your hand. (You may play this face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)', 'Morph—\\nPay 5 life. (You may play this face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)', "Morph—\\nReturn a Bird you control to its owner's hand. (You may play this face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)", 'Morph—\\nSacrifice two mountains. (You may play this face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)\\nWhen Skirk Volcanist is turned face up, it deals 3 damage divided as you choose among any number of target creatures.', 'Pay 3 life: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.', "Players can't cycle cards.", 'Put X 4/4 white Angel creature tokens with flying into play.\\nCycling {2}{W}\\nWhen you cycle Decree of Justice, you may pay {X}. If you do, put X 1/1 white Soldier creature tokens into play.', 'Put a 4/4 green Beast creature token into play.\\nStorm (When you play this spell, copy it for each spell played before it this turn.)', 'Put four +1/+1 counters on each creature you control.\\nCycling {4}{G}{G}\\nWhen you cycle Decree of Savagery, you may put four +1/+1 counters on target creature.', "Put target permanent an opponent controls on top of its owner's library. That opponent may put an artifact, creature, enchantment, or land card from his or her hand into play.", 'Rain of Blades deals 1 damage to each attacking creature.', 'Remove all artifacts, creatures, lands, graveyards, and hands from the game.\\nCycling {5}{R}{R}\\nWhen you cycle Decree of Annihilation, destroy all lands.', "Remove all permanents from the game. As long as any of those cards remain removed from the game, at the beginning of each player's upkeep, that player returns one of the removed cards he or she owns to play.", 'Remove target enchantment from the game.\\nCycling {3} ({3}, Discard this card from your hand: Draw a card.)', "Return an Elf you control to its owner's hand: Untap target creature. Play this ability only once each turn.", 'Return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.\\nStorm (When you play this spell, copy it for each spell played before it this turn. You may choose new targets for the copies.)', "Return target permanent to its owner's hand.\\nStorm (When you play this spell, copy it for each spell played before it this turn. You may choose new targets for the copies.)", 'Reveal the first card you draw each turn. Whenever you reveal a creature card this way, draw a card.', 'Scattershot deals 1 damage to target creature.\\nStorm (When you play this spell, copy it for each spell played before it this turn. You may choose new targets for the copies.)', 'Search your library for a Dragon card and put it into play. Then shuffle your library.\\nStorm (When you play this spell, copy it for each spell played before it this turn.)', 'Search your library for a basic land card, reveal that card, and put it into your hand. Then shuffle your library.\\nStorm (When you play this spell, copy it for each spell played before it this turn.)', 'Search your library for a card, shuffle your library, then put that card third from the top.', 'Shuffle your library. Then remove the top card of your library from the game. Until end of turn, you may play it as though it were in your hand without paying its mana cost. (If it has X in its mana cost, X is 0.)\\nStorm (When you play this spell, copy it for each spell played before it this turn.)', 'Soldier spells you play cost {1} less to play.\\nSoldiers you control get +1/+2.', 'Spark Spray deals 1 damage to target creature or player.\\nCycling {R} ({R}, Discard this card from your hand: Draw a card.)', 'Target creature gets +1/+2 until end of turn.\\nStorm (When you play this spell, copy it for each spell played before it this turn. You may choose new targets for the copies.)', 'Target creature gets +X/+0 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +X/+X until end of turn, where X is the highest converted mana cost among permanents you control.', 'Target player discards two cards.\\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card from your hand: Draw a card.)', 'Target player loses 2 life and you gain 2 life.\\nStorm (When you play this spell, copy it for each spell played before it this turn. You may choose new targets for the copies.)', 'Target player loses life equal to the damage already dealt to him or her this turn.', 'Target player puts the top three cards of his or her library into his or her graveyard.\\nStorm (When you play this spell, copy it for each spell played before it this turn. You may choose new targets for the copies.)', 'Target player sacrifices a permanent.', 'Target player sacrifices an attacking creature.\\nStorm (When you play this spell, copy it for each spell played before it this turn.)', 'The controller of enchanted creature sacrifices it at the end of his or her turn.', 'Torrent of Fire deals damage equal to the highest converted mana cost among permanents you control to target creature or player.', 'Trample\\nMorph {4}{G}{G}{G} (You may play this face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)', "Treetop Scout can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.", 'Uncontrolled Infestation can enchant only a nonbasic land.\\nWhen enchanted land becomes tapped, destroy it.', 'Until end of turn, lands you control gain "{T}: Add one mana of any color to your mana pool."', 'When Day of the Dragons comes into play, remove all creatures you control from the game. Then put that many 5/5 red Dragon creature tokens with flying into play.\\nWhen Day of the Dragons leaves play, sacrifice all Dragons you control. Then return the removed cards to play under your control.', 'When Fierce Empath comes into play, you may search your library for a creature card with converted mana cost 6 or more, reveal it, and put it into your hand. Then shuffle your library.', 'When Parallel Thoughts comes into play, search your library for seven cards, remove them from the game in a face-down pile, and shuffle that pile. Then shuffle your library.\\nIf you would draw a card, you may instead put the top card of the pile you removed into your hand.', 'When Siege-Gang Commander comes into play, put three 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens into play.\\n{1}{R}, Sacrifice a Goblin: Siege-Gang Commander deals 2 damage to target creature or player.', "When enchanted creature is turned face up, destroy it. It can't be regenerated.", 'Whenever Goblin Psychopath attacks or blocks, flip a coin. If you lose the flip, the next time it would deal combat damage this turn, it deals that damage to you instead.', 'Whenever Nefashu attacks, up to five target creatures each get -1/-1 until end of turn.', 'Whenever Raven Guild Master deals combat damage to a player, that player removes the top ten cards of his or her library from the game.\\nMorph {2}{U}{U} (You may play this face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)', 'Whenever Vengeful Dead or another Zombie is put into a graveyard from play, each opponent loses 1 life.', 'Whenever a Cleric you control becomes the target of a spell or ability, it gets +0/+2 until end of turn.', 'Whenever a creature comes into play, destroy it.\\n{0}: Destroy Lethal Vapors. You skip your next turn. Any player may play this ability.', 'Whenever a creature is put into a graveyard from play, tap or untap all creatures that share a creature type with it.', 'Whenever a creature is turned face up, Bonethorn Valesk deals 1 damage to target creature or player.', 'Whenever a creature is turned face up, you may draw a card.', 'Whenever a player plays a spell with converted mana cost 3 or less, Pyrostatic Pillar deals 2 damage to that player.', 'Whenever a player plays a spell, you may put a +1/+1 counter on Forgotten Ancient.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may move any number of +1/+1 counters from Forgotten Ancient onto other creatures.', 'Whenever a spell or ability is put onto the stack, reselect its target at random if it has a single target. (Select from among all legal targets.)', 'Whenever an opponent plays a spell, counter that spell and put a depletion counter on Decree of Silence. If there are three or more depletion counters on Decree of Silence, sacrifice it.\\nCycling {4}{U}{U}\\nWhen you cycle Decree of Silence, you may counter target spell.', 'Whenever enchanted creature attacks, it deals 2 damage to target creature or player.', 'Whenever enchanted creature deals combat damage to a player, you may search your library for a basic land card and put that card into play tapped. Then shuffle your library.', 'Whenever enchanted creature deals damage, Guilty Conscience deals that much damage to enchanted creature.', 'Whenever you play a creature spell with converted mana cost 6 or more, put three +1/+1 counters on Kurgadon.', "You can't be the target of spells or abilities this turn.\\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card from your hand: Draw a card.)", "You can't play Rock Jockey if you played a land this turn.\\nYou can't play lands if you played Rock Jockey this turn.", 'Zombie spells you play cost {1} less to play.\\nZombies you control get +2/+1.', '{1}{W}: The next 1 damage that would be dealt to Zealous Inquisitor this turn is dealt to target creature instead.', '{2}{B}{B}: Target creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn. Put a +1/+1 counter on Consumptive Goo.', '{2}{W}, {T}: Put a trap counter on target land you control.\\nSacrifice a land with a trap counter on it: Trap Digger deals 3 damage to target attacking creature without flying.', '{3}, {T}, Sacrifice Ark of Blight: Destroy target land.', "{3}: Search your library for a Sliver card, reveal that card, and put it into your hand. Then shuffle your library.\\n{3}: Gain control of target Sliver. (This effect doesn't end at end of turn.)", '{3}{U}{U}: Turn Mischievous Quanar face down.\\nMorph {1}{U}{U} (You may play this face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)\\nWhen Mischievous Quanar is turned face up, copy target instant or sorcery spell. You may choose new targets for that copy.', '{B}: Regenerate Twisted Abomination.\\nSwampcycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card from your hand: Search your library for a swamp card, reveal it, and put it into your hand. Then shuffle your library.)', '{R}: Chartooth Cougar gets +1/+0 until end of turn.\\nMountaincycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card from your hand: Search your library for a mountain card, reveal it, and put it into your hand. Then shuffle your library.)', '{T}: Add {2} to your mana pool. Play this ability only if you control five or more lands.', '{T}: Add {G}{G}{G} to your mana pool.\\nForestcycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card from your hand: Search your library for a forest card, reveal it, and put it into your hand. Then shuffle your library.)', "{U}: Untap enchanted creature.\\n{U}: Enchanted creature gains flying until end of turn.\\n{U}: Enchanted creature can't be the target of spells or abilities this turn.\\n{1}: Enchanted creature gets +1/-1 or -1/+1 until end of turn.", '{X}{B}, {T}: Target player reveals X cards from his or her hand and you choose one of them. That player discards that card. Play this ability only any time you could play a sorcery.']
